property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0587-9355
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-2504-3379
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7274-5533
