[Term]
id: FBbt:00000211
name: embryonic/larval tracheal section
alt_id: FBbt:00005575
def: "Section of the larval tracheal system from its maturation in late embryonic stages, to its degeneration/transformation during metamorphosis." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7073-9172]
subset: cur
synonym: "embryonic/larval trachea" RELATED []

[Term]
id: FBbt:00000212
name: embryonic/larval tracheal dorsal trunk
alt_id: FBbt:00005577
def: "The main airway of the larval/embryonic tracheal system, linking its metameric units and spanning the length of the animal from the anterior spiracle in the prothoracic segment to the posterior spiracle in A8 on the same side. There are two per larva, left and right." [FlyBase:FBrf0064787]
