[Term]
id: FBbt:00000394
name: pharyngeal tracheal branch
def: "Embryonic/larval trachea that arises from a bifurcation of the cerebropharyngeal branch and targets (tracheates) the pharynx." [FlyBase:FBrf0064787]
comment: To note that the dorsal cervical anterior pupal trachea (FBbt:00002966) corresponds to the pupal cerebral branch, not the pharyngeal branch, following figure 23 in of Manning and Krasnow (1993) and figure 2 of Whitten (1957) - FBrf0011558.
