[Term]
id: FBbt:00000395
name: cerebral tracheal branch
def: "Anteriorly oriented, embryonic/larval trachea that arises from a bifurcation of the cerebropharyngeal branch and targets (tracheates) the brain." [FlyBase:FBrf0064787]
comment: To note that the dorsal cervical posterior pupal trachea (FBbt:00002968) corresponds to the pupal pharyngeal branch, not the pharyngeal branch, following figure 23 in of Manning and Krasnow (1993) and figure 2 of Whitten (1957) - FBrf0011558.
subset: cur
