[Term]
id: FBbt:00001446
name: larval neuron
def: "Neuron that is part of the larval nervous system. Neurons with functional roles in the larva are born during the embryonic phase of neurogenesis and further neurons, with adult-specific roles, are born during the postembryonic phase, which begins during larval development (Lacin and Truman, 2016)." [FlyBase:FBrf0090460, FlyBase:FBrf0098344, FlyBase:FBrf0231327]
comment: This includes immature secondary neurons that are found in the larva - https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705.
subset: cur
synonym: "embryonic/larval neuron" EXACT []

[Term]
id: FBbt:00001447
name: larval DA1 motor neuron
def: "Motor neuron that is born from the first GMC to bud from neuroblast NB1-1 (GMC1-1a) in thoracic and abdominal segments and is part of the Notch OFF hemilineage (Skeath and Doe, 1998). It has a large round cell body that sits at the dorsal surface of the CNS, in the next anterior segment to the muscle it innervates, just posterior to the posterior commissure and longitudinal connective (Schmid et al., 1999; Zarin and Labrador, 2019). It innervates dorsal acute muscle 1 (DA1; muscle 1) (Landgraf et al., 1997). It expresses even-skipped (Manning et al., 2012)." [FlyBase:FBrf0064795, FlyBase:FBrf0099344, FlyBase:FBrf0102831, FlyBase:FBrf0112030, FlyBase:FBrf0219785, FlyBase:FBrf0245882]
comment: Not present in MN neuromere (lack of NB1-1) or LB neuromere (apoptosis of precursor) or MX neuromere (precursor cell appears to differentiate into a different type) (Rickert et al., 2018 - FBrf0238045). Present in A8 and A9 (Birkholz et al., 2013 - FBrf0221210).
subset: cur
synonym: "1-1a1" RELATED []
synonym: "aCC motoneuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0112030]
synonym: "aCC neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0112030]
synonym: "anterior corner cell" EXACT []
synonym: "DA1 motor neuron" EXACT []
synonym: "MN-DA1" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0208790]
synonym: "MN1-Ib" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0244727]
is_a: FBbt:00047105 ! Notch OFF hemilineage primary neuron
relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00111225 ! has soma location cell body rind of larval ventral nerve cord
relationship: RO:0002292 http://flybase.org/reports/FBgn0000606 ! expresses eve

[Term]
id: FBbt:00001448
name: pCC neuron
def: "Interneuron that is born from the first GMC to bud from neuroblast NB1-1 (GMC1-1a) and is part of the Notch ON hemilineage (Skeath and Doe, 1998). Its large, round cell body is located just posterior, medial and ventral to its sibling, the MN-DA1 (aCC) motor neuron (FBbt:00001447). It extends a neurite anteriorly along one of the longitudinal fascicles (Doe et al., 1988). It expresses even-skipped (Manning et al., 2012)." [FlyBase:FBrf0048756, FlyBase:FBrf0058118, FlyBase:FBrf0064795, FlyBase:FBrf0102831, FlyBase:FBrf0219785]
subset: cur
synonym: "1-1a2" RELATED []
