def: "Larval primary interneuron that is the most medial cell of the NB7-1 primary lineage (Schmid et al., 1999). It projects anteriorly in a medial fascicle of the ipsilateral connective, then across the anterior commissure and then anteriorly in the contralateral connective (Schmid et al., 1999)." [FlyBase:FBrf0105282, FlyBase:FBrf0112030]
