synonym: "sib" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0081448]
is_a: FBbt:00001451 ! RP neuron
relationship: RO:0002207 FBbt:00001438 ! directly develops from ganglion mother cell GMC4-2a

[Term]
id: FBbt:00001455
name: larval VL3/4 motor neuron
def: "Larval motor neuron of the NB3-1 lineage that innervates ventral longitudinal muscles 3 and/or 4 (Schmid et al., 1999, Mauss et al., 2009; Wang et al., 2022). In each A1 hemineuromere, there are two of these cells, which may innervate one or both muscles, in other hemineuromeres, these is only one of these cells, which innervates both muscles (Wang et al., 2022)." [FlyBase:FBrf0053781, FlyBase:FBrf0099344, FlyBase:FBrf0112030, FlyBase:FBrf0208790, FlyBase:FBrf0253566]
comment: Each of the two of these neurons in A1 hemineuromeres sometimes only innervate one of VL3 or VL4 (Wang et al., 2022).
subset: cur
