[Term]
id: FBbt:00001480
name: larval thoracic NB3-1 primary interneuron
def: "Larval primary interneuron that develops from neuroblast NB3-1 of the thorax. The projections of these interneurons form a fascicle that projects through the anterior commissure (Bossing et al., 1996). Unlike the fascicle formed by abdominal 3-1I, it does not show any appreciable bifurcation in the contralateral connective at embryonic stage 17 (Bossing et al., 1996)." [FlyBase:FBrf0090460]
comment: See Bossing et al. (1996) for a diagram.
subset: cur
