[Term]
id: FBbt:00001564
name: U neuron
def: "Larval motor neuron that is generated by neuroblast NB7-1, innervates a dorsal or lateral muscle and expresses eve (Cleary and Doe, 2006; Seroka et al., 2020). It is the Notch ON progeny of its ganglion mother cell (Seroka et al., 2020). There are five subtypes, each fasciculating with the intersegmental nerve and terminating on a different muscle according to birth order, with earlier born neurons terminating more distally (Meng et al., 2019)." [FlyBase:FBrf0102831, FlyBase:FBrf0190540, FlyBase:FBrf0241992, FlyBase:FBrf0243538, FlyBase:FBrf0246311]
synonym: "U motor neuron" EXACT []
synonym: "U/CQ neuron" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0167497]
is_a: FBbt:00007675 ! embryonic/larval motor neuron
is_a: FBbt:00047106 ! Notch ON hemilineage primary neuron
relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00111225 ! has soma location cell body rind of larval ventral nerve cord
relationship: RO:0002101 FBbt:00001997 ! fasciculates with larval intersegmental nerve
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00001380 ! develops from neuroblast NB7-1
relationship: RO:0002292 http://flybase.org/reports/FBgn0000606 ! expresses eve
property_value: IAO:0000233 "https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/1441" xsd:anyURI

[Term]
id: FBbt:00001565
name: obsolete U1 neuron
def: "Motor neuron that develops from the first ganglion mother cell that differentiates from neuroblast NB7-1 (Cleary and Doe, 2006). It has a bipolar morphology and a contralateral dendritic arbor (Seroka and Doe, 2019; Meng et al., 2019). Its axon innervates dorsal oblique muscle 1 (muscle 9) via a type Ib synapse (Meng et al., 2019)." [FlyBase:FBrf0190540, FlyBase:FBrf0241992, FlyBase:FBrf0243538]
comment: Obsoleted due to equivalence with DO1 motor neuron (Meng et al., 2019).
synonym: "MN9-Ib" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0243538]
property_value: IAO:0000233 "https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/1441" xsd:anyURI
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: FBbt:00110225

[Term]
id: FBbt:00001566
name: obsolete U2 neuron
def: "Motor neuron that develops from the second ganglion mother cell that differentiates from neuroblast NB7-1 (Cleary and Doe, 2006). It has a bipolar morphology and a contralateral dendritic arbor (Seroka and Doe, 2019; Meng et al., 2019). Its axon innervates dorsal oblique muscle 2 (muscle 10) via a type Ib synapse (Meng et al., 2019)." [FlyBase:FBrf0190540, FlyBase:FBrf0241992, FlyBase:FBrf0243538]
comment: Obsoleted due to equivalence with DO2 motor neuron (Meng et al., 2019).
synonym: "MN10-Ib" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0243538]
property_value: IAO:0000233 "https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/1441" xsd:anyURI
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: FBbt:00110228

[Term]
id: FBbt:00001567
name: larval DA2 motor neuron
def: "Larval motor neuron that innervates dorsal acute muscle 2 (muscle 2) via type Ib synapses (Landgraf et al., 1997; Hoang and Chiba, 2001; Meng et al., 2019). It is the third-born U neuron, developing from the third ganglion mother cell that differentiates from neuroblast NB7-1 (Cleary and Doe, 2006; Seroka et al., 2020). It has a monopolar morphology and its dendrites remain ipsilateral (Seroka and Doe, 2019; Meng et al., 2019)." [FlyBase:FBrf0099344, FlyBase:FBrf0132289, FlyBase:FBrf0190540, FlyBase:FBrf0241992, FlyBase:FBrf0243538, FlyBase:FBrf0244727, FlyBase:FBrf0246311]
comment: DA2 previously thought to correspond to U2 based on cell body position (personal communication from Matthias Landgraf - FBrf0221138). Now known to correspond to U3 (Zarin et al., 2019; Meng et al., 2019).
subset: cur
subset: EmbDevSlim
synonym: "MN2-Ib" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0243538]
synonym: "U3 motor neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0243538]
synonym: "U3 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0243538]
is_a: FBbt:00001564 ! U neuron
relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0000634 ! has characteristic unilateral

[Term]
id: FBbt:00001568
name: Usib neuron
def: "Notch OFF sibling neuron to a U neuron (MN-DO1, -DA2, -DO2, -DA3 and -LL1) deriving from a ganglion mother cell from the neuroblast 7-1 during embryogenesis (Seroka et al., 2020). Differentiation from the ganglion mother cell initially produces eve (FBgn0000606) positive cells. Whereas the U neurons (MN-DO1, -DA2, -DO2, -DA3 and -LL1) remain eve positive, the Usib cell rapidly downregulates eve." [FlyBase:FBrf0102831, FlyBase:FBrf0162056, FlyBase:FBrf0246311]
subset: cur
subset: EmbDevSlim
is_a: FBbt:00047105 ! Notch OFF hemilineage primary neuron
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00001380 ! develops from neuroblast NB7-1

