relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00000011 ! part of gnathal segment
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00049635 ! part of larval retrocerebral complex
relationship: RO:0002150 FBbt:00001724 ! continuous with prothoracic gland
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00001717 ! develops from corpus cardiacum primordium
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0046903 ! capable of secretion

