[Term]
id: FBbt:00001949
name: outer optic anlage medial proliferation zone
def: "Zone of proliferating neuroblasts of the medial outer optic anlage that forms at the end of the second instar (Hofbauer and Campos-Ortega, 1990). Neuroblast formation and proliferation begins at the medial edge, then broadens and moves laterally (Hofbauer and Campos-Ortega, 1990). Approximately 40000 neurons are produced in this region (Hofbauer and Campos-Ortega, 1990)." [FlyBase:FBrf0052913]
