comment: Obsoleted as thoracic and abdominal vesC neurons innervate different sense organs, so should not be considered to belong to the same segmentally-repeated type. Suggesting 'larval segmental nerve sensory neuron' as replacement as this is the closest shared parent of abdominal and thoracic (Keilin organ) vesC neurons.
