synonym: "larval vp5 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0089570, FlyBase:FBrf0183734]
is_a: FBbt:00005124 ! sensory neuron
relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00052122 ! has soma location larval ventral' sensory cluster of A1-7
relationship: RO:0002101 FBbt:00002197 ! fasciculates with larval abdominal segmental nerve
relationship: RO:0002101 FBbt:00007328 ! fasciculates with larval segmental nerve branch SNa of A1-7
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00001229 ! develops from ventral group abdominal external sensory organ precursor cell
relationship: RO:0013007 FBbt:00002903 ! has sensory dendrite in abdominal ventral campaniform sensillum vc5

[Term]
id: FBbt:00002051
name: v'es3 neuron
def: "Larval sensory neuron that innervates a ventral Kolbchen (Dambly-Chaudiere and Ghysen, 1986). There is one ventral Kolbchen in each thoracic hemisegment, innervated by three of these cells, found in the ventral' sensory cluster (Dambly-Chaudiere and Ghysen, 1986; Bodmer et al., 1989)." [FlyBase:FBrf0045359, FlyBase:FBrf0050677, FlyBase:FBrf0089570]
subset: cur
