[Term]
id: FBbt:00002055
name: larval ventral multidendritic neuron vdaA
def: "Larval class II multidendritic neuron with its soma in a relatively anterior position in the ventral vdaA-D cluster (Grueber et al., 2003; Orgogozo and Grueber, 2005; Veling et al., 2019). Its axon fasciculates with the segmental nerve (Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997)." [FlyBase:FBrf0089570, FlyBase:FBrf0148966, FlyBase:FBrf0157166, FlyBase:FBrf0183734, FlyBase:FBrf0244192]
