[Term]
id: FBbt:00002074
name: obsolete prothoracic lch3 neuron
def: "Neuron that innervates the triscolopidial chordotonal organ of the lateral sensory cluster of the larval prothorax (Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997). Unlike other prothoracic lateral cluster neurons, its axon fasciculates with the mesothoracic segmental nerve, rather than the prothoracic intersegmental nerve (Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997). There are three of these cells on each side (Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997)." [FlyBase:FBrf0089570]
comment: Obsoleted due to equivalence with FBbt:00002018 (lch3 neuron).
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: FBbt:00002018

