[Term]
id: FBbt:00002207
name: larval A1-7-innervating RP2 motor neuron
alt_id: FBbt:00110224
def: "Motor neuron that innervates the internal dorsal acute, dorsal oblique and LL1 muscles of larval abdominal segments A1 to A7 (Landgraf et al., 2003) via excitatory type Is boutons (Mauss et al., 2009). It exits the ventral nerve cord via the posterior root of the intersegmental nerve (ISN). Unlike other ISN neurons, its soma is located in the same segment as the muscles it innervates (Zarin and Labrador, 2019)." [FlyBase:FBrf0064795, FlyBase:FBrf0160715, FlyBase:FBrf0208790, FlyBase:FBrf0229965, FlyBase:FBrf0231328, FlyBase:FBrf0245882]
subset: cur
synonym: "A1-7 dorsal motor neuron" EXACT []
synonym: "A1-7 RP2 motor neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0064795, FlyBase:FBrf0229965]
synonym: "abdominal RP2 neuron" EXACT []
synonym: "larval A1-7 MNISN-Is" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0132289, FlyBase:FBrf0160715]

