[Term]
id: FBbt:00002215
name: larval A1-7-innervating VL3/4 motor neuron
alt_id: FBbt:00110248
def: "RP3 motor neuron that innervates the internal ventral longitudinal muscles 3 and 4 of A1-7. Its dendritic arborization occupies the intermediate domain of the ventral nerve cord neuropil. It exits the ventral nerve cord via the anterior root of the intersegmental nerve fasciculating with the ISNb nerve branch. Its soma is located in the segment anterior to the muscle it innervates (Landgraf et al., 1997). These neurons (at least in T3-A3 neuromeres) die during metamorphosis (Banerjee et al., 2016)." [FlyBase:FBrf0053781, FlyBase:FBrf0064795, FlyBase:FBrf0099344, FlyBase:FBrf0234013]
subset: cur
synonym: "abdominal RP3 neuron" BROAD []
