[Term]
id: FBbt:00002287
name: obsolete abdominal lateral ipsisegmental neuron
def: "Neuron of the embryonic or larval abdominal segment that is located laterally on each segment, anterior and posteriorly to the intersegmental nerve root. There are 5 of these cells: 3 anterior, and 2 posterior to the nerve root." [FlyBase:FBrf0054608]
comment: Obsoleted as only identified based on gene (ZFH) expression in Lai et al. (1991) and not properly characterized anywhere.
property_value: IAO:0000233 "https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/1912" xsd:anyURI
is_obsolete: true

