[Term]
id: FBbt:00002426
name: larval abdominal lateral multidendritic neuron ldaB
alt_id: FBbt:00002036
def: "Class III multidendritic neuron with its cell body in a lateral sensory cluster of a larval abdominal segment (Grueber et al., 2002). It develops from a common precursor with the abdominal lesB neuron (Brewster and Bodmer, 1995; Veling et al., 2019)." [FlyBase:FBrf0083795, FlyBase:FBrf0148966, FlyBase:FBrf0244192, FlyPNS:PNSdescription.html#ldaB]
comment: Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997, have this labelled as a tracheal dendritic neuron 'ltd' - but analysis in Grueber et al., 2002, shows this to be a class III da neuron. The name ltd is also sometimes used as a synonym for istd, an unrelated tracheal dendritic neuron found near the anterior segment boundary of A1-7.
subset: cur
synonym: "abdominal lateral multidendritic neuron ltd" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0089570]
synonym: "ltd" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0089570]
is_a: FBbt:00007274 ! larval multidendritic class III neuron
relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00007305 ! has soma location larval lateral sensory cluster of A1-7
relationship: RO:0002101 FBbt:00002319 ! fasciculates with larval abdominal intersegmental nerve
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00001205 ! develops from lateral abdominal dendritic arborizing neuron precursor cell

