[Term]
id: FBbt:00002442
name: abdominal dorsal bipolar neuron dbp
def: "Bipolar dendrite neuron in the dorsal sensory cluster of larval abdominal segments 1-7. It emits two longitudinal dendritic branches along dorsal acute muscle 3 (Williams and Shepherd, 1999), and fasciculates with the intersegmental nerve (Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997). It is a proprioceptor neuron (Heckscher et al., 2015). It has a large number of output synapses to A02a neurons (Schneider-Mizell et al., 2016) and also provides input to Jaam1 and Jaam3 neurons (Heckscher et al., 2015). It is cholinergic (Heckman and Doe, 2022)." [FlyBase:FBrf0050677, FlyBase:FBrf0085956, FlyBase:FBrf0089570, FlyBase:FBrf0108300, FlyBase:FBrf0229965, FlyBase:FBrf0231328, FlyBase:FBrf0255224, FlyPNS:PNSdescription.html#dbd]
comment: The two dorsal longitudinal dendrites may be joined between segments and establish the dorsal longitudinal nerve, DLN (Bodmer et al., 1989; Smith and Shepherd, 1996). The number of output synapses to A02a (35/35, L/R) in Schneider-Mizell et al. (2016) was estimated from the publication figures.
subset: cur
synonym: "dbd" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0229617, FlyBase:FBrf0229965, FlyPNS:PNSdescription.html#dbd]
synonym: "DLN" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0050677]
synonym: "dorsal bipolar dendrite neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0156020]
synonym: "dorsal bipolar neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0089570]
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0014055 ! capable of acetylcholine secretion, neurotransmission
relationship: RO:0002216 GO:0019230 ! capable of part of proprioception
relationship: RO:0013009 FBbt:00111656 ! sends synaptic output to cell larval Jaam1 neuron
relationship: RO:0013009 FBbt:00111658 ! sends synaptic output to cell larval Jaam3 neuron
relationship: RO:0013009 FBbt:00111662 ! sends synaptic output to cell larval A02a neuron

