[Term]
id: FBbt:00002573
name: larval abdominal ventral multidendritic neuron v'td1
alt_id: FBbt:00002059
def: "Tracheal associated multidendritic neuron of the ventral' cluster of segments A1-6 found ventral to v'td2 (Qian et al., 2018). Like other neurons of this cluster, it follows the SNa branch of the segmental nerve (Williams and Shepherd, 1999). After entering the ventral nerve cord, it projects anteriorly, reaching the subesophageal zone (Qian et al., 2018). It expresses chemosensory receptors (Qian et al., 2018)." [FlyBase:FBrf0089570, FlyBase:FBrf0108300, FlyBase:FBrf0238188, FlyPNS:PNSdescription.html#vtd1]
comment: Sometimes both v'td neurons in a hemisegment are collectively referred to as v'td2, as in Williams and Shepherd (1999).
subset: cur
synonym: "larval abdominal ventral multidendritic neuron vtd1" EXACT []
synonym: "v'td2" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0108300]
synonym: "vtd1/2" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0089570]
