def: "Median nerve that exits the dorsal part of abdominal neuromere 7 (Santos et al., 2006). It does not possess a swelling at its base (Santos et al., 2006), and bifurcates more distally than more anterior nerves, to form two transverse nerves (Gorczyca et al., 1994)." [FlyBase:FBrf0075005, FlyBase:FBrf0195119]
subset: cur
