[Term]
id: FBbt:00003051
name: adult dorsal tracheal branch
def: "Adult trachea that branches dorsally from the dorsal trunk. It tracheates the dorsal epidermis and dorsal vessel. Each dorsal branch connects the left and right dorsal trunks of the same tracheal metamere via the dorsal anastomosis. In the thorax, the dorsal branches connect the parenteric air sacs, which correspond to the enlarged dorsal trunks." [FlyBase:FBrf0011558, FlyBase:FBrf0064787, FlyBase:FBrf0186027]
subset: cur
synonym: "dorsal anastomose" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0011558]
synonym: "transverse dorsal commissure" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0034081, FlyBase:FBrf0186027]
is_a: FBbt:00052127 ! tracheal branch
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00003037 ! part of adult tracheal system
relationship: RO:0002150 FBbt:00003039 ! continuous with adult tracheal dorsal trunk

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003052
name: adult prothoracic dorsal tracheal branch
def: "Anterior dorsal branch of the adult thoracic trachea. It is a short and straight commissure that connects the left and right parenteric air sacs in the thorax. It passes above the alimentary canal." [FlyBase:FBrf0034081, FlyBase:FBrf0186027]
subset: cur
synonym: "adult dorsal branch 1" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0064787]
synonym: "prothoracic dorsal commissure" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0034081, FlyBase:FBrf0186027]
is_a: FBbt:00003051 ! adult dorsal tracheal branch
relationship: RO:0002150 FBbt:00003111 ! continuous with parenteric air sac

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003053
name: adult metathoracic dorsal tracheal branch
def: "Posterior dorsal branch of the adult thoracic trachea. It is a long and curved commissure that passes under the mesophragma and connects the left and right parenteric air sacs in the thorax. It passes above the alimentary canal." [FlyBase:FBrf0034081, FlyBase:FBrf0186027]
subset: cur
synonym: "adult dorsal branch 2" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0064787]
synonym: "metathoracic dorsal commissure" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0186027]
is_a: FBbt:00003051 ! adult dorsal tracheal branch
relationship: RO:0002150 FBbt:00003111 ! continuous with parenteric air sac

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003054
name: adult abdominal dorsal tracheal branch
def: "Dorsal tracheal branch of the adult abdominal segments that connects the left and right dorsal trunks. There are six abdominal dorsal branches, in segments 1 to 6." [FlyBase:FBrf0034081, FlyBase:FBrf0186027]
subset: cur
synonym: "abdominal dorsal commissure" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0186027]

