relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00003149 ! part of adult circulatory system

[Term]
id: FBbt:00003174
name: scutellar pulsatile organ
def: "A small band of muscle fibers that spans the angle where the scutellum joins a ridge running down to the base of the wing. It functions in the pumping of hemolymph." [FlyBase:FBrf0007734, FlyBase:FBrf0205292, FlyBase:FBrf0206946]
