id: FBbt:00003202
name: adult ventral oenocyte band
def: "Cluster of oenocytes spanning the ventral midline of the adult abdomen, interior to an abdominal sternite (Miller, 1950). There is one of these in each of abdominal segments 2-6 in females and 2-5 in males (Miller, 1950). It lies beneath, and may envelop, the ventral longitudinal muscles (Miller, 1950)." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
