def: "Muscle cell of a muscle that is part of the adult testis sheath." [https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092]
subset: cur
subset: FlyTed
intersection_of: FBbt:00003525 ! adult visceral muscle cell
intersection_of: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00004955 ! part of testis sheath
relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0060002 ! has characteristic male-specific

