[Term]
id: FBbt:00004027
name: bypass nerve
def: "Nerve extending between the entry points of the accessory pharyngeal nerve and the maxillary-labial nerve (Nayak and Singh, 1983). It forms a loop ventral to the brain, connecting the subesophageal ganglion and the tritocerebrum (Nayak and Singh, 1983)." [FlyBase:FBrf0074012]
subset: cur
synonym: "BYN" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0074012]
