def: "Adult sensory neuron that innervates the labellum. It fasciculates with the adult labial nerve and projects to the subesophageal zone (Nayak and Singh, 1985; Miyazaki and Ito, 2010). There are around 195 of these cells on each side (Nayak and Singh, 1985)." [FlyBase:FBrf0042883, FlyBase:FBrf0055600, FlyBase:FBrf0211916]
