[Term]
id: FBbt:00004505
name: ocellus
def: "A simple visual organ on the top of the adult head (Jean-Guillaume and Kumar, 2022). There are three of these per head, arranged in a triangle with one on the midline and the others slightly posterior and lateral (Jean-Guillaume and Kumar, 2022). They develop from the eye discs (Jean-Guillaume and Kumar, 2022)." [FlyBase:FBrf0166419, FlyBase:FBrf0255165]
subset: cur
subset: FB_gloss
is_a: FBbt:00007231 ! external sensillum
