[Term]
id: FBbt:00004729
name: wing
def: "A flight organ of the adult external thorax that is derived from a dorsal mesothoracic disc." [FBC:GG]
comment: This term considers the wing blade, margin and hinge as being part of the wing. Frequently, the term 'wing' is used by authors to refer to 'wing blade'. Please consider using wing blade terms instead when appropriate - https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092.
subset: cur
subset: FB_gloss
is_a: FBbt:00007000 ! appendage
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00003021 ! part of adult mesothoracic segment
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00004551 ! part of adult external thorax
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00001778 ! develops from wing disc

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004730
name: tegula
def: "The most proximal part of the anterior margin of the wing hinge. It is tightly packed with sensilla, bearing ~16 campaniform, 7 trichoid, 3 macrochaetae, 4 microchaetae." [FlyBase:FBrf0007734, FlyBase:FBrf0031004, https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7073-9172]
subset: cur
subset: FB_gloss
is_a: FBbt:00085378 ! section of wing margin
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00004731 ! part of wing hinge
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00027000 ! part of anterior wing margin
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00084730 ! develops from presumptive tegula

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004731
name: wing hinge
def: "The small plates and sclerites at the proximal part of the wing lending support to the costal and radial veins." [FlyBase:FBrf0166419]
subset: cur
subset: FB_gloss
synonym: "wing base" RELATED []
is_a: FBbt:00007010 ! multi-tissue structure
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00004729 ! part of wing
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00006033 ! develops from wing hinge primordium

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004732
name: wing sclerite
