relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00046042 ! develops from presumptive intervein

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004770
name: costal wing cell
def: "Anterior/proximal wing cell (intervein) region bounded by wing vein L1 posteriorly, the costal vein anteriorly and the humeral crossvein proximally." [FlyBase:FBim0000807, FlyBase:FBrf0007734, FlyBase:FBrf0066905]
comment: See FBrf0066905 == Lindsley and Zimm, 1992 for a good schematic identifying wing cells (intervein).
subset: cur
is_a: FBbt:00004769 ! wing cell
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00006015 ! part of wing blade

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004771
name: marginal wing cell
def: "Wing cell (intervein) region between wing vein L1, the costal vein (anterior wing margin) and wing vein L2 (Ferris, 1950; Lindsley and Zimm, 1992)." [FlyBase:FBim0000807, FlyBase:FBrf0007734, FlyBase:FBrf0066905]
comment: See FBrf0066905 == Lindsley and Zimm, 1992 for a good schematic identifying wing cells (intervein).
subset: cur
synonym: "A cell" RELATED []
is_a: FBbt:00004769 ! wing cell
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00006015 ! part of wing blade

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004772
name: submarginal wing cell
def: "Wing cell (intervein) region between L2 and L3 (Ferris, 1950; Lindsley and Zimm, 1992)." [FlyBase:FBim0000807, FlyBase:FBrf0007734, FlyBase:FBrf0066905]
comment: See FBrf0066905 == Lindsley and Zimm, 1992 for a good schematic identifying wing cells (intervein).
subset: cur
synonym: "B cell" RELATED []
is_a: FBbt:00004769 ! wing cell
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00006015 ! part of wing blade

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004773
name: posterior wing cell
def: "Distal wing cell (intervein) region posterior to wing vein L3 (Ferris, 1950; Lindsley and Zimm, 1992). There are three of these per wing (Ferris, 1950; Lindsley and Zimm, 1992)." [FlyBase:FBim0000807, FlyBase:FBrf0007734, FlyBase:FBrf0066905]
comment: See FBrf0066905 == Lindsley and Zimm, 1992 for a good schematic identifying wing cells (intervein).
subset: cur
is_a: FBbt:00004769 ! wing cell
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00006015 ! part of wing blade

[Term]
id: FBbt:00004774
