id: FBbt:00004892
name: pole granule
def: "Dense organelles found in the pole plasm. They are 0.2 to 0.5 micrometers in diameter, changing size during development. They lack a membrane and contain RNA granules, among other components." [FlyBase:FBrf0014742, FlyBase:FBrf0064781]
