id: FBbt:00004918
name: calyx of oviduct
def: "The anterior-most, cup-shaped region of the lateral oviduct (Kapelnikov et al., 2008; McQueen et al., 2022). Formed by the joining together of the individual pedicels (small tubes coming from the base of each ovariole) (McQueen et al., 2022)." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735, FlyBase:FBrf0207258, FlyBase:FBrf0253444]
