id: FBbt:00004923
name: spermathecal duct
def: "Duct connecting the capsule of the spermatheca to the uterus (McQueen et al., 2022). It opens into the uterine posterodorsal pouch, just posterior to the opening of the oviduct and close to the openings of the female accessory gland ducts (McQueen et al., 2022)." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735, FlyBase:FBrf0253444]
