is_a: FBbt:00007288 ! integumentary specialization
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00005024 ! part of tracheal system

[Term]
id: FBbt:00005055
name: digestive system
def: "Organ system comprising the alimentary canal and its associated organs, including the mouthparts, labellar and salivary glands and the Malpighian tubules (Miller, 1950)." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735]
