id: FBbt:00005063
name: hemocyte
def: "Blood cell of the circulatory system that is involved in the cellular immune response. It expresses Hemese, a pan-hemocyte marker (Tattikota et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0200434, FlyBase:FBrf0245741]
