[Term]
id: FBbt:00005127
name: optic lobe amacrine neuron
def: "Optic lobe intrinsic neuron without defined axons or dendrites, having processes with mixed pre- and post-synapses in approximately the same ratio throughout the cell (Matsliah et al., 2024). Some amacrine cells, such as CT1, have multiple compartmentalized, modular arborizations (Meier and Borst, 2019)." [FlyBase:FBrf0049410, FlyBase:FBrf0242197, FlyBase:FBrf0260545]
subset: cur
