[Term]
id: FBbt:00005350
name: stage P5 pupa
def: "Pupa following the expulsion of the oral armature of the larva until the Malpighian tubules have become prominent and green (Bainbridge and Bownes, 1981)." [FlyBase:FBrf0036849]
