relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00005353 ! develops from stage P6 pupa

[Term]
id: FBbt:00005355
name: stage P8 pharate adult
def: "Pharate adult from when the eye cup becomes yellow at its perimeter (Bainbridge and Bownes, 1981). The transparent pupal cuticle has separated from the underlying epidermis (Bainbridge and Bownes, 1981). Pale yellow pigmentation spreads across the eye and the eye becomes bright yellow (Bainbridge and Bownes, 1981). This stage ends when the eye starts to become amber (Bainbridge and Bownes, 1981)." [FlyBase:FBrf0036849]
comment: DEPRECATION WARNING.
subset: deprecated
