relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00005354 ! develops from stage P7 pupa

[Term]
id: FBbt:00005356
name: stage P9 pharate adult
def: "Pharate adult with eye color that is changing from yellow to amber, becoming a deep amber (Bainbridge and Bownes, 1981). This stage ends when the eye color starts to become pale pink (Bainbridge and Bownes, 1981)." [FlyBase:FBrf0036849]
comment: DEPRECATION WARNING.
subset: deprecated
