def: "Precursor structure that can be recognized based on its distinct morphology and will give rise to one or more differentiated structures (Tomancak et al., 2002; Hartenstein, 2004). It develops from an anlage and may contain smaller anlage and primordia that will produce substructures (Tomancak et al., 2002)." [FlyBase:FBrf0089570, FlyBase:FBrf0155831, FlyBase:FBrf0178740]
subset: cur
