relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00001075 ! develops from tip stomatogastric nervous system precursor
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00001079 ! develops from delaminating stomatogastric nervous system precursor
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00018003 ! develops from frontal ganglion primordium

[Term]
id: FBbt:00005669
name: embryonic hypocerebral ganglion
def: "Small ganglion of the embryonic stomatogastric nervous system. By stage 16 it is located on the left hand side of the embryo, between the two brain hemispheres and behind the supraesophageal commissure. It is more compact than the paraesophageal ganglion and occupies a more dorsal position. It contains approximately 10-12 neurons." [FlyBase:FBrf0078614, FlyBase:FBrf0089570]
subset: cur
is_a: FBbt:00005804 ! hypocerebral ganglion
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00001069 ! part of embryonic stomatogastric nervous system
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00001073 ! develops from intermediate vesicle of iSNSP
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00018004 ! develops from hypocerebral/paraesophageal ganglion primordium

