[Term]
id: FBbt:00007088
name: neural lamella
def: "Dense network of extracellular matrix that forms an acellular outer layer surrounding both the central and the peripheral nervous system (Stork et al., 2008; Meyer et al., 2014). Its main components are deposited by hemocytes (Martinek et al., 2008) and it can be remodeled by enzymes secreted from the underlying glial cells of the perineurium (Meyer et al., 2014)." [FlyBase:FBrf0058936, FlyBase:FBrf0202685, FlyBase:FBrf0205193, FlyBase:FBrf0226337]
comment: Neurilemma/neurolemma may refer to perineurium + neural lamella, but not fully clear in literature - https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705.
subset: cur
synonym: "basal lamina of the CNS" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0205193]
synonym: "neurilemma" RELATED []
synonym: "neurolemma" RELATED []
