relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00005094 ! part of central nervous system

[Term]
id: FBbt:00007118
name: embryonic/larval crepine
def: "Small synaptic neuropil domain of the larval protocerebrum that surrounds the medial lobe of the mushroom body (Pereanu et al., 2010; Hartenstein et al., 2015). It is the larval counterpart of the adult crepine (anterior inferior protocerebrum) (Pereanu et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0155900, FlyBase:FBrf0211016, FlyBase:FBrf0229672]
comment: Note - description of relative location of brain structures in this definition is based on Younossi-Hartenstein et al., 2003 description of the first instar larval brain and Pereanu et al., 2010 third instar larval brain.
