[Term]
id: FBbt:00007319
name: cardial cell
def: "Cell that forms the wall of the dorsal vessel. They are arranged in two medial rows connected by ventral and dorsal adhesion zones, leaving a central lumen (Medioni et al., 2008)." [FlyBase:FBrf0031012, FlyBase:FBrf0089570, FlyBase:FBrf0205728]
