[Term]
id: FBbt:00007575
name: aristal sensory neuron VP2
def: "Adult unilateral thermosensory neuron of the aristal sensillum with an axon that innervates antennal lobe glomerulus VP2 (Stocker et al., 1990; Benton et al., 2025). It has small, finger-like sensory endings (Budelli et al., 2019) and expresses the warmth-sensor Gr28b.d (Ni et al., 2013). It is transiently activated by temperature increases and transiently inhibited by temperature decreases (Budelli et al., 2019). In addition, it has increased steady state spiking at higher temperatures (Budelli et al., 2019). There are around 3-4 of these cells per hemisphere (Marin et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0051437, FlyBase:FBrf0213085, FlyBase:FBrf0222493, FlyBase:FBrf0241574, FlyBase:FBrf0246456, FlyBase:FBrf0262710]
synonym: "ArB" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0262710]
synonym: "aristal neuron (VP2)" EXACT [FlyBrain_NDB:10369]
synonym: "hot aristal neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0213085]
synonym: "hot cell" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0241574]
synonym: "VP2RN" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0246456]
synonym: "warm aristal neuron" EXACT []
synonym: "warm cell" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0227881]
synonym: "warm thermoreceptor cells in the arista" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0227881]

[Term]
id: FBbt:00007576
name: aristal sensory neuron VP3
def: "Adult unilateral thermosensory neuron with its sensory dendrite in an aristal sensillum and an axonal projection to antennal lobe glomerulus VP3 (Stocker et al., 1990; Alpert et al., 2020; Benton et al., 2025). It has large, elaborate sensory endings (Budelli et al., 2019). It is transiently activated by temperature decreases and transiently inhibited by temperature increases (Budelli et al., 2019). It expresses the cooling-specific Ir21a and the co-receptors Ir25a and Ir93a, with all three being required for sensitivity to cooling (Budelli et al., 2019). There are around 3-4 of these cells per hemisphere (Marin et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0051437, FlyBase:FBrf0213085, FlyBase:FBrf0241574, FlyBase:FBrf0246007, FlyBase:FBrf0246456, FlyBase:FBrf0262710]
synonym: "ArA" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0262710]
synonym: "aristal neuron (VP3)" EXACT [FlyBrain_NDB:10368]
synonym: "cold aristal neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0213085]
synonym: "cold cell" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0241574]
synonym: "cool aristal neuron" EXACT []
synonym: "cool cell" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0227881]
synonym: "cool thermoreceptor cells in the arista" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0227881]
synonym: "cooling cell" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0241574]
synonym: "VP3RNa" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0246456]
property_value: IAO:0000233 "https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/1353" xsd:anyURI

