[Term]
id: FBbt:00040000
name: adult antennal lobe projection neuron DC3 adPN
def: "Adult uniglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron from the ad neuroblast (ALad1) lineage whose dendrites mainly innervate antennal lobe glomerulus DC3. This is the sixth cell type to be generated post-embryonically by neuroblast ALad1 (Yu et al., 2010). The axons of these neurons innervate a small area at the anterior edge of the lateral horn, in a similar region to VL2a and VA1lm PNs. There are around three of these per hemisphere, they fasciculate with the medial antennal lobe tract and they are cholinergic (Bates et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0174482, FlyBase:FBrf0203179, FlyBase:FBrf0206335, FlyBase:FBrf0211729, FlyBase:FBrf0224383, FlyBase:FBrf0246460]
comment: For image, see FBrf0211729.
subset: olfactory_system_draft
synonym: "DC3 adPN" EXACT []
synonym: "iACT (DC3)" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0174482]
synonym: "mALT (DC3)" EXACT []
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00007053 ! sends synaptic output to region adult lateral horn
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00007385 ! sends synaptic output to region calyx of adult mushroom body
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7073-9172
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2009-11-06T04:52:19Z" xsd:dateTime

