[Term]
id: FBbt:00047040
name: adult ellipsoid body ring neuron R3p
def: "Ring neuron R3 that has axonal projections predominantly restricted to, and densely filling, the ellipsoid body inner posterior domain, with some projections extending anteriorly and entering the inner central domain (Omoto et al., 2018). Dendritic branches form microglomerular shapes in the posterior part of the inferior bulb (Omoto et al., 2018). Its activity increases the amount of daytime sleep (Yan et al., 2023)." [FlyBase:FBrf0240929, FlyBase:FBrf0255642]
