[Term]
id: FBbt:00047048
name: adult tubercle-inferior bulb neuron
def: "Neuron of the adult brain that has postsynapses mainly in the intermediate zone of the anterior optic tubercle, where it receives input from MC64 neurons (Omoto et al., 2017; Hulse et al., 2021). It has its presynapses in the inferior bulb, where it synapses onto R3 ring neurons (Omoto et al., 2017; Hulse et al., 2021). It is a secondary neuron that develops from the DALcl2 neuroblast (Omoto et al., 2017; Lovick et al., 2017)." [FlyBase:FBrf0235330, FlyBase:FBrf0236656, FlyBase:FBrf0254510]
synonym: "adult TuBui neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0235330]
synonym: "AOTU-BUi" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0248513]
synonym: "TuBu neuron terminating in inferior bulb" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0235330]
is_a: FBbt:00047047 ! adult tubercle-bulb neuron
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00051453 ! develops from larval DALcl2 tubercle-bulb neuron precursor
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00047045 ! receives synaptic input in region intermediate zone of anterior optic tubercle
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00100364 ! sends synaptic output to region inferior bulb
relationship: RO:0013008 FBbt:00051218 ! receives synaptic input from neuron medulla columnar neuron MC64
relationship: RO:0013009 FBbt:00003652 ! sends synaptic output to cell adult ellipsoid body ring neuron R3
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2020-02-17T16:15:41Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00047049
name: adult tubercle-superior bulb neuron
def: "Neuron of the adult brain that has postsynapses in the lateral zone of the anterior optic tubercle and presynapses in the superior bulb (Omoto et al., 2017). It is a secondary neuron that develops from the DALcl1 neuroblast (Omoto et al., 2017; Lovick et al., 2017). It receives input from medulla columnar MC61 neurons and different subtypes connect to different types of ring neuron (Hulse et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0235330, FlyBase:FBrf0236656, FlyBase:FBrf0254510]
synonym: "adult TuBus neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0235330]
synonym: "AOTU-BUs" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0248513]
synonym: "TuBu neuron terminating in superior bulb" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0235330]
is_a: FBbt:00047047 ! adult tubercle-bulb neuron
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00051452 ! develops from larval DALcl1 tubercle-bulb neuron precursor
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00047046 ! receives synaptic input in region lateral zone of anterior optic tubercle
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00100363 ! sends synaptic output to region superior bulb
relationship: RO:0013008 FBbt:00111641 ! receives synaptic input from neuron medulla columnar neuron MC61
relationship: RO:0013009 FBbt:00003649 ! sends synaptic output to cell adult ellipsoid body ring neuron
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2020-02-17T16:19:33Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00047050
name: adult tubercle-anterior bulb neuron
def: "Neuron of the adult brain that has postsynapses in the lateral part of the anterior optic tubercle, receiving input from medulla columnar MC61 neurons, and presynapses in the anterior bulb (Omoto et al., 2017; Hulse et al., 2021). It outputs onto ellipsoid body R4m neurons (Hulse et al., 2021). It is a secondary neuron that develops from the DALcl1 neuroblast (Omoto et al., 2017; Lovick et al., 2017)." [FlyBase:FBrf0235330, FlyBase:FBrf0236656, FlyBase:FBrf0254510]
comment: TuBu01 is the only hemibrain type with terminals in the anterior bulb (Hulse et al., 2021).
synonym: "adult tubercle-bulb neuron 01" EXACT []
synonym: "adult TuBua neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0235330]
synonym: "AOTU3-BUa" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0248513]
synonym: "TuBu neuron terminating in anterior bulb" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0235330]
is_a: FBbt:00047047 ! adult tubercle-bulb neuron
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00051452 ! develops from larval DALcl1 tubercle-bulb neuron precursor
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00047046 ! receives synaptic input in region lateral zone of anterior optic tubercle
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00100365 ! sends synaptic output to region anterior bulb
relationship: RO:0013008 FBbt:00111641 ! receives synaptic input from neuron medulla columnar neuron MC61
relationship: RO:0013009 FBbt:00007537 ! sends synaptic output to cell adult ellipsoid body ring neuron R4m
