[Term]
id: FBbt:00047105
name: Notch OFF hemilineage primary neuron
def: "Primary neuron belonging to a hemilineage that does not have active Notch signaling. In the larval ventral nerve cord, Notch OFF neurons tend to project to the ventral (sensory) neuropil and have distinct morphologies from their Notch ON counterparts in the same lineage (Mark et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0249021]
synonym: "B hemilineage primary neuron" EXACT []
intersection_of: FBbt:00047097 ! primary neuron
intersection_of: FBbt:00049540 ! Notch OFF hemilineage neuron
