relationship: RO:0002292 http://flybase.org/reports/FBgn0004652 ! expresses fru
relationship: RO:0013001 FBbt:00047137 ! has synaptic IO in region wing neuropil
relationship: RO:0013009 FBbt:00047244 ! sends synaptic output to cell muscle cell of wing axillary muscle hg1
