[Term]
id: FBbt:00047308
name: lateral dorsal abdominal tract
def: "Lateralmost of the three small dorsal tracts that connect the adult thoracic and abdominal neuromeres (Power, 1948; Court et al., 2020). It carries fibers between (at least) the metathoracic neuromere and the abdominal neuromere (Power, 1948)." [FlyBase:FBrf0007196, FlyBase:FBrf0246815]
synonym: "LDT" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0246815]
is_a: FBbt:00007426 ! fascicle
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00004052 ! part of adult ventral nerve cord
relationship: RO:0002131 FBbt:00110173 ! overlaps adult abdominal neuromere
relationship: RO:0002131 FBbt:00110176 ! overlaps adult metathoracic neuromere
relationship: RO:0002134 FBbt:00110173 ! innervates adult abdominal neuromere
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2021-01-13T09:21:02Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00047309
name: layer of mushroom body slice
def: "The intersection of a slice of the mushroom body with a layer of the mushroom body." [FlyBase:FBrf0227179]
is_a: FBbt:00040006 ! synaptic neuropil subdomain
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00047310 ! part of mushroom body slice
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00047311 ! part of mushroom body layer
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2018-06-21T09:45:29Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00047310
name: mushroom body slice
def: "Division of a mushroom body lobe along the length of the mushroom body lobe system (Pauls et al., 2010; Aso et al., 2014). Slices of the horizontal lobe are regions along the horizontal axis and slices of the vertical lobe are regions along the vertical axis (Pauls et al., 2010; Aso et al., 2014). Slices are defined by the innervation patterns of input and output neurons (Pauls et al., 2010; Aso et al., 2014)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211533, FlyBase:FBrf0227179]
synonym: "mushroom body compartment" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0248215]
synonym: "mushroom body segment" EXACT []
intersection_of: FBbt:00040069 ! synaptic neuropil segment
intersection_of: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00003688 ! part of lobe system of mushroom body
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2018-06-21T10:00:54Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00047311
name: mushroom body layer
def: "Division of a mushroom body lobe along the width of the mushroom body lobe system. Layers of the horizontal lobe are regions along the vertical axis and layers of the vertical lobe are regions along the horizontal axis." [FlyBase:FBrf0227179]
intersection_of: FBbt:00040008 ! synaptic neuropil layer
intersection_of: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00003688 ! part of lobe system of mushroom body
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2018-06-21T10:03:17Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00047312
name: adult uniglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron lPN
def: "An adult uniglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron that belongs to the dorsal (Notch OFF) hemilineage of neuroblast ALl1 (Lin et al., 2012; Lin et al., 2013; Bates et al., 2020). Most of these neurons have axons that fasciculate with the medial antennal lobe tract (mALT) and innervate the mushroom body calyx (via a collateral) and the lateral horn." [FlyBase:FBrf0141667, FlyBase:FBrf0146917, FlyBase:FBrf0205814, FlyBase:FBrf0211729, FlyBase:FBrf0219980, FlyBase:FBrf0221835, FlyBase:FBrf0246460]
comment: Lin et al. (2012) map PNs to Notch OFF hemilineage; classical lPNs belong to dorsal (l) hemilineage according to Bates et al. (2020), so inferring that dorsal (l) hemilineage is Notch OFF, ventral (l2) is ON - https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705.
synonym: "adult uniglomerular lAL PN" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0222962]
synonym: "adult uniglomerular lateral antennal lobe projection neuron" EXACT []
synonym: "adult uniglomerular lPN" EXACT []
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2018-06-22T08:40:38Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00047313
name: labellar multidendritic neuron
def: "Mechanosensory multidendritic neuron that innervates the labellum (Zhang et al., 2016). There is one of these innervating each of the two bilaterally symmetrical labella, extending to the bases of many, mainly L-type, labial sensilla (Zhang et al., 2016). This cell expresses the genes Transmembrane channel-like and Transmembrane protein 63, which are required for different aspects of its mechanosensory function (Zhang et al., 2016; Li and Montell, 2021). Its cell body is in the proximal part of the labellum and its axons project to the subesophageal zone, innervating a region distinct from that innervated by gustatory receptor neurons, such as those expressing Gr5a (Zhang et al., 2016)." [FlyBase:FBrf0233217, FlyBase:FBrf0248270, FlyBase:FBrf0248869]
synonym: "md-L neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0233217]
synonym: "multidendritic neuron in the labellum" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0233217]
is_a: FBbt:00005209 ! multidendritic neuron
relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00004531 ! has soma location labellum
relationship: RO:0002292 http://flybase.org/reports/FBgn0033259 ! expresses Tmem63
relationship: RO:0002292 http://flybase.org/reports/FBgn0267796 ! expresses Tmc
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00110639 ! sends synaptic output to region adult subesophageal zone
relationship: RO:0013007 FBbt:00004531 ! has sensory dendrite in labellum
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2018-06-22T12:18:42Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00047314
name: serotonergic LP neuron
def: "Serotonergic neuron whose cell body is located in the lateral protocerebrum. There is one cluster of these cells per hemisphere in the larva and three in the adult (Giang et al., 2011)." [FlyBase:FBrf0048551, FlyBase:FBrf0213697]
synonym: "serotonergic lateral protocerebrum neuron" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00005106 ! neuron
relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00003627 ! has soma location protocerebrum
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0060096 ! capable of serotonin secretion, neurotransmission
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2018-06-25T10:05:06Z" xsd:dateTime

