[Term]
id: FBbt:00047379
name: adult glutamatergic doublesex AbN (female) neuron
def: "Adult doublesex AbN neuron of the adult female that is also glutamatergic (Pavlou et al., 2016). Some of these neurons innervate the internal genitalia, including muscles of the uterus, spermathecal and parovarian ducts (Pavlou et al., 2016). Some of these neurons appear to be synapsed by the GABAergic AbN neurons (Pavlou et al., 2016). There are approximately 100 of these cells per female (Pavlou et al., 2016)." [FlyBase:FBrf0234085]
synonym: "dsx/vGlut-Abg (female)" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0234085]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2018-07-11T10:42:19Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00047380
name: adult glutamatergic doublesex AbN (male) neuron
def: "Adult doublesex AbN neuron of the adult male that is also glutamatergic (Pavlou et al., 2016). This class encompasses all of the neurons innervating phallic and periphallic musculature (Pavlou et al., 2016). Some of these neurons appear to be synapsed by the GABAergic AbN neurons (Pavlou et al., 2016). There are approximately 80 of these cells per male (Pavlou et al., 2016)." [FlyBase:FBrf0234085]
comment: A small proportion express fruitless (Pavlou et al., 2016).
synonym: "dsx/vGlut-AbN (male)" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0234085]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2018-07-11T10:44:43Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00047381
name: adult GABAergic doublesex AbN (female) neuron
def: "Adult doublesex AbN neuron of the adult female that also produces GABA. There are approximately 210 of these cells in the female and a smaller number in the male. These cells tend to arborize locally in the abdominal neuromere. Some of these neurons appear to synapse to the glutamatergic AbN neurons (Pavlou et al., 2016)." [FlyBase:FBrf0234085]
synonym: "dsx/Gad1-Abg (female)" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0234085]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2018-07-11T11:01:15Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00047382
name: adult GABAergic doublesex AbN (male) neuron
def: "Adult doublesex AbN neuron of the adult male that also produces GABA. There are approximately 150 of these cells in the male and a larger number in the female. Two of these (not seen in the female) project to the mesothoracic and prothoracic neuromeres, with others arborizing locally in the abdominal neuromere. Some of these neurons appear to synapse to the glutamatergic AbN neurons (Pavlou et al., 2016)." [FlyBase:FBrf0234085]
synonym: "dsx/Gad1-Abg (male)" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0234085]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2018-07-11T11:05:03Z" xsd:dateTime

