[Term]
id: FBbt:00047715
name: mediolateral antennal lobe tract projection neuron 2
def: "Adult unilateral antennal lobe projection neuron that fasciculates with the mediolateral antennal lobe tract and innervates the lateral horn (Tanaka et al., 2012). Many of these are multiglomerular, but some have dendrites primarily within one glomerulus (uni+ group) (Tanaka et al., 2012; Bates et al., 2020). Its cell body is part of the ventral cluster in the antennal lobe cell body rind (Tanaka et al., 2012). There at least 23 cells of this type per hemisphere (Tanaka et al., 2012)." [FlyBase:FBrf0219809, FlyBase:FBrf0242628, FlyBase:FBrf0246460]
synonym: "AL-mlALT-PN2" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0242628]
synonym: "AL-mlPN2" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0219809]
