def: "Larval visual projection neuron that develops from the same neuroblast lineage as the larval Pdf-negative s-LNv, but does not express period. There are two of these cells per hemisphere with their cell bodies in a lateral part of the brain next to the optic lobe. They receive synaptic input in the larval optic neuropil, have outputs in the lateral inferior protocerebrum (clamp) and are cholinergic." [FlyBase:FBrf0237760]
