relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00111030 ! receives synaptic input in region larval prothoracic neuromere
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00111031 ! receives synaptic input in region larval mesothoracic neuromere
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00111030 ! sends synaptic output to region larval prothoracic neuromere
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00111031 ! sends synaptic output to region larval mesothoracic neuromere
