[Term]
id: FBbt:00047840
name: embryonic/larval astrocyte-like glial cell
def: "Astrocyte-like glial cell of the embryonic/larval central nervous system. There are approximately 15 of these cells in each brain hemisphere (Omoto et al., 2015) and 6 per ventral nerve cord hemineuromere (Peco et al., 2016) throughout larval development. They appear to endoreplicate and increase in size, then die during metamorphosis (Omoto et al., 2015; Kato et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0206543, FlyBase:FBrf0225669, FlyBase:FBrf0229106, FlyBase:FBrf0231858, FlyBase:FBrf0245107]
