relationship: RO:0002101 FBbt:00049645 ! fasciculates with nervus corporis cardiaci
relationship: RO:0002292 http://flybase.org/reports/FBgn0035023 ! expresses ITP
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00005799 ! sends synaptic output to region corpus cardiacum
