[Term]
id: FBbt:00047864
name: proximal radius
def: "Region of the radial vein that is closest to the body of the fly (Cole and Palka, 1982). It is divided from the medial radius by an incomplete septum, radius septum 1 (Bryant, 1975; Cole and Palka, 1982)." [FlyBase:FBrf0027793, FlyBase:FBrf0038304]
