[Term]
id: FBbt:00047865
name: medial radius
def: "Region of the radial vein that is between the proximal radius and distal radius, separated by incomplete septa (Bryant, 1975; Cole and Palka, 1982)." [FlyBase:FBrf0027793, FlyBase:FBrf0038304]
is_a: FBbt:00084751 ! wing vein segment
