relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00100210 ! has soma location cell body rind of adult gnathal ganglion
relationship: RO:0002101 FBbt:00003987 ! fasciculates with broad root
relationship: RO:0013001 FBbt:00003925 ! has synaptic IO in region antennal lobe glomerulus
