id: FBbt:00047984
name: larval mushroom body output neuron j2
def: "Larval neuron that has presynapses in the centroposterior lateral compartment (clamp), dorsoposterior compartment (posterior superior medial protocerebrum) and dorsoanterior compartment (anterior superior medial protocerebrum). It has postsynapses in the medialmost part of the medial lobe (intermediate toe) of the ipsilateral mushroom body (Saumweber et al., 2018). It is glutamatergic (Saumweber et al., 2018). It develops from a neuroblast DALcm (Saumweber et al., 2018) and becomes an MBON05 during metamorphosis (Truman et al., 2023)." [FlyBase:FBrf0238440, FlyBase:FBrf0255928]
comment: Saumweber et al. (2018) found this neuron in the L3 larva, but were not able to identify it in the L1. Lineage given as DALcm1/2 in Saumweber et al. (2018).
