id: FBbt:00047990
name: larval mushroom body output neuron d3
def: "Bilateral larval neuron with postsynaptic terminals in the mushroom body lateral appendix in the first instar; this changes to the lower two regions of the vertical lobe (V1 and V2) in the third instar. Its presynaptic sites are found in the centroposterior medial compartment (posterior inferior protocerebrum) and centroposterior intermediate compartment (clamp). It outputs onto FBN-9, FBN-16 and FAN-6 (Eschbach et al., 2020). It develops from neuroblast DAMd1 (Saumweber et al., 2018)." [FlyBase:FBrf0238440, FlyBase:FBrf0245294]
comment: MBE35 synonym from catmaid.
synonym: "larval MBON-d3" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0238440]
