def: "Larval gustatory receptor neuron of the terminal organ dorsolateral group. This neuron has a cell body in the dorsal organ ganglion and innervates the dorsomedial papilla of the terminal organ (Rist and Thum, 2017). There is one of these cells per hemisphere and it expresses Ppk23 (Rist and Thum, 2017)." [FlyBase:FBrf0236934]
