[Term]
id: FBbt:00048405
name: adult vaginal plate opening descending neuron vpoDN
def: "Doublesex-expressing descending neuron, specific to the adult female, with its cell body in the posterior medial protocerebrum, ventral to the pC1 cluster (Kimura et al., 2015; Sturner et al., 2025). There is one of these cells per hemisphere, it is cholinergic, and its activity stimulates vaginal plate opening (Wang et al., 2021). Its dendrites arborize in the superior lateral protocerebrum and its axons project to multiple regions of the ventral nerve cord, including the abdominal ganglion (Wang et al., 2021). It receives input from the pulse song-responsive (inhibitory) vpoINs and (excitatory) vpoENs (Wang et al., 2021), and it is activated in response to conspecific male pulse song (Deutsch et al., 2019; Wang et al., 2021). It also receives input from the pC1 cells, which convey mating status information and increase the excitability of pMN2 (Wang et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0228365, FlyBase:FBrf0243715, FlyBase:FBrf0247919, FlyBase:FBrf0262850]
comment: Robinett et al. (2010) - FBrf0210735 state that pMN2 cells are not sexually dimorphic. Kimura et al. (2015) show that these neurons are gender-specific, with males having what they refer to as pMN3 neurons and females having what they refer to as pMN2 in a similar location. These are different cells, as genetic manipulations can result in both cell types being present in one fly (Kimura et al., 2015). These (DNp37) cells are also missing from MANC (Sturner et al., 2025). Thought to be involved in oviposition based on correlation with non-specific activation in Kimura et al. (2015), but shown to be involved in vaginal plate opening by more specific activation in Wang et al. (2021).
synonym: "adult descending neuron of the posterior brain DNp37" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0262850]
synonym: "adult doublesex pMN2 (female) neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0210735, FlyBase:FBrf0247919]
synonym: "doublesex-expressing posterior Medial Neuron 2" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0210735]
synonym: "dsx-expressing posterior Medial Neuron 2" EXACT []
synonym: "dsx-pMN2" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0210735]
is_a: FBbt:00047517 ! descending neuron of the posterior brain
relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0060003 ! has characteristic female-specific
relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00111153 ! has soma location adult posterior brain cell body rind
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0014055 ! capable of acetylcholine secretion, neurotransmission
relationship: RO:0002216 GO:0060180 ! capable of part of female mating behavior
relationship: RO:0002292 http://flybase.org/reports/FBgn0000504 ! expresses dsx
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00007054 ! receives synaptic input in region superior lateral protocerebrum
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00110173 ! sends synaptic output to region adult abdominal neuromere
relationship: RO:0013008 FBbt:00047349 ! receives synaptic input from neuron adult doublesex pC1 (female) neuron
relationship: RO:0013008 FBbt:00049947 ! receives synaptic input from neuron vaginal plate opening excitatory neuron
relationship: RO:0013008 FBbt:00049948 ! receives synaptic input from neuron vaginal plate opening inhibitory neuron
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2019-08-14T08:57:45Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: IAO:0000233 "https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/478" xsd:anyURI

