[Term]
id: FBbt:00048425
name: female reproductive gland
def: "Gland of the female reproductive system. These specialized glands produce mucus-rich secretions that capacitate sperm to fertilize successfully, inhibit infection, and provide nutritional, maintenance, and storage factors." [FlyBase:FBrf0218434, FlyBase:FBrf0221317]
intersection_of: FBbt:00100317 ! gland
intersection_of: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00004864 ! part of female reproductive system
relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0060003 ! has characteristic female-specific
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0007589 ! capable of body fluid secretion
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2019-08-30T09:18:05Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: IAO:0000233 "https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/583" xsd:anyURI

[Term]
id: FBbt:00048426
name: female reproductive gland secretory cell
def: "Large, polyploid secretory cell that resides within a female reproductive gland, i.e. the spermatheca or female accessory gland (parovarium). These specialized glands produce mucus-rich secretions that capacitate sperm to fertilize successfully, inhibit infection, and provide nutritional, maintenance, and storage factors." [FlyBase:FBrf0218434, FlyBase:FBrf0221317]
is_a: FBbt:00100318 ! somatic cell
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00048425 ! part of female reproductive gland
relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0060003 ! has characteristic female-specific
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0032940 ! capable of secretion by cell
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2019-08-30T09:28:51Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: IAO:0000233 "https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/583" xsd:anyURI

[Term]
id: FBbt:00048427
name: adult Dh44 neuron of brain
def: "DH44-expressing neuron with a cell body located in the adult brain. Strongest expression is found in the pars intercerebralis, but many other somas are found in other regions of the brain (Lee et al., 2015)." [FlyBase:FBrf0227862]
intersection_of: FBbt:00047126 ! Dh44 neuron
intersection_of: RO:0002100 FBbt:00003625 ! has soma location adult brain cell body rind
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2021-02-01T15:38:40Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00048428
name: serotonergic abdominal giant (male) neuron 1
def: "Serotonergic abdominal giant (male) neuron that is also dopaminergic. There are approximately four of these cells per organism and they play a role in regulating copulation duration (Jois et al., 2018)." [FlyBase:FBrf0239445]
comment: May be equivalent to or overlap with adult dorsal posterior Ilp7 (male) neuron - FBbt:00111305 - https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705.
synonym: "sAbg-1" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0239445]
is_a: FBbt:00110663 ! serotonergic abdominal giant (male) neuron
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0061527 ! capable of dopamine secretion, neurotransmission
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2019-08-30T12:34:02Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00048429
name: embryonic optic neuroblast
def: "Optic neuroblast that delaminates from the neuroepithelium during the embryonic stage (Hakes et al., 2018). These cells are produced continuously between embryonic stages 12 and 17, with a final number of around 8 or 9 per brain lobe (Hakes et al., 2018). They express similar markers to larval neuroblasts and produce neurons and glia during embryogenesis (Hakes et al., 2018). They enter G0 quiescence prior to larval hatching and persist into the larval stage, they are among the last neuroblasts in the larval brain to reactivate (Hakes et al., 2018)." [FlyBase:FBrf0240123]
synonym: "EON" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0240123]
is_a: FBbt:00052344 ! optic neuroblast
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2019-08-30T13:45:47Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00048430
name: adult abdominal dorsal multidendritic neuron ddaD
def: "Mechanosensory multidendritic neuron that innervates the adult abdomen, extending dendrites under the dorsal body wall (tergite). It is remodeled from the larval ddaD neuron of the corresponding segment (Shimono et al., 2009)." [FlyBase:FBrf0209127]
is_a: FBbt:00048294 ! adult abdominal multidendritic neuron
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00002410 ! develops from abdominal dorsal multidendritic neuron ddaD
relationship: RO:0013007 FBbt:00004476 ! has sensory dendrite in abdominal tergite
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2019-09-02T09:57:53Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00048431
name: adult abdominal dorsal multidendritic neuron ddaC
def: "Mechanosensory multidendritic neuron that innervates the adult abdomen, extending dendrites under the dorsal body wall (tergite). It is remodeled from the larval ddaC neuron of the corresponding segment (Shimono et al., 2009)." [FlyBase:FBrf0209127]
synonym: "D neuron" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0191447, FlyBase:FBrf0209127]
is_a: FBbt:00048294 ! adult abdominal multidendritic neuron
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00002402 ! develops from abdominal dorsal multidendritic neuron ddaC
relationship: RO:0013007 FBbt:00004476 ! has sensory dendrite in abdominal tergite
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2019-09-02T10:06:29Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00048432
name: adult abdominal anterior ventral multidendritic neuron vdaa
def: "Mechanosensory multidendritic neuron that innervates the adult abdomen, extending dendrites under the ventral body wall (pleural membrane). It is remodeled from the larval vdaa neuron of the corresponding segment, being reshaped from a radial pattern to a lattice pattern (Shimono et al., 2009)." [FlyBase:FBrf0209127]
synonym: "V' neuron" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0191447, FlyBase:FBrf0209127]
is_a: FBbt:00048294 ! adult abdominal multidendritic neuron
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00002517 ! develops from abdominal anterior ventral multidendritic neuron vdaa
relationship: RO:0013007 FBbt:00004822 ! has sensory dendrite in pleural membrane
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2019-09-02T10:12:30Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00048433
name: adult abdominal dorsal multidendritic neuron ddaE
def: "Mechanosensory multidendritic neuron that innervates the adult abdomen, extending dendrites under the dorsal body wall (tergite). It is remodeled from the larval ddaE neuron of the corresponding segment (Williams and Truman, 2004). It has many more terminals than its larval equivalent (Shimono et al., 2009). It undergoes programmed cell death within one week after eclosion (Shimono et al., 2009)." [FlyBase:FBrf0174853, FlyBase:FBrf0209127]
is_a: FBbt:00048294 ! adult abdominal multidendritic neuron
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00002418 ! develops from abdominal dorsal multidendritic neuron ddaE
relationship: RO:0013007 FBbt:00004476 ! has sensory dendrite in abdominal tergite
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2019-09-02T10:35:34Z" xsd:dateTime

