[Term]
id: FBbt:00048517
name: wind sensitive wedge projection neuron
def: "Projection neuron that receives input in the wedge and is activated by wind (Suver et al., 2019). Its soma is found near the lateral horn and it has a ventral projection to the ipsilateral wedge, where it branches extensively, then a dorsal projection to the antler and superior clamp, in many cases the neuron then extends across the midline to the contralateral antler and superior clamp (Suver et al., 2019; Coates et al., 2020). This is a large anatomical class with different individual neurons having different tunings (Suver et al., 2019)." [FlyBase:FBrf0242465, FlyBase:FBrf0246448]
comment: The two 'wedge projection neurons' (WPN) identified by Suver et al. (2019) are a subset of this larger class of wind sensitive wedge projection neurons that have outputs in the ipsilateral and contralateral superior clamp and antler.
synonym: "WPN" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0242465]
is_a: FBbt:00048516 ! wedge projection neuron
relationship: RO:0002216 GO:0071063 ! capable of part of sensory perception of wind
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00045027 ! sends synaptic output to region wedge
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00045039 ! sends synaptic output to region antler
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2019-12-10T11:50:28Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00048518
name: interoceptive SEZ neuron
def: "Neuron that predominantly arborizes in the subesophageal zone (SEZ) and is involved in the regulation of feeding behavior (Jourjine et al., 2016). It expresses the TRPV channel nanchung and detects decreases in osmolality (Jourjine et al., 2016). It expresses Ilp3 and has presynapses in the SEZ (Gonzalez Segarra et al., 2023). There are two of these per hemisphere (Jourjine et al., 2016)." [FlyBase:FBrf0233110, FlyBase:FBrf0257621]
comment: Two other SEZ neurons also express nan (Jourjine et al., 2016). Ilp3, but not other Ilps, required in ISNs for function in ingestion (Gonzalez Segarra et al., 2023).
synonym: "interoceptive subesophageal zone neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0233110]
synonym: "ISN" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0233110]
is_a: FBbt:00005106 ! neuron
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0030072 ! capable of peptide hormone secretion
relationship: RO:0002216 GO:0060259 ! capable of part of regulation of feeding behavior
relationship: RO:0002292 http://flybase.org/reports/FBgn0036414 ! expresses nan
relationship: RO:0002292 http://flybase.org/reports/FBgn0044050 ! expresses Ilp3
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00110639 ! sends synaptic output to region adult subesophageal zone
