[Term]
id: FBbt:00048560
name: larval ThDN neuron
def: "Larval neuron that has its soma in a thoracic neuromere and projects anteriorly and posteriorly. It receives strong input from the mooncrawler descending neurons and a large proportion of its outputs are to each of canon, A27l and A27k neurons in anterior neuromeres (Carreira-Rosario et al., 2018)." [FlyBase:FBrf0239825]
synonym: "larval thoracic descending neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0239825]
