[Term]
id: FBbt:00048709
name: larval T23a neuron
def: "Larval thoracic interneuron that is part of lineage 23 (Zwart et al., 2016). Its soma is located laterally, it has dendritic arborizations dorsomedially and a branch crossing the midline forming presynapses (Zwart et al., 2016)." [FlyBase:FBrf0233076]
is_a: FBbt:00005125 ! interneuron
is_a: FBbt:00047097 ! primary neuron
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00001919 ! part of larval central nervous system
relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00111265 ! has soma location cell body rind of larval thoracic neuromere
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00001381 ! develops from neuroblast NB7-4
relationship: RO:0013001 FBbt:00001102 ! has synaptic IO in region larval ventral nerve cord
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2020-01-21T09:16:22Z" xsd:dateTime

