def: "Any neuron that develops from neuroblast NB2-3 during the embryonic phase of neurogenesis. Most of these cells remain in an immature state in the larva and become motor neurons in the adult (Lacin and Truman, 2016)." [FlyBase:FBrf0231327]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2020-02-20T12:00:00Z" xsd:dateTime

