id: FBbt:00048881 ! NB5-1 lineage neuron
def: "Any neuron that develops from neuroblast NB5-1. These are all primary neurons, since NB5-1 does not produce a secondary lineage (Lacin and Truman, 2016)." [FlyBase:FBrf0231327]
