[Term]
id: FBbt:00049145
name: adult superior lateral protocerebrum-asymmetrical body-fan-shaped body layer 8 neuron
def: "Adult neuron that has dendritic arborizations in the superior lateral protocerebrum and presynaptic terminals in layer 8 of the fan-shaped body and the asymmetrical body (Wolff and Rubin, 2018). Some of these neurons also have presynaptic terminals in other fan-shaped body layers (Wolff and Rubin, 2018). They develop from the BAmv1 (LALv1) neuroblast (Kandimalla et al., 2023)." [FlyBase:FBrf0240744, FlyBase:FBrf0257023]
comment: Likely to be a few different subclasses, but these have some variability and could not be well defined by Wolff and Rubin (2018).
