relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0030072 ! capable of peptide hormone secretion
relationship: RO:0013001 FBbt:00004052 ! has synaptic IO in region adult ventral nerve cord
relationship: RO:0013001 FBbt:00110639 ! has synaptic IO in region adult subesophageal zone
