[Term]
id: FBbt:00049201
name: posterior superior transverse fascicle
def: "Posteriormost of three transverse (medial-lateral) fascicles found between the superior and inferior protocerebrum (Pereanu et al, 2010). Its lateral component is formed by the DPLl1 lineage and demarcates the boundary between the lateral horn and the superior lateral protocerebrum (Pereanu et al, 2010; Lovick et al., 2013; Hartenstein et al., 2015). Its medial component is formed by DPLc lineages and demarcates the boundary between the superior lateral and superior medial protocerebrum (Pereanu et al, 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211016, FlyBase:FBrf0223329, FlyBase:FBrf0229672]
