[Term]
id: FBbt:00049232
name: posterior lateral fascicle
def: "Longitudinal (anterior-posterior) fascicle found on the ventral boundary of the inferior protocerebrum that contains fibers of numerous lineages (Pereanu et al., 2010). Its ventral part is formed by BLVp1/2 lineages, its dorsomedial part is formed CP2/3 lineages and its dorsolateral part is formed DPLpv (Lovick et al., 2013; Hartenstein et al., 2015). In the adult, there is also an external component, formed by BLP1/2 secondary lineages (Lovick et al., 2013)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211016, FlyBase:FBrf0223298, FlyBase:FBrf0229672]
