id: FBbt:00049251
name: adult longitudinal ventral intermediate fascicle
def: "Intermediate component of the anterior part of the longitudinal ventral fascicle in the adult brain (Lovick et al., 2013; Hartenstein et al., 2015). It is formed from the BAlc (ALl1) ventral hemilineage and it innervates the antenno-mechanosensory and motor centre and the inferior ventrolateral cerebrum, a branch also enters the great commissure (Wong et al., 2013; Lovick et al., 2013)." [FlyBase:FBrf0223298, FlyBase:FBrf0223329, FlyBase:FBrf0229672]
