id: FBbt:00049254
name: larval longitudinal ventral fascicle
def: "Large longitudinal fascicle of the larval brain found ventral to the medial and lateral equatorial fascicles (Hartenstein et al., 2015). It has three (medial, intermediate and lateral) anterior components and a posterior component, each formed by different lineages (Hartenstein et al., 2015)." [FlyBase:FBrf0229672]
synonym: "larval loV" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0223329]
