[Term]
id: FBbt:00049262
name: larval medial equatorial fascicle
def: "Thick fascicle of the larval brain that runs medial and parallel to the mushroom body pedunculus (Hartenstein et al., 2015). It is formed by dorsal components of the CM1/3/4 lineages and the DPMpl3 lineage (Hartenstein et al., 2015). It extends anteriorly into the inferior protocerebrum and has branches extending to the fan-shaped body primordium, the great commissure and the lateral accessory lobe (Hartenstein et al., 2015)." [FlyBase:FBrf0229672]
synonym: "larval median equatorial fascicle" EXACT []
