[Term]
id: FBbt:00049263
name: embryonic/larval mediolateral antennal lobe tract
def: "Tract of the larva that is formed by axons of the BAla1 (ALv1) lineage (Hartenstein et al., 2015). It separates from the other ALT tracts and extends laterally, terminating in the inferior protocerebrum surrounding the mushroom body pedunculus (Hartenstein et al., 2015)." [FlyBase:FBrf0229672]
