[Term]
id: FBbt:00049273
name: adult anterior lateral ellipsoid fascicle
def: "Anterior component of the lateral ellipsoid fascicle in the adult brain (Lovick et al., 2013). It is formed by the DALv2 and DALv3 lineages and it passes underneath the mushroom body medial lobe towards the central complex (Lovick et al., 2013). It also receives ventral fibers of the DALcl2 lineage (Lovick et al., 2013)." [FlyBase:FBrf0223329]
