def: "Adult lateral horn output neuron of the AV1a3 group that fasciculates with the AV1 primary neurite tract (Frechter et al., 2019; Dolan et al., 2019). It is a secondary neuron that is part of the BLVp1 (VLPl&p2) lateral hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2021). There are around 3-6 of these neurons per hemisphere and they are cholinergic and GABAergic (Dolan et al., 2019; Schlegel et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0242477, FlyBase:FBrf0242628, FlyBase:FBrf0246460, FlyBase:FBrf0249560]
