def: "Adult lateral horn output neuron of the AV2a2 group that fasciculates with the AV2 primary neurite tract (Frechter et al., 2019). There are approximately four of these cells per hemisphere and they are cholinergic (Schlegel et al., 2021). It selectively receives input from olfactory DA1 lateral projection neurons, responding to male approach speed (Taisz et al., 2023). It is sexually isomorphic (Taisz et al., 2023)." [FlyBase:FBrf0242628, FlyBase:FBrf0249560, FlyBase:FBrf0256726]
