[Term]
id: FBbt:00049371
name: adult lateral horn PD2b1 neuron
def: "Adult lateral horn output neuron of the PD2b1 group that fasciculates with the PD2 primary neurite tract (Frechter et al., 2019; Dolan et al., 2019). It is a secondary neuron that is part of the DPLl2 (VLPd&p1) dorsal hemilineage (Bates et al., 2020). It has dendrites in the mushroom body calyx, as well as in the lateral horn (Dolan et al., 2018). A large portion of its input is from antennal lobe projection neurons and it responds to olfactory stimuli (Dolan et al., 2018). There are approximately 2 of these neurons per hemisphere and they are cholinergic (Dolan et al., 2018). Some of these cells receive input from mushroom body vertical lobe arborizing neuron 2 alpha (MBON-alpha2sc) and they may be involved in memory (Dolan et al., 2018)." [FlyBase:FBrf0240600, FlyBase:FBrf0242477, FlyBase:FBrf0242628, FlyBase:FBrf0246460, FlyBase:FBrf0249560]
synonym: "adult LHPD2b1 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0246460]
synonym: "adult PD2b1 neuron" EXACT []
synonym: "adult posterior dorsal tract 2 neuron b1" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0242477, FlyBase:FBrf0242628]
synonym: "ML8" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0246460]
synonym: "type I" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0246460]
is_a: FBbt:00047096 ! secondary neuron
is_a: FBbt:00049286 ! adult lateral horn output neuron
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00003624 ! part of adult brain
relationship: RO:0002101 FBbt:00049312 ! fasciculates with adult posterior dorsal primary neurite tract 2
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00100601 ! develops from neuroblast DPLl2
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0014055 ! capable of acetylcholine secretion, neurotransmission
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00007053 ! receives synaptic input in region adult lateral horn
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00007385 ! receives synaptic input in region calyx of adult mushroom body
relationship: RO:0013008 FBbt:00067123 ! receives synaptic input from neuron adult antennal lobe projection neuron
