def: "Adult lateral horn local neuron of the PD3a2 group that fasciculates with the PD3 primary neurite tract (Dolan et al., 2019). It is a secondary neuron that is part of the DPLm2 (LHd2) dorsal hemilineage (Bates et al., 2020; Schlegel et al., 2021). There are approximately 7-9 of these neurons per hemisphere and they are glutamatergic (Dolan et al., 2019; Schlegel et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0242477, FlyBase:FBrf0246460, FlyBase:FBrf0249560]
