[Term]
id: FBbt:00049406
name: adult lateral horn PV4f1 neuron
def: "Adult lateral horn local neuron of the PV4f1 group that fasciculates with the PV4 primary neurite tract (Frechter et al., 2019; Schlegel et al., 2021). It is a secondary neuron that develops from the BLP4 (LHp1) neuroblast (Schlegel et al., 2021). There are around one or two of these cells per hemisphere and they are glutamatergic (Schlegel et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0242628, FlyBase:FBrf0249560]
