name: adult lateral horn PV6a3 neuron
def: "Adult lateral horn output neuron of the PV6a3 group that fasciculates with the PV6 primary neurite tract (Dolan et al., 2019). It is a secondary neuron that is part of the DPLp1 (LHp2) medial hemilineage (Bates et al., 2020). Its olfactory input is mainly from aversive pathways (Huoviala et al., 2020). There are five of these neurons per hemisphere and they are cholinergic (Dolan et al., 2019)." [doi:10.1101/394403, FlyBase:FBrf0242477, FlyBase:FBrf0246460, FlyBase:FBrf0249560]
