[Term]
id: FBbt:00049454
name: adult wedge projection neuron 1
def: "Adult neuron with its dendrites in the wedge and inferior posterior slope and an axonal projection to the lateral horn only (Dolan et al., 2019; Bates et al., 2020; Baker et al., 2022). It is a secondary neuron that develops from the WEDa2 (BAlp3) neuroblast (Bates et al., 2020). There are approximately six of these neurons per hemisphere and they are GABAergic (Dolan et al., 2019; Baker et al., 2022). It responds to both male sine and pulse song (Baker et al., 2022)." [FlyBase:FBrf0242477, FlyBase:FBrf0246460, FlyBase:FBrf0254226]
comment: Schlegel et al. (2021) only list WEDPN1A (not 1B).
synonym: "adult WED-PN1 lateral horn input neuron" EXACT []
