relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00003748 ! sends synaptic output to region medulla
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00003756 ! sends synaptic output to region medulla serpentine layer
relationship: RO:0013008 FBbt:00004449 ! receives synaptic input from neuron dorsal margin photoreceptor cell R7
