[Term]
id: FBbt:00049605
name: larval VNC cell body glial cell
def: "Glial cell located amongst neuronal cell bodies in the cortex of the embryonic/larval ventral nerve cord (VNC). In the early larva, there are around 4 cell body glia per hemineuromere (Ito et al., 1995), but they increase in number during later larval stages, particularly in thoracic and anterior abdominal segments (Coutinho-Budd et al., 2017). The nuclei and cell bodies of the VNC cell body glial cells have quite irregular shapes, and cytoplasmic protrusions fill the space between neighboring neuronal cell bodies (Ito et al., 1995), with no morphological stereotypy by VNC region (Coutinho-Budd et al., 2017). These cells are not found in the dorsal portion of the cell body rind, with neuronal somas instead being wrapped by ensheathing glia (Pogodalla et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0082171, FlyBase:FBrf0237238, FlyBase:FBrf0251788]
synonym: "embryonic/larval VNC cortex glial cell" EXACT []
synonym: "larval ventral nerve cord CBG" EXACT []
intersection_of: FBbt:00005144 ! glial cell
intersection_of: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00111225 ! part of cell body rind of larval ventral nerve cord
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2020-06-15T14:22:51Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00049606
name: larval lateral posterior longitudinal glial cell
def: "Larval longitudinal glial cell (generated by the longitudinal glioblast) with a relatively lateral and posterior location relative to other longitudinal glia (Beckervordersandforth et al., 2008). There is one of these cells per hemineuromere in the late embryo (Beckervordersandforth et al., 2008). It is an ensheathing glial cell that wraps the proximal part of the intersegmental nerve (Peco et al., 2016). It is thought to differentiate directly from one of the two initial daughter cells produced by the longitudinal glioblast (Peco et al., 2016)." [FlyBase:FBrf0205499, FlyBase:FBrf0231858]
synonym: "lateral posterior LG" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0205499]
synonym: "LP-LG" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0205499]
is_a: FBbt:00052373 ! larval VNC ensheathing/wrapping glial cell
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00001405 ! develops from longitudinal glioblast
