[Term]
id: FBbt:00049659
name: adult hygrosensory neuron Ir68a VP5
def: "Adult hygrosensory neuron Ir68a that innervates antennal lobe glomerulus VP5 and innervates a sensillum housed in chamber II of the sacculus (Frank et al., 2017; Knecht et al., 2017; Marin et al., 2020). In VP5, it synapses to antennal lobe projection neuron VP1m+VP5 (Frank et al., 2017). It develops from an Naa precursor (Benton et al., 2025). There are around 7-9 of these cells per hemisphere (Marin et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0235932, FlyBase:FBrf0236232, FlyBase:FBrf0246456]
comment: FBrf0235932 and FBrf0236232 have contradictory results regarding expression of Ir25a in these cells. Synapsing with PN in VP5 shown by GRASP (Frank et al., 2017).
synonym: "HRN Ir68a VP5" EXACT []
