def: "Adult lateral horn output neuron of the AV2d1 group that fasciculates with the AV2 primary neurite tract (Bates et al., 2020). It is a primary neuron (Bates et al., 2020). It has dense postsynapses in the lateral horn and extends into the mushroom body calyx and inferior clamp (Marin et al., 2020). There is around one of these cells per hemisphere (Schlegel et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0246456, FlyBase:FBrf0246460, FlyBase:FBrf0249560]
