name: adult lateral horn AV3a2 neuron
def: "Adult lateral horn output neuron of the AV3a2 group that fasciculates with the AV3 primary neurite tract (Bates et al., 2020). It is a secondary neuron that develops from the BLVa2 (LHa3) neuroblast (Bates et al., 2020). There are approximately six of these cells per hemisphere and they are GABAergic (Schlegel et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0246460, FlyBase:FBrf0249560]
