def: "Adult lateral horn output neuron of the AV3r1 group that fasciculates with the AV3 primary neurite tract (Marin et al., 2020). It receives most of its input from the VP3 vPN (Marin et al., 2020). It has dendritic terminals in the ventral lateral horn and projects to the superior lateral protocerebrum (Marin et al., 2020). There are two of these per hemisphere (Marin et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0246456]
