id: FBbt:00049817
name: ocellar ganglion
def: "Detached ganglion that sits below an ocellus and contains the axonal projections of its photoreceptors (Caldwell et al., 2007; Scheffer et al., 2020). Four giant ocellar interneurons connect each ganglion to the posterior slope via the ocellar nerve (Caldwell et al., 2007; Ito et al., 2014). The three ganglia in each head are separated by glia (Dorkenwald et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0200339, FlyBase:FBrf0224194, FlyBase:FBrf0246888, FlyBase:FBrf0260546]
