name: fan-shaped body extrinsic columnar neuron
def: "Adult fan-shaped body columnar neuron with projections to other neuropils (Scheffer et al., 2020). These are usually, if not always, unicolumnar in the fan-shaped body (Andrade et al., 2019; Hulse et al., 2021). They generally follow a nine-column fan-shaped body organization (Hulse et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0241389, FlyBase:FBrf0246888, FlyBase:FBrf0254510]
