def: "Adult lateral horn output neuron of the PV4m1 group that fasciculates with the PV4 primary neurite tract (Li et al., 2020). It has arbors in the lateral horn and the superior lateral, intermediate and medial protocerebra (Li et al., 2020). It is a secondary neuron that is part of the LHp1 (BLP4) lineage (Schlegel et al., 2021). There is around one of these cells per hemisphere and it is glutamatergic (Schlegel et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0248215, FlyBase:FBrf0249560]
