def: "Lobula tangential neuron that receives visual input in the lobula and projects to the lateral accessory lobe (Li et al., 2020). There around are twelve of these cells per hemisphere, with their cell bodies on the anterior lateral side of the lobula (Li et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0248215, FlyBase:FBrf0262545]
