[Term]
id: FBbt:00049909
name: adult fruitless aSP-g neuron
def: "Fruitless-expressing neuron with its soma in the adult anterior superior protocerebrum (Cachero et al., 2010). There are approximately 13 of these neurons per hemisphere in both males and females (Cachero et al., 2010). They have sexually dimorphic arbors in the lateral protocerebral complex (Cachero et al., 2010; Yu et al., 2010; Kohl et al., 2013) and respond to different odor stimuli in each sex (Kohl et al., 2013)." [FlyBase:FBrf0128543, FlyBase:FBrf0205974, FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0211926, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438, FlyBase:FBrf0223724, FlyBase:FBrf0246460]
comment: AD1e1 referred to as a fruitless aSP-g neuron in Dolan et al. (2019) and is a synonym for some aSP-g1, aSP-g2 and SLP005 neurons in neuprint (neuprint.janelia.org) hemibrain 1.2.1 notes. Bates (2020) lists two different neuroblasts of origin (DPLal2 and DPLal3) for different aSP-g1 individuals. LHAD1e2 mapped to some aSP-g2 and aSP-g3 neurons in hemibrain 1.2.1 notes.
synonym: "adult AD1e1 neuron" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0242477]
synonym: "adult anterior dorsal tract 1 neuron e1" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0242477]
synonym: "adult fruitless aSP6 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
synonym: "adult lateral horn AD1e1 neuron" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0242477]
synonym: "adult lateral horn AD1e2 neuron" RELATED []
synonym: "adult LHAD1e1 neuron" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0246460]
synonym: "aSP3b2 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0205974, FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
synonym: "fru-aSP3 neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543, FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
synonym: "LHAD1e1" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0246460]
synonym: "LHAD1e2" RELATED []
relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0002451 ! has characteristic sexually dimorphic
relationship: RO:0013001 FBbt:00007145 ! has synaptic IO in region adult protocerebrum
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2020-10-30T12:00:09Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00049910
name: adult multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron l2PN
def: "Adult multiglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron that belongs to the ventral hemilineage of neuroblast ALl1 (Bates et al., 2020). Secondary neurons of this type are diverse and fasciculate with several different antennal lobe tracts (Bates et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0246460]
comment: Lin et al. (2012) map PNs to Notch OFF hemilineage; classical lPNs belong to dorsal (l) hemilineage according to Bates et al. (2020), so inferring that dorsal (l) hemilineage is Notch OFF, ventral (l2) is ON - https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705.
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2020-11-03T15:39:08Z" xsd:dateTime

