def: "Type II neuroblast of the brain that produces a neuronal lineage that enters the neuropil in a posterior medial location at the level of protocerebral bridge glomeruli 1-3 (Viktorin et al., 2011; Andrade et al., 2019). Its primary lineage contributes to the fan-shaped body primordium (Riebli et al., 2013; Hartenstein et al., 2015). Its large secondary lineage produces numerous tracts with different trajectories, reaching many parts of the adult brain (Lovick et al., 2014; Ito et al., 2013; Yu et al., 2013). It produces larval glia that die by apoptosis before the adult stage, so that no adult glia are contributed by this neuroblast (Ren et al., 2018)." [FlyBase:FBrf0214495, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438, FlyBase:FBrf0221883, FlyBase:FBrf0223329, FlyBase:FBrf0229672, FlyBase:FBrf0239137, FlyBase:FBrf0241389]
subset: TL_lineage_clone
synonym: "central complex neuroblast Z" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0236238]
synonym: "FBP1" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0205148]
is_a: FBbt:00005147 ! neuroglioblast
is_a: FBbt:00053312 ! central complex neuroblast
is_a: FBbt:00100744 ! neuroblast DPM

