[Term]
id: FBbt:00050121 ! neuroblast DPMpm1
def: "Type II neuroblast of the brain that produces a neuronal lineage that enters the neuropil in a posterior medial location at the level of protocerebral bridge glomeruli 4-5 (Viktorin et al., 2011; Andrade et al., 2019). Its primary lineage contributes to the fan-shaped body primordium (Riebli et al., 2013; Hartenstein et al., 2015). Its secondary lineage innervates the ipsilateral superior medial protocerebrum and the contralateral fan-shaped body and some fibers enter the medial antennal lobe tract (Ito et al., 2013). It produces many adult central brain glial cells (Ren et al., 2018)." [FlyBase:FBrf0214495, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438, FlyBase:FBrf0221883, FlyBase:FBrf0229672, FlyBase:FBrf0239137, FlyBase:FBrf0241389]
