[Term]
id: FBbt:00050142 ! neuroblast CM3
def: "Type II centromedial neuroblast of the posterior deutocerebrum (Pereanu and Hartenstein, 2006; Hartenstein et al., 2015). Its primary lineage enters the ventromedial cerebrum and contributes to the longitudinal ventral posterior fascicle (Hartenstein et al., 2015). Its complex secondary lineage has four main sublineage tracts (Lovick et al., 2013) and reaches many parts of the brain (Ito et al., 2013; Yu et al., 2013), including the central complex (Kandimalla et al., 2023). It produces mostly neurons and only a small number of glial cells (Viktorin et al., 2011; Ren et al., 2018)." [FlyBase:FBrf0194268, FlyBase:FBrf0214495, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438, FlyBase:FBrf0223329, FlyBase:FBrf0229672, FlyBase:FBrf0239137, FlyBase:FBrf0257023]
comment: DM6 previously mapped to CM1 based on FlyBase:FBrf0194268 and FlyBase:FBrf0214495. This was corrected to CM3 based on FlyBase:FBrf0260535 and personally checked by Volker Hartenstein.
subset: TL_lineage_clone
is_a: FBbt:00005147 ! neuroglioblast
is_a: FBbt:00100533 ! type II neuroblast
is_a: FBbt:00100742 ! neuroblast CM

