[Term]
id: FBbt:00050213 ! neuroblast DPMl2
def: "Neuroblast that produces a secondary lineage of approximately 27-28 cells, with posterior somas, that collectively have greatest innervation in and around the ipsilateral inferior neuropils (Yu et al., 2013; Ito et al., 2013)." [FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438]
comment: DPMl2 assigned as a 'new' name for this in Hartenstein nomenclature in Schlegel et al. (2024) - FlyBase:FBrf0260535 despite having previously been used as a lineage name in Pereanu and Hartenstein (2006) - FBrf0194268. The old 'DPMl2' turned out to be a component of the DPLm2 lineage and not a lineage in its own right (Wong et al., 2013 - FBrf0223298).
subset: TL_lineage_clone
is_a: FBbt:00100532 ! type I neuroblast
is_a: FBbt:00100744 ! neuroblast DPM

