[Term]
id: FBbt:00050249 ! neuroblast BLD5
alt_id: FBbt:00100624
def: "Neuroblast with a relatively posterior position in the BLD group, close to BLD6 (Wong et al., 2013; Hartenstein et al,. 2013). Its secondary lineage forms arbors in the ipsilateral lobula and contralateral medulla, following a characteristic straight commissural tract between these regions (Ito et al., 2013; Yu et al., 2013; Wong et al., 2013)." [FlyBase:FBrf0194268, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438, FlyBase:FBrf0223298]
