[Term]
id: FBbt:00051050
name: adult lateral horn AD1b5 neuron
def: "Adult lateral horn output neuron of the AD1b5 group that fasciculates with the AD1 primary neurite tract (Schlegel et al., 2021). Its soma is found in the anterodorsal part of the border between the lateral horn and superior lateral protocerebrum. It has only a small proportion of its synapses in the lateral horn, with most of its inputs and outputs found in the superior lateral protocerebrum. It is a secondary neuron that belongs to the LHl2 medial hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2021). There are approximately 3-5 of these cells per hemisphere and they are cholinergic (Schlegel et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0249560, http://neuprint.janelia.org/?dataset=hemibrain\:v1.1]
comment: Neurotransmitter predicted based on lineage (Schlegel et al., 2021). Cell type found in both hemibrain and FAFB (Schlegel et al., 2021).
synonym: "adult AD1b5 neuron" EXACT []
synonym: "adult anterior dorsal tract 1 neuron b5" EXACT []
synonym: "adult LHAD1b5 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0249560]
is_a: FBbt:00047096 ! secondary neuron
is_a: FBbt:00049286 ! adult lateral horn output neuron
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00003624 ! part of adult brain
relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0000634 ! has characteristic unilateral
relationship: RO:0002101 FBbt:00049306 ! fasciculates with adult anterior dorsal primary neurite tract 1
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00100592 ! develops from neuroblast DPLal2
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0014055 ! capable of acetylcholine secretion, neurotransmission
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00007053 ! receives synaptic input in region adult lateral horn
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00007054 ! receives synaptic input in region superior lateral protocerebrum
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00007053 ! sends synaptic output to region adult lateral horn
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00007054 ! sends synaptic output to region superior lateral protocerebrum
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2021-02-24T10:19:21Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00051051
name: adult lateral horn AD1b6 neuron
def: "Adult lateral horn output neuron of the AD1b6 group that fasciculates with the AD1 primary neurite tract (Schlegel et al., 2021). Its soma is found in the anterodorsal part of the border between the lateral horn and superior lateral protocerebrum. It has presynaptic and postsynaptic sites in the lateral horn, superior lateral protocerebrum and superior medial protocerebrum. It is a secondary neuron that belongs to the LHl2 medial hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2021). There are approximately five of these cells per hemisphere and they are cholinergic (Schlegel et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0249560, http://neuprint.janelia.org/?dataset=hemibrain\:v1.1]
comment: Neurotransmitter predicted based on lineage (Schlegel et al., 2021). Cell type found in both hemibrain and FAFB (Schlegel et al., 2021). One AD1b2 cell in FAFB was retyped to AD1b6 - https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705.
synonym: "adult AD1b6 neuron" EXACT []
synonym: "adult anterior dorsal tract 1 neuron b6" EXACT []
