[Term]
id: FBbt:00051228
name: adult medulla-tubercle neuron
def: "Neuron that connects the medulla to the anterior optic tubercle (AOTU), via the anterior optic tract, innervating the small unit of the AOTU (Timaeus et al., 2020; Hulse et al., 2021; Kandimalla et al., 2023). It is derived from an optic neuroblast (Kandimalla et al., 2023). There are around 500 of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025)." [FlyBase:FBrf0224242, FlyBase:FBrf0252485, FlyBase:FBrf0254510, FlyBase:FBrf0257023, FlyBase:FBrf0262545]
