[Term]
id: FBbt:00051291
name: adult lateral accessory lobe-fan-shaped body layer 3 neuron
def: "Adult neuron with mainly postsynaptic sites in the dorsolateral lateral accessory lobe, with some dendritic extensions into the nearby protocerebrum, and arborization spanning layer 3 of the fan-shaped body, consisting of mainly presynaptic sites (Franconville et al., 2018; Hulse et al., 2021). There are approximately four of these cells per hemisphere (Franconville et al., 2018; Hulse et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0240166, FlyBase:FBrf0246888, FlyBase:FBrf0254510]
comment: Hemibrain FB3C closest match to Franconville et al. (2018) IMPL-F based on arborization pattern, cell number and soma location in Hulse et al. (2021) and Neuprint. Also similar to FB3D, but only 1 FB3D cell and FB3D very similar to FB3C.
synonym: "FB-LAL neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0235476, FlyBase:FBrf0240166]
synonym: "IMPL-F" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0240166]
synonym: "LAL.s-IMP-FBl3.b" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0240166]
synonym: "LALSMPFB3" NARROW [FlyBase:FBrf0246888]
is_a: FBbt:00053396 ! input/output neuron
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00003624 ! part of adult brain
relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00003625 ! has soma location adult brain cell body rind
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00003681 ! receives synaptic input in region adult lateral accessory lobe
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00007055 ! receives synaptic input in region superior medial protocerebrum
relationship: RO:0013006 FBbt:00007490 ! sends synaptic output throughout fan-shaped body layer 3
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2021-05-20T16:54:03Z" xsd:dateTime

