[Term]
id: FBbt:00051295
name: adult SFS neuron
def: "Neuron that integrates excitatory and inhibitory inputs from MBON12 and MBON4, respectively (Lei et al., 2022). It synapses onto and can activate ventral fan-shaped body neurons (Lei et al., 2022). It is involved in post-learning sleep and long-term memory formation (Lei et al., 2022)." [FlyBase:FBrf0252547]
comment: Unclear from Lei et al. (2022) what 'SFS' stands for.
