[Term]
id: FBbt:00051305
name: adult fruitless aSP-f neuron
def: "Adult fruitless-expressing neuron with its soma on the dorsal surface of the brain, in a cleft posterior to the anterior optic tubercle (Yu et al., 2010). There are approximately 20 of these neurons per hemisphere, but usually a few more in males than in females (Cachero et al., 2010). They have sexually dimorphic arbors (Cachero et al., 2010; Kohl et al., 2013) and respond to different odor stimuli in each sex (Kohl et al., 2013)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211926, FlyBase:FBrf0223724]
synonym: "adult fruitless aSP3a neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0205974, FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
synonym: "adult fruitless aSP5 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
synonym: "DC1 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0212443, FlyBase:FBrf0223724]
relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0002451 ! has characteristic sexually dimorphic
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2021-05-26T13:48:19Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00051306
name: obsolete adult fruitless aSP-f lineage clone
def: "A clone of neurons in the adult brain that expresses fruitless, whose cell bodies are located in the anterior superior protocerebrum. Neurites project ventrally in the dorsal lateral protocerebrum and form arbors extending down to the lateral crescent." [FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
comment: Obsoleted as we do not maintain terms for groups of cells. Consider using the appropriate neuron term instead.
synonym: "adult fruitless aSP5 clone" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2021-05-26T13:52:06Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: IAO:0000233 "https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/1712" xsd:anyURI
is_obsolete: true
consider: FBbt:00051305

