[Term]
id: FBbt:00051431
name: adult Drosulfakinin MP1 neuron
def: "Adult neuron that secretes Drosulfakinin and is found in a cluster of two cells close to the midline in the posterior medial protocerebrum (Nichols and Lim, 1996; Namiki et al., 2018; Wu et al., 2019; Bates et al., 2025). It also expresses fruitless and plays a role in mating behavior in both males and females, but it is not sexually dimorphic (Wu et al., 2019). There are two subtypes, both of which are descending neurons that arborize bilaterally in the lateral protocerebrum and subesophageal zone, but differ in whether they innervate the optic lobe (Wu et al., 2019; Bates et al., 2025)." [doi:10.1101/2025.07.31.667571, FlyBase:FBrf0085661, FlyBase:FBrf0219451, FlyBase:FBrf0239335, FlyBase:FBrf0243806]
is_a: FBbt:00047517 ! descending neuron of the posterior brain
relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0000618 ! has characteristic bilateral
relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00003625 ! has soma location adult brain cell body rind
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0002790 ! capable of peptide secretion
relationship: RO:0002216 GO:0007617 ! capable of part of mating behavior
relationship: RO:0002292 http://flybase.org/reports/FBgn0000500 ! expresses Dsk
relationship: RO:0002292 http://flybase.org/reports/FBgn0004652 ! expresses fru
relationship: RO:0013001 FBbt:00007054 ! has synaptic IO in region superior lateral protocerebrum
relationship: RO:0013001 FBbt:00110639 ! has synaptic IO in region adult subesophageal zone
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2021-08-02T08:58:56Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00051432
name: adult Drosulfakinin MP3 neuron
def: "Adult neuron that secretes Drosulfakinin and is found in a cluster of two cells in each hemisphere, lateral to the MP1 cells in the medial protocerebrum (Nichols and Lim, 1996; Wu et al., 2019). It projects to the superior medial and lateral protocerebrum and the lateral horn (Wu et al., 2019). It is predominantly ipsilateral, but in some cases extends a short way into the contralateral hemisphere in the dorsal part of the brain (Wu et al., 2019). It also expresses fruitless, but is not sexually dimorphic (Wu et al., 2019)." [FlyBase:FBrf0085661, FlyBase:FBrf0243806]
is_a: FBbt:00005106 ! neuron
relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00003625 ! has soma location adult brain cell body rind
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0002790 ! capable of peptide secretion
relationship: RO:0002292 http://flybase.org/reports/FBgn0000500 ! expresses Dsk
relationship: RO:0002292 http://flybase.org/reports/FBgn0004652 ! expresses fru
