id: FBbt:00051479
name: adult bolt protocerebral neuron
def: "Adult neuron with its soma in the posterior superior margin of the brain, dendrites in the lateral protocerebrum and axons that project along the contralateral midline towards the subesophageal zone (Bidaye et al., 2020). It is involved in long, straight, fast forwards walking (Bidaye et al., 2020). There are eight of these cells per hemisphere (Bidaye et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0247235]
is_a: FBbt:00005106 ! neuron
relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00100308 ! has soma location adult superior brain cell body rind
relationship: RO:0002216 GO:0007628 ! capable of part of adult walking behavior
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00007145 ! receives synaptic input in region adult protocerebrum
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00045047 ! sends synaptic output to region adult periesophageal neuropils
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2021-08-19T14:55:05Z" xsd:dateTime

