def: "Adult lateral horn local neuron of the AV4d5 group that fasciculates with the AV4 primary neurite tract (Schlegel et al., 2021). It is a secondary neuron that is part of the BLD4 (LHl1) lateral hemilineage (Schlegel et al., 2021). There are approximately four of these cells per hemisphere and they are GABAergic (Schlegel et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0249560]
comment: Cell type found in both hemibrain and FAFB (Schlegel et al., 2021). Neurotransmitter predicted based on lineage (Schlegel et al., 2021).
