def: "Adult lateral horn output neuron of the AD1g1 group that fasciculates with the AD1 primary neurite tract (Schlegel et al., 2021). It also innervates the anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum, combining olfactory and visual inputs (Taisz et al., 2023). There is approximately one of these neurons per hemisphere (Schlegel et al., 2021) and it is cholinergic (Taisz et al., 2023)." [FlyBase:FBrf0249560, FlyBase:FBrf0256726]
