name: adult lateral horn PV4i5 neuron
def: "Adult lateral horn neuron of the PV4i5 group that fasciculates with the PV4 primary neurite tract (Schlegel et al., 2021). It is a secondary neuron that develops from the BLP4 (LHp1) neuroblast (Schlegel et al., 2021). There are roughly 2-3 of these neurons per hemisphere and they are glutamatergic (Schlegel et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0249560]
comment: Cell type found in both hemibrain and FAFB (Schlegel et al., 2021). Neurotransmitter predicted based on lineage (Schlegel et al., 2021). Schlegel et al. (2021) list 1 individual each of LHLN and LHON.
synonym: "adult LHPV4i5 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0249560]
synonym: "adult posterior ventral tract 4 neuron i5" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0242477]
synonym: "adult PV4i5 neuron" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00047096 ! secondary neuron
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00003624 ! part of adult brain
relationship: RO:0002101 FBbt:00049291 ! fasciculates with adult posterior ventral primary neurite tract 4
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00100628 ! develops from neuroblast BLP4
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0061535 ! capable of glutamate secretion, neurotransmission
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00007053 ! receives synaptic input in region adult lateral horn
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2021-10-08T14:29:41Z" xsd:dateTime

