relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0000618 ! has characteristic bilateral
relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00049781 ! has soma location cell body rind of adult subesophageal zone
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0014055 ! capable of acetylcholine secretion, neurotransmission
relationship: RO:0002216 GO:0008343 ! capable of part of adult feeding behavior
relationship: RO:0002216 GO:0050916 ! capable of part of sensory perception of sweet taste
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00048022 ! receives synaptic input in region posterior maxillary sensory center zone 4
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00048022 ! sends synaptic output to region posterior maxillary sensory center zone 4
relationship: RO:0013008 FBbt:00049614 ! receives synaptic input from neuron sugar-sensing neuron
relationship: RO:0013008 FBbt:00049615 ! receives synaptic input from neuron salt-sensing neuron
relationship: RO:0013010 FBbt:00014013 ! synapses restricted to region adult gnathal ganglion
