[Term]
id: FBbt:00051854
name: adult balloon subesophageal neuron
def: "Adult local neuron with its soma in the ventral gnathal ganglion (Sterne et al., 2021). It has both dendritic and axonal arborization in the gnathal ganglion, with mixed synapse distribution within this region (Sterne et al., 2021). It is bilateral, with most of its innervation occupying a large region of the subesophageal zone of the contralateral hemisphere (Sterne et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0251280]
