[Term]
id: FBbt:00051968
name: labellar mechanosensory bristle
def: "Bristle on the outer surface of the labellum that is solely mechanosensory (Shanbhag et al., 2001). There are two of these on each side and they are found in a lateral position (Shanbhag et al., 2001)." [FlyBase:FBrf0137194, FlyBase:FBrf0152351, FlyBase:FBrf0248869]
