[Term]
id: FBbt:00052052
name: female genital primordium
def: "Ventral region of the genital disc that derives from abdominal segment 8 (Keisman et al., 2001). By third instar stage, it constitutes the majority of the disc in the female, but a much smaller proportion in the male (Keisman et al., 2001). In females, it produces the majority of adult female genital structures, in the male it produces a miniature eighth tergite (Keisman et al., 2001)." [FlyBase:FBrf0037847, FlyBase:FBrf0040174, FlyBase:FBrf0091028, FlyBase:FBrf0141451]
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00001755 ! part of larval abdominal segment 8
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00001784 ! part of genital disc
relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0002451 ! has characteristic sexually dimorphic
