property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2022-01-17T11:34:59Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00052054
name: anal primordium
def: "Posterior dorsal region of the genital disc that derives from abdominal segment 10 (Keisman et al., 2001). It gives rise to the adult analia (Casares et al., 1997; Keisman et al., 2001) and hindgut (Chen and Baker, 1997)." [FlyBase:FBrf0091028, FlyBase:FBrf0098967, FlyBase:FBrf0141451]
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00001757 ! part of larval abdominal segment 10
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00001784 ! part of genital disc
