property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2022-01-17T13:04:49Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00052055
name: female genital primordium (female)
def: "Female genital primordium of the female genital disc. It expands greatly during larval development and generates most of the female genital structures (Keisman et al., 2001)." [FlyBase:FBrf0040174, FlyBase:FBrf0064788, FlyBase:FBrf0141451]
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00001787 ! part of female genital disc
