[Term]
id: FBbt:00052057
name: epigynial dorsal lobe
def: "Dorsal portion of the epigynium above the epigynial ventral lobe (McQueen et al., 2022). The two dorsal lobes (left and right) are fused dorsally into a single sclerite (McQueen et al., 2022). It does not harbor sensilla (bristles) (McQueen et al., 2022)." [FlyBase:FBrf0253444]
