[Term]
id: FBbt:00052063
name: hypogynial posterior lobe
def: "The posterior portion of each hypogynial valve, posterior to an imaginary line connecting the hypogynial long sensillum and the hypogynial mid-dorsal incision (McQueen et al., 2022). It is double-walled and carries on the outer wall a series of sensilla that are larger and less interspaced than those carried by the anterior lobe (McQueen et al., 2022). On the inner wall, there are three terminal, minute trichoid sensilla and one subterminal, long sensillum (McQueen et al., 2022). The outer wall is sclerotized, lobate, and harbors the posterodorsal pouch (McQueen et al., 2022)." [FlyBase:FBrf0253444]
synonym: "distal part of oviscapt valve" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0253444]
synonym: "dorsal vaginal plate" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0111374, FlyBase:FBrf0253444]
synonym: "mesal surface of oviscapt" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0253444]
synonym: "upper margin of egg guide lobe" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0253444]
is_a: FBbt:00007288 ! integumentary specialization
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00004832 ! part of hypogynium
relationship: RO:0002150 FBbt:00052064 ! continuous with hypogynial anterior lobe
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2022-01-18T16:37:49Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00052064
name: hypogynial anterior lobe
def: "The anterior portion of each hypogynial valve, anterior to an imaginary line connecting the hypogynial long sensillum to the hypogynial mid-dorsal incision (McQueen et al., 2022). It is double-walled, slightly-rounded and carries a series of teeth that are smaller and more interspaced than those carried by the hypogynial posterior lobe (McQueen et al., 2022)." [FlyBase:FBrf0253444]
synonym: "lower margin of egg guide lobe" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0253444]
synonym: "ventral vaginal plate" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0111374, FlyBase:FBrf0253444]
is_a: FBbt:00007288 ! integumentary specialization
