[Term]
id: FBbt:00052112
name: lateral antennal lobe tract projection neuron 4 (male)
def: "Lateral antennal lobe tract projection neuron (lPN4) of the male. It has a greater number of branches in the protocerebrum than the lPN4 cell in the female and additionally innervates the DA1 glomerulus (Tanaka et al., 2021). It is activated following cis-vaccenyl acetate (cVA) exposure and inhibited following application of female cuticular pheromones to the forelegs (Tanaka et al., 2021). It suppresses wing extension during courtship until after tapping behavior has occurred (Tanaka et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0251877]
synonym: "adult multiglomerular lv2PN lALT (male)" EXACT []
synonym: "AL-lPN4 (male)" EXACT []
synonym: "male lPN4" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0251877]
relationship: RO:0002216 GO:0008049 ! capable of part of male courtship behavior
relationship: RO:0002216 GO:0019236 ! capable of part of response to pheromone
relationship: RO:0002216 GO:0050909 ! capable of part of sensory perception of taste
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00003932 ! receives synaptic input in region antennal lobe glomerulus DA1
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2022-02-08T09:57:59Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00052113
name: lateral antennal lobe tract projection neuron 4 (female)
def: "Lateral antennal lobe tract projection neuron (lPN4) of the female. It has a smaller number of branches in the protocerebrum than the lPN4 cell in the male and does not innervate the DA1 glomerulus (Tanaka et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0251877]
comment: Horne et al. (2018) - FBrf0240823 find 3 lPN4 cells in their female VA1v EM reconstruction, but other data (including hemibrain) suggest just one.
synonym: "adult multiglomerular lv2PN lALT (female)" EXACT []
synonym: "AL-lPN4 (female)" EXACT []
synonym: "female lPN4" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0251877]
