[Term]
id: FBbt:00052130
name: adult prothoracic 9Aalpha2 neuron
def: "Adult GABAergic interneuron of hemilineage 9A with its soma in the prothoracic neuromere and neurites extending anteriorly, similar to femoral chordotonal claw neurons (Agrawal et al., 2020). It encodes flexed tibial positions via tonic changes in membrane potential and firing rate (Agrawal et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0247582]
