id: FBbt:00052225
name: adult roundtree subesophageal neuron
def: "Adult premotor neuron that receives input from gustatory system neurons in the subesophageal zone (Shiu et al., 2022). It is predicted to be a cholinergic (Shiu et al., 2022) primary neuron (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024). There are 2 of these cells per organism (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0254006, FlyBase:FBrf0260535, FlyBase:FBrf0260546]
