name: immature T5 neuron
def: "Immature secondary neuron that is a precursor to an adult T5 neuron (Hormann et al., 2020). It is generated from a neuroblast that amplifies by symmetric division (type III) before generating the T5 (and T4) neurons (Mora et al., 2018). During its development, it first projects its axon to the appropriate lobula plate layer, then forms its dendrites in lobula layer 1 (Hormann et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0238554, FlyBase:FBrf0245647]
