[Term]
id: FBbt:00052271
name: larval light avoidance neuron
def: "Larval neuron with its soma in the dorsolateral supraesophageal ganglion, dendrites in the superior protocerebrum, where it receives input from Pdf neurons, and a smaller contralateral branch (Gong et al., 2010). Its activity results in light avoidance behavior (Gong et al., 2010). There are two of these cells per hemisphere (Gong et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0212127]
comment: Only referred to as 'NP394-Gal4 neuron' in Gong et al. (2010). Synapsing with Pdf neurons shown by GRASP and functional experiments (Gong et al., 2010).
is_a: FBbt:00005106 ! neuron
relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0000618 ! has characteristic bilateral
relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00111226 ! has soma location cell body rind of larval brain
relationship: RO:0002216 GO:0046957 ! capable of part of negative phototaxis
relationship: RO:0002216 GO:0050953 ! capable of part of sensory perception of light stimulus
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00052193 ! receives synaptic input in region larval superior protocerebrum
relationship: RO:0013008 FBbt:00100166 ! receives synaptic input from neuron larval Pdf neuron
