[Term]
id: FBbt:00052299
name: adult female pheromone-sensing neuron of leg
def: "Adult gustatory neuron of the leg that detects female pheromones (Thistle et al., 2012; Kallman et al., 2015). It can be distinguished from male-pheromone-detecting cells based on its expression of ppk25 (Kallman et al., 2015). It is glutamatergic (Kallman et al., 2015). These cells do not ascend to the brain (Kallman et al., 2015)." [FlyBase:FBrf0218411, FlyBase:FBrf0230436]
subset: cur
synonym: "F cell of leg" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0230436]
synonym: "leg PPK23+ PPK25+ neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0230436]
is_a: FBbt:00052294 ! adult pheromone-sensing neuron of leg
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0061535 ! capable of glutamate secretion, neurotransmission
relationship: RO:0002292 http://flybase.org/reports/FBgn0053349 ! expresses ppk25
