[Term]
id: FBbt:00052301
name: adult pheromone-sensing CCAP neuron of leg
def: "Adult pheromone-sensing neuron of the leg that expresses crustacean cardioactive peptide (CCAP), which it releases in the ventral nerve cord (Zhang et al., 2022)." [FlyBase:FBrf0252940]
comment: Some of these cells express fruitless and some are male pheromone-detecting (Zhang et al., 2022). Only studied in males by Zhang et al. (2022).
