[Term]
id: FBbt:00052353
name: adult A1-A5 heart CCAP neuron
def: "Adult heart CCAP neuron with its soma in an abdominal 1-5 segment (Dulcis and Levine, 2003). Its soma is located near the row of spiracles and its axon follows a transverse nerve to reach the heart (Dulcis and Levine, 2003). There is one of these on each side in each of abdominal segments 1-5 (Dulcis and Levine, 2003)." [FlyBase:FBrf0162213]
synonym: "CCAP BpN1-5 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0162213]
synonym: "CCAP BpNs1-5 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0162213]
