property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2022-10-18T11:55:35Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00052354
name: adult A6 heart CCAP neuron
def: "Adult heart CCAP neuron that has its soma in abdominal segment 6 (Dulcis and Levine, 2003). It innervates the terminal chamber of the heart (Dulcis and Levine, 2003). There are four of these cells per organism, which have large somas and are found together as a medial cluster (Dulcis and Levine, 2003)." [FlyBase:FBrf0162213]
