[Term]
id: FBbt:00052356
name: wing sleep gustatory projection neuron
def: "Ascending neuron that receives gustatory input from wing chemosensory (Ir52a) neurons in the wing neuropil and projects to the subesophageal zone and ventrolateral protocerebrum via a medial tract (Melnattur et al., 2020). It is involved in the regulation of sleep (Melnattur et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0245821]
