[Term]
id: FBbt:00052365
name: larval abdominal Orcokinin A neuron
def: "Larval neuron that expresses the A isoform of Orcokinin and has its soma in a larval abdominal neuromere (Chen et al., 2015). There is one of these per abdominal 1-5 hemineuromere, with a laterally-located soma (Chen et al., 2015)." [FlyBase:FBrf0228562]
comment: Distinct from Leucokinin neurons (Chen et al., 2015). These are the only Orcokinin neurons found in the third instar CNS (Chen et al., 2015).
