[Term]
id: FBbt:00052369
name: embryonic glial cell
def: "Glial cell of the embryo that has not yet reached its mature larval form. These cells may further divide (or die), migrate or extend processes prior to adopting their mature larval forms, positions and numbers (Ito et al., 1995)." [FlyBase:FBrf0082171]
