[Term]
id: FBbt:00052379
name: adult secondary neuropil glial cell
def: "Neuropil glial cell of the adult that is born during the post-embryonic stage (Kato et al., 2020). It arises from a type II neuroblast (Omoto et al., 2015). In the brain, these cells tend to occupy a posterior-superior area (Kato et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0229106, FlyBase:FBrf0245107]
