[Term]
id: FBbt:00052393
name: anterior abdominal segment
def: "One of abdominal segments 1-7 (Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997; Birkholz et al., 2013). These segments have a relatively consistent pattern of neuroblasts, neurons, musculature and sense organs from one segment to the next (Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997; Birkholz et al., 2013)." [FlyBase:FBrf0041814, FlyBase:FBrf0221210]
