relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00111041 ! part of larval abdominal 9 neuromere
relationship: RO:0002292 http://flybase.org/reports/FBgn0000504 ! expresses dsx
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2022-11-08T08:45:17Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00052515
name: larval abdominal 9 neuroblast NB5-4 (female)
def: "Neuroblast NB5-4 found in female abdominal segment 9 at the larval stage. It begins to express doublesex in the late embryo, then undergoes programmed cell death in the early larva without producing a secondary lineage (Birkholz et al., 2013)." [FlyBase:FBrf0221210]
synonym: "A9 NB5-4 (female)" EXACT []
synonym: "female Dsx+tNB" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0243282]
