[Term]
id: FBbt:00052552
name: early-born larval EL neuron
def: "Larval EL neuron that has a relatively early birth order in the NB3-3 lineage (Wreden et al., 2017; Wang et al., 2022). These neurons form part of a different circuit to the late-born neurons, contributing to rolling escape behavior in response to mechanical stimuli (Wreden et al., 2017)." [FlyBase:FBrf0235557, FlyBase:FBrf0254149]
