[Term]
id: FBbt:00052564
name: antennal lobe lateral commissural pioneer interneuron
def: "Antennal lobe commissural pioneer interneuron (cPIN) that forms dendrites in a relatively lateral region of the antennal lobe (Kaur et al., 2019). It begins to form a commissure at around 1 h after pupa formation and this commissure is distinct from that of the medial CPINs (Kaur et al., 2019)." [FlyBase:FBrf0243918]
