[Term]
id: FBbt:00052603
name: arculum
def: "Tooth-shaped structure of the distal femur (Mamiya et al., 2023). It decomposes movement of the femur-tibia joint into orthogonal components (Mamiya et al., 2023). It is coupled to the base of the tibia tendon and the tibia joint (Mamiya et al., 2023)." [FlyBase:FBrf0257853]
