comment: Obsoleted as unclear now how this differs from the broadened (based on Sturner et al. (2025) - FlyBase:FBrf0262850) oviDN class. Types in Vijayan et al. (2023) were mapped to hemibrain bodyIDs of different Sturner et al. (2025) subtypes.
