[Term]
id: FBbt:00052624
name: adult Epi descending neuron
def: "Adult descending neuron that has a large soma in the brain. Its dendrites are mainly found in the dorsal brain, including in the optic lobe and lateral horn (Liu et al., 2023). It has extensive axonal arborization in the brain, including the optic lobe, mushroom body and subesophageal zone, as well as all neuromeres of the ventral nerve cord (Liu et al., 2023). It responds to noxiously high temperatures via the painless receptor and releases Allatostatin C to alleviate thermal nociception (Liu et al., 2023). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Liu et al., 2023)." [FlyBase:FBrf0256813]
synonym: "adult Epi DN" EXACT []
synonym: "Epione neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0256813]
is_a: FBbt:00049286 ! adult lateral horn output neuron
relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00003625 ! has soma location adult brain cell body rind
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0030072 ! capable of peptide hormone secretion
relationship: RO:0002292 http://flybase.org/reports/FBgn0032336 ! expresses AstC
relationship: RO:0002292 http://flybase.org/reports/FBgn0060296 ! expresses pain
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00003701 ! receives synaptic input in region adult optic lobe
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00007053 ! receives synaptic input in region adult lateral horn
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00003684 ! sends synaptic output to region adult mushroom body
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00003701 ! sends synaptic output to region adult optic lobe
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00110173 ! sends synaptic output to region adult abdominal neuromere
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00110174 ! sends synaptic output to region adult prothoracic neuromere
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00110175 ! sends synaptic output to region adult mesothoracic neuromere
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00110176 ! sends synaptic output to region adult metathoracic neuromere
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00110639 ! sends synaptic output to region adult subesophageal zone
