property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2023-09-05T10:02:40Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00052625
name: adult Mip antennal lobe local neuron
def: "Adult antennal lobe local neuron that releases Myoinhibitory peptide (Sizemore et al., 2023). These neurons all have a patchy morphology and are also GABAergic (Sizemore et al., 2023). There are approximately 9 of these cells per antennal lobe and they collectively innervate all glomeruli (Sizemore et al., 2023)." [FlyBase:FBrf0257390]
comment: There are not this many AL mip neurons expressing Mip protein or mRNA (Min et al., 2016 - FBrf0231362).
