property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2023-09-12T11:51:50Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00052627
name: dorsal scoloparium of femoral chordotonal organ
def: "Scoloparium that contains the dendrites of all club neurons of a femoral chordotonal organ (Mamiya et al., 2023). It is the largest and most dorsal scoloparium of the femoral chordotonal organ (Mamiya et al., 2023). Cell bodies in this scoloparium tend to move very little during joint extension and flexion (Mamiya et al., 2023)." [FlyBase:FBrf0257853]
comment: Mamiya et al. (2023) are inconsistent with use of 'group 1', 'group 2' and 'group 3' terminology, so these synonyms have not been added cp231212.
