[Term]
id: FBbt:00052640
name: adult CA-LP neuron
def: "Adult Dh31 neuron with its soma in the dorsal brain and an axon projecting to the corpus allatum (Kurogi et al., 2023) via the nervus corporis cardiaci (McKim et al., 2024). These neurons derive from the larval CA-LP neurons (Kurogi et al., 2023). There are three of these cells per hemisphere (Kurogi et al., 2023). In the female, they are involved in reproductive dormancy (Kurogi et al., 2023)." [doi:10.7554/eLife.102684.1, FlyBase:FBrf0256549]
comment: Distinct from the three LP neurons (FBbt:00007432) - different hemibrain body IDs given in Kurogi et al. (2023) supplement. Also present in males, but function not investigated by Kurogi et al. (2023).
synonym: "adult DH31CA neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0256549]
synonym: "adult l-NSC DH31" EXACT [doi:10.7554/eLife.102684.1]
is_a: FBbt:00047095 ! adult neuron
relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00007145 ! has soma location adult protocerebrum
relationship: RO:0002101 FBbt:00053390 ! fasciculates with adult nervus corporis cardiaci
relationship: RO:0002131 FBbt:00003215 ! overlaps adult corpus allatum
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0030072 ! capable of peptide hormone secretion
relationship: RO:0002292 http://flybase.org/reports/FBgn0032048 ! expresses Dh31
