[Term]
id: FBbt:00052665
name: embryonic immature dorsal bipolar dendrite neuron
def: "Immature primary neuron that will become a larval dorsal bipolar dendrite neuron (Heckman and Doe, 2022). At embryonic stage 14, it has just entered the dorsal central nervous system (Heckman and Doe, 2022). It forms anterior-posterior bilateral branches close to the midline by stage 15, linking adjacent segments and occupying a more ventral region of the neuropil in stage 17 (Heckman and Doe, 2022)." [FlyBase:FBrf0255224]
synonym: "immature dbd neuron" EXACT []
