[Term]
id: FBbt:00052691
name: adult fruitless aIP-c neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron that develops from neuroblast BLAv1 (VLPl&d1) (Ito et al., 2013; Yu et al., 2013). There are different numbers in the male and female and their somas form two clusters close to the ventrolateral protocerebrum (Kimura et al., 2008; Cachero et al., 2010; Yu et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0205974, FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0211926, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438]
comment: Yu et al. (2010) - FBrf0211884 map aIP1 to Cachero et al. (2010) aIP-d and to AL6b from Kimura et al. (2008) - FBrf0205974, but Cachero et al. (2010) map aIP1 (and AL6b and AL5b) to aIP-c. Ito et al. (2013) - FBrf0221438 also give lineage as VLPl&d1 for aIP-c and AL5b/6b.
synonym: "adult aIP1 neuron" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
synonym: "adult AL5b neuron" NARROW [FlyBase:FBrf0205974]
synonym: "adult AL6b neuron" NARROW [FlyBase:FBrf0205974, FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
synonym: "adult fru-AL neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543, FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2023-11-10T14:31:55Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00052692
name: adult fruitless aDT-e neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron that develops from neuroblast ALl1 (Ito et al., 2013; Yu et al., 2013). There are approximately 29 of these per hemisphere (Cachero et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211926, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438]
comment: Lineage is ALl1 (lPN) according to Ito et al. (2013) and includes DA1 PNs in Cachero et al. (2010), so this is a parent to the DA1 lPN (FBbt:00067363).
synonym: "adult fru-AL neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543, FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
synonym: "adult fruitless aDT3 neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
synonym: "adult fruitless AL3 neuron" NARROW [FlyBase:FBrf0205974, FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
