[Term]
id: FBbt:00052700
name: adult fruitless aSP-b neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron that develops from neuroblast SMPad2 (Ito et al., 2013; Yu et al., 2013). There are different numbers of these in males and females, with their somas in the pars intercerebralis (Lee et al., 2000; Cachero et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0128543, FlyBase:FBrf0205974, FlyBase:FBrf0211926, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438]
comment: Correspondence of Yu et al. (2010) - FBrf0211884 aSP1 to aSP1 in other studies is unclear - they also seem to call this aSP2-p in fig S2 and give contradictory correspondences in table S1. and Cachero et al. (2010) list Yu et al. (2010) aSP1 as possibly corresponding to aSP-b and aSP-c.
