[Term]
id: FBbt:00052702
name: adult fruitless aSP-i neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron derived from the DALcl1 (AOTUv3) neuroblast (Ito et al., 2013; Yu et al., 2013). It has its cell body ventral to the anterior optic tubercle (AOTU) and it arborizes in a dorsal region of the AOTU in both hemispheres (Yu et al., 2010). It receives input from LC10a neurons in the AOTU (Nojima et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0205974, FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0211926, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438, FlyBase:FBrf0248430]
