[Term]
id: FBbt:00052727
name: wing axillary muscle hg3 motor neuron
def: "Motor neuron that innervates the internal muscle of the fourth axillary 58a (hg3) (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). In the dorsal mesothoracic neuromere, it has roughly symmetrical arborization in both hemispheres of the dorsomedial neuropil and an extra ipsilateral lateral arbor (Ehrhardt et al., 2023). In the male, its activity affects pulse song (Ehrhardt et al., 2023)." [doi:10.1101/2023.05.31.542897]
