[Term]
id: FBbt:00052784
name: ventral postorbital bristle
def: "Postorbital bristle with a relatively ventral position that is innervated by a mechanosensory neuron that fasciculates with the eye nerve (Eichler et al., 2024). There are approximately 12 of these on each side (Eichler et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0259346]
synonym: "lower postorbital bristle" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0044923]
synonym: "vPoOr bristle" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0259346]
