[Term]
id: FBbt:00052788
name: mechanosensory neuron of antennal bristle
def: "Mechanosensory neuron that has its dendrite in an antennal bristle. It follows the antennal nerve and terminates in the subesophageal zone (Eichler et al., 2024). In the brain, it has a contralateral projection (Eichler et al., 2024). There is one of these per antennal bristle (around 20 per side) (Eichler et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0259346]
synonym: "BM-Ant neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0259346]
relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0000618 ! has characteristic bilateral
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00110639 ! sends synaptic output to region adult subesophageal zone
