property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2024-02-08T11:09:26Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00052789
name: mechanosensory neuron of frontal bristle
def: "Mechanosensory neuron that has its dendrite in a frontal bristle. It follows the antennal nerve and terminates in the subesophageal zone (Eichler et al., 2024). In the brain, it has a contralateral projection (Eichler et al., 2024). There is one of these per frontal bristle (around 5-6 per side) (Eichler et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0259346]
synonym: "BM-Fr neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0259346]
relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0000618 ! has characteristic bilateral
