[Term]
id: FBbt:00052790
name: mechanosensory neuron of fronto-orbital bristle
def: "Mechanosensory neuron that has its dendrite in a fronto-orbital bristle. It follows the antennal nerve and terminates in the subesophageal zone (Eichler et al., 2024). There is one of these per fronto-orbital bristle (around 5 per side) (Eichler et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0259346]
synonym: "BM-FrOr neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0259346]
