[Term]
id: FBbt:00052791
name: mechanosensory neuron of orbital bristle
def: "Mechanosensory neuron that has its dendrite in an orbital bristle. It follows the antennal nerve and terminates in the subesophageal zone (Eichler et al., 2024). There is one of these per orbital bristle (3 per side) (Eichler et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0259346]
synonym: "BM-Or neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0259346]
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00110639 ! sends synaptic output to region adult subesophageal zone
