[Term]
id: FBbt:00052792
name: mechanosensory neuron of interocellar bristle
def: "Mechanosensory neuron that has its dendrite in a interocellar bristle. It follows the antennal nerve and terminates in the subesophageal zone (Eichler et al., 2024). In the brain, it has a contralateral projection (Eichler et al., 2024). There is one of these per interocellar bristle (around 3-4 per side) (Eichler et al., 2024). Its activity elicits head grooming behavior (Eichler et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0259346]
synonym: "BM-InOc neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0259346]
