[Term]
id: FBbt:00052793
name: mechanosensory neuron of vibrissal bristle
def: "Mechanosensory neuron that has its dendrite in a vibrissal bristle (Eichler et al., 2024). Some of these neurons follow the antennal nerve and some follow the eye nerve (Eichler et al., 2024). These all terminate in the subesophageal zone (Eichler et al., 2024). There is one of these per vibrissal bristle (around 15 per side) (Eichler et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0259346]
synonym: "BM-Vib neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0259346]
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00110639 ! sends synaptic output to region adult subesophageal zone
