[Term]
id: FBbt:00052795
name: mechanosensory neuron of ventral postorbital bristle
def: "Mechanosensory neuron that has its dendrite in a ventral postorbital bristle. It follows the eye nerve and terminates in the subesophageal zone (Eichler et al., 2024). There is one of these per ventral postorbital bristle (around 12 per side) (Eichler et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0259346]
synonym: "BM-vPoOr neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0259346]
