[Term]
id: FBbt:00052797
name: mechanosensory neuron of vertical bristle
def: "Mechanosensory neuron that has its dendrite in a vertical bristle. It follows the occipital nerve and terminates in the subesophageal zone (Eichler et al., 2024). There is one of these per vertical bristle (around four per side) (Eichler et al., 2024). Its activity elicits head grooming behavior (Eichler et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0259346]
synonym: "BM-Vt neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0259346]
