[Term]
id: FBbt:00052799
name: mechanosensory neuron of maxillary palp bristle
def: "Mechanosensory neuron that has its dendrite in a maxillary palp bristle. It follows the maxillary nerve, joining the combined maxillary-labial nerve to enter the brain, terminating in the subesophageal zone (Eichler et al., 2024). There is one of these per maxillary palp bristle (around 15-20 per side) (Eichler et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0259346]
synonym: "BM-MaPa neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0259346]
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00110639 ! sends synaptic output to region adult subesophageal zone
