[Term]
id: FBbt:00052813
name: ocellar ganglion interneuron type 01
def: "Ocellar interneuron with a large diameter (Caldwell et al., 2007; Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024). There are four of these per ganglion, totaling twelve per organism (Caldwell et al., 2007; Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024). They collectively tile all three ocellar ganglia in each organism (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0200339, FlyBase:FBrf0260535, FlyBase:FBrf0260546]
synonym: "giant ocellar interneuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0200339]
synonym: "OCG01 projection neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0260546]
