[Term]
id: FBbt:00052815
name: ocellar ganglion local neuron
def: "Local neuron of the ocellar ganglia (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024). It is a small neuron that connects sparsely with photoreceptors from all ocelli (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024). There are approximately 16 of these per organism (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0260535, FlyBase:FBrf0260546]
