[Term]
id: FBbt:00052817
name: medial ocellar ganglion interneuron type 01
def: "Ocellar ganglion interneuron type 01 that receives input in a medial ocellar ganglion (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024). There are four of these per medial ocellar ganglion (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0260535, FlyBase:FBrf0260546]
intersection_of: FBbt:00052813 ! ocellar ganglion interneuron type 01
