property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2024-02-12T17:15:55Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00052818
name: ocellar centrifugal neuron
def: "Centrifugal neuron with dendrites in the brain and an axon that projects to an ocellar ganglion, providing feedback to the ocellar interneurons (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024). There are approximately 25 of these per brain (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0260535, FlyBase:FBrf0260546]
is_a: FBbt:00059244 ! adult visual centrifugal neuron
relationship: RO:0002101 FBbt:00003699 ! fasciculates with ocellar nerve
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00003624 ! receives synaptic input in region adult brain
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00049817 ! sends synaptic output to region ocellar ganglion
relationship: RO:0013009 FBbt:00049818 ! sends synaptic output to cell ocellar ganglion interneuron
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2024-02-13T08:30:10Z" xsd:dateTime

