[Term]
id: FBbt:00053043
name: adult bilateral fruitless dMS2 neuron
def: "Adult fruitless dMS2 neuron with arbors in both sides of the ventral nerve cord (Lillvis et al., 2024). In males, it is involved in sine, but not pulse, song generation (Lillvis et al., 2024). There are approximately 12 of these cells per organism (Lillvis et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0258823]
comment: Only studied in males in Lillvis et al. (2024).
