[Term]
id: FBbt:00053063
name: lineage 15 secondary accessory tibial flexor muscle motor neuron
def: "Adult lineage 15 secondary motor neuron that innervates an accessory tibial flexor (tibial reductor) muscle (Brierley et al., 2012). It is born after pretarsal depressor muscle motor neurons (Brierley et al., 2012). Its dendritic arbors are predominantly in the intermediate-lateral ipsilateral leg neuropil (Brierley et al., 2012)." [FlyBase:FBrf0218373]
