[Term]
id: FBbt:00053064
name: early-born lineage 24 intracoxal trochanter levator muscle motor neuron
def: "Adult motor neuron that is the first-born secondary motor neuron of lineage 24 and innervates an intracoxal trochanter levator muscle (Brierley et al., 2012). There is one of these cells per thoracic hemineuromere, with its soma in the anterior cell body rind region (Brierley et al., 2012). Its dendritic arbors are predominantly in the intermediate-lateral ipsilateral leg neuropil (Brierley et al., 2012)." [FlyBase:FBrf0218373]
is_a: FBbt:00005123 ! motor neuron
is_a: FBbt:00047096 ! secondary neuron
relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0000634 ! has characteristic unilateral
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00001415 ! develops from neuroblast NB4-4
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00047139 ! receives synaptic input in region adult leg neuropil
relationship: RO:0013009 FBbt:00003326 ! sends synaptic output to cell intracoxal trochanter levator muscle cell
