[Term]
id: FBbt:00053067
name: prothoracic tarsal retro depressor muscle motor neuron
def: "Adult motor neuron that innervates a prothoracic tarsal retro depressor muscle and has its soma in the (anterior) prothoracic neuromere (Brierley et al., 2012; Azevedo et al., 2024). There is one of these cells per thoracic hemineuromere and it is a late-born lineage 15 secondary neuron (Brierley et al., 2012). Its dendritic arbors are predominantly in the ventral intermediate-lateral ipsilateral leg neuropil (Brierley et al., 2012) and it follows the prothoracic leg nerve (Azevedo et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0218373, FlyBase:FBrf0259940]
