[Term]
id: FBbt:00053071
name: femoral pretarsal depressor muscle secondary motor neuron
def: "Adult secondary motor neuron that innervates the femoral pretarsal depressor muscle (Brierley et al., 2012). It is a lineage 15 neuron, born slightly before the tibial pretarsal depressor muscle secondary motor neuron (Brierley et al., 2012). Its dendritic arborization is mainly found in the ipsilateral leg neuropil, with a prominent posterior branch extending a short distance into the contralateral hemineuromere (Brierley et al., 2012)." [FlyBase:FBrf0218373]
