name: neck muscle motor neuron of brain
def: "Adult neck muscle motor neuron with its soma in the brain (Gorko et al., 2024). Its axon enters the cervical connective, but exits before reaching the ventral nerve cord to reach its muscle target (Gorko et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0259326]
