relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00051025 ! has soma location cell body rind of adult ventral gnathal ganglion
relationship: RO:0013001 FBbt:00110639 ! has synaptic IO in region adult subesophageal zone
relationship: RO:0013009 FBbt:00003295 ! sends synaptic output to cell muscle cell of dorsal cervical muscle 20
