[Term]
id: FBbt:00053177
name: adult dorsal prothoracic nerve neck motor neuron
def: "Adult neck muscle motor neuron that reaches its muscle target via the dorsal prothoracic nerve (Gorko et al., 2024). It has its soma in the ventral nerve cord (Gorko et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0259326]
synonym: "adult DProN motor neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0259326]
