[Term]
id: FBbt:00053178
name: adult transverse horizontal neck muscle 1
def: "Long dorsal neck muscle that passes above the pleural apodeme (apophysis) and has its posterior attachment slightly dorsoposterior to TH2 (Gorko et al., 2024). It tapers to a tendon that attaches to the posterior head (Gorko et al., 2024). It is innervated by the CvN1 and CvNA1 motor neurons (Gorko et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0259326]
comment: Based on length, position and proximity of anterior end to muscle 20 (OH muscles), TH1 and TH2 probably correspond to muscle 23 in Miller (1950) - FBrf0186027.
synonym: "TH1 muscle" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0259326]
is_a: FBbt:00058821 ! dorsal cervical muscle 23
relationship: RO:0002177 FBbt:00003007 ! attached to part of adult head
relationship: RO:0002177 FBbt:00003018 ! attached to part of adult thorax
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2024-05-14T10:19:13Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00053179
name: adult transverse horizontal neck muscle 2
def: "Long dorsal neck muscle that passes below the pleural apodeme (apophysis) and has its posterior attachment slightly ventroanterior to TH1 (Gorko et al., 2024). It tapers to a tendon that attaches to the posterior head (Gorko et al., 2024). It is innervated by the CvNA2 motor neuron (Gorko et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0259326]
comment: Based on length, position and proximity of anterior end to muscle 20 (OH muscles), TH1 and TH2 probably correspond to muscle 23 in Miller (1950) - FBrf0186027.
synonym: "TH2 muscle" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0259326]
is_a: FBbt:00058821 ! dorsal cervical muscle 23
relationship: RO:0002177 FBbt:00003007 ! attached to part of adult head
relationship: RO:0002177 FBbt:00003018 ! attached to part of adult thorax
