[Term]
id: FBbt:00053224
name: adult doublesex abdominal DDAG_E (female) neuron
def: "Adult female-specific doublesex neuron that also expresses dissatisfaction and has its soma in the posterior abdominal neuromere (Diamandi et al., 2024). It has mainly ipsilateral arborization in the abdominal neuromere and an anterior projection that crosses the midline in the metathoracic neuromere then continues further anteriorly (Diamandi et al., 2024). It is a remodeled primary neuron (Diamandi et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0259097]
