[Term]
id: FBbt:00053277
name: oviposition descending neuron oviDNx
def: "Oviposition descending neuron that curves laterally into both sides of the posterior abdominal neuromere (Sturner et al., 2025). In the brain, it bifurcates near the midline forming a dorsal projection that arborizes in the superior medial protocerebrum, as well as a ventral descending branch, similar to oviDNb (Sturner et al., 2025). There are two of these cells per hemisphere (Sturner et al., 2025)." [FlyBase:FBrf0262850]
comment: One per hemisphere (DNpe034) is the female pMP1 neuron (Sturner et al., 2025).
synonym: "DNpe034" NARROW [FlyBase:FBrf0260535, FlyBase:FBrf0262850]
synonym: "DNpe047" NARROW [FlyBase:FBrf0260535, FlyBase:FBrf0262850]
