[Term]
id: FBbt:00053363
name: adult fruitless aIP-g type 3 (female) neuron
def: "Adult female aIP-g neuron with no overlapping arbors in the superior intermediate protocerebrum (Schretter et al., 2020). It has a large branch around the mushroom body pedunculus and sparse arbors beneath it (Schretter et al., 2020). There are two of these cells per hemisphere (Schretter et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0247707]
