[Term]
id: FBbt:00053375
name: adult tubercle-tubercle medial zone neuron 1
def: "Tubercle-tubercle medial zone neuron whose main (inhibitory) outputs are to LC10c neurons, with connections interspersed between LC10c output synapses (Schretter et al., 2025). It has larger action potentials than TuTuA_2 (Schretter et al., 2025). It is activated during female aggression or male courtship (Schretter et al., 2025)." [FlyBase:FBrf0261440]
