id: FBbt:00053424
name: adult lobula plate tangential neuron LPT53
def: "Adult visual centrifugal lobula plate tangential neuron with presynapses spanning around 80 columns of the posterior part of the visual field in lobula plate layer 2 and a smaller region at the posterior edge of layer 3 (Zhao et al., 2023; Nern et al., 2025). In the central brain, it remains ipsilateral, receiving input in the superior and inferior posterior slope and posterior lateral protocerebrum (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is GABA (Eckstein et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025)." [doi:10.1101/2023.10.16.562634, FlyBase:FBrf0259490, FlyBase:FBrf0260535, FlyBase:FBrf0260546, FlyBase:FBrf0262545]
