id: FBbt:00053467
name: lobula plate intrinsic neuron LPi2e
def: "Lobula plate intrinsic neuron that spans around 30 columns of layer 2, with some extensions into layer 1 (Nern et al., 2025). It has a columnar morphology and pre- and post-synapses are mixed on the same processes (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). It is predicted to be glutamatergic (Eckstein et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). There are around 45 of these cells on each side (Nern et al., 2025)." [FlyBase:FBrf0259490, FlyBase:FBrf0260535, FlyBase:FBrf0260545, FlyBase:FBrf0260546, FlyBase:FBrf0262545]
comment: Matched across 2 EM datasets by Nern et al. (2025).
