[Term]
id: FBbt:00053469
name: lobula plate intrinsic neuron LPi3b
def: "Lobula plate intrinsic neuron with dendrites that span around 40 columns of layer 3 and 20 columns of layer 4 (Nern et al., 2025). It has presynapses in both layers 3 and 4 (Nern et al., 2025). It is predicted to be glutamatergic (Eckstein et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). There are around 22 of these cells on each side (Nern et al., 2025)." [FlyBase:FBrf0259490, FlyBase:FBrf0260545, FlyBase:FBrf0262545]
