relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0000634 ! has characteristic unilateral
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0061534 ! capable of gamma-aminobutyric acid secretion, neurotransmission
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00003748 ! receives synaptic input in region medulla
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00040044 ! receives synaptic input in region posterior lateral protocerebrum
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00045003 ! receives synaptic input in region accessory medulla
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00040044 ! sends synaptic output to region posterior lateral protocerebrum
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00045003 ! sends synaptic output to region accessory medulla
