[Term]
id: FBbt:00053541
name: outer optic anlage lateral proliferation zone
def: "Zone of proliferating neuroblasts of the lateral outer optic anlage that forms in the middle of the third instar stage (Hofbauer and Campos-Ortega, 1990). Neuroblast formation and proliferation begins at the lateral edge, which is a crescent-shape surrounding the Bolwig nerve (Hofbauer and Campos-Ortega, 1990). The zone broadens and moves medially as new neuroblasts form (Hofbauer and Campos-Ortega, 1990). Approximately 6000 neurons are produced in this region, forming the lamina (Hofbauer and Campos-Ortega, 1990)." [FlyBase:FBrf0052913]
synonym: "lpo" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0052913]
synonym: "OPCl" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0236058]
