[Term]
id: FBbt:00053573
name: adult foregut-innervating sugar-sensing neuron of hypocerebral ganglion
def: "Sugar-sensing neuron of the hypocerebral ganglion that sends processes into the lumen of the foregut at the junction of the crop duct and proventriculus (Cui et al., 2024). It responds rapidly to ingestion of sucrose (Cui et al., 2024). There are 3-4 of these neurons per organism (Cui et al., 2024)." [doi:10.1101/2024.09.02.610892]
synonym: "adult foregut enteric Gr43a sensory neuron" EXACT [doi:10.1101/2024.09.02.610892]
is_a: FBbt:00058027 ! adult sugar-sensing neuron of hypocerebral ganglion
relationship: RO:0013007 FBbt:00003127 ! has sensory dendrite in adult foregut
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2025-08-18T12:34:37Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00053574
name: adult midgut surface sugar-sensing neuron of hypocerebral ganglion
def: "Sugar-sensing neuron of the hypocerebral ganglion that sends processes onto the muscles of the midgut (Cui et al., 2024). It does not enter the gut lumen (Cui et al., 2024). There are 2-3 of these neurons per organism (Cui et al., 2024)." [doi:10.1101/2024.09.02.610892]
synonym: "adult midgut surface enteric Gr43a sensory neuron" EXACT [doi:10.1101/2024.09.02.610892]
is_a: FBbt:00058027 ! adult sugar-sensing neuron of hypocerebral ganglion
relationship: RO:0002131 FBbt:00003138 ! overlaps adult midgut
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2025-08-18T12:47:39Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00053575
name: crop-innervating enteric motor neuron
def: "Glutamatergic motor neuron with its soma in the brain that extends a process along the esophagus and innervates the entry segments of the crop duct (Cui et al., 2024). Its activity closes the crop duct and it is inhibited during ingestion of sucrose (Cui et al., 2024). It is not sexually dimorphic (Cui et al., 2024)." [doi:10.1101/2024.09.02.610892]
synonym: "CEM neuron" EXACT [doi:10.1101/2024.09.02.610892]
is_a: FBbt:00048235 ! adult motor neuron
relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00003625 ! has soma location adult brain cell body rind
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0061535 ! capable of glutamate secretion, neurotransmission
relationship: RO:0013009 FBbt:00003532 ! sends synaptic output to cell adult crop circular muscle cell
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2025-08-18T14:15:35Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00053576
name: posterior uterine sensory neuron
def: "Sensory neuron with a soma flanking the posterior uterus and processes that arborize along the outer surface of the distal-most fibers of the muscle that encircles the uterus (Cury and Axel, 2023). It responds to the presence of an egg in the ovipositor and its activity extends burrowing behavior during egg laying (Cury and Axel, 2023). Its axon projects to the abdominal neuromere, where it has ventral arborizations (Cury and Axel, 2023). There are two of these cells on each side (Cury and Axel, 2023)." [FlyBase:FBrf0256706]
synonym: "PU sensory neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0256706]
is_a: FBbt:00049944 ! adult female reproductive tract mechanosensory neuron
relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00004924 ! has soma location uterus
relationship: RO:0002216 GO:0018991 ! capable of part of egg-laying behavior
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00110173 ! sends synaptic output to region adult abdominal neuromere
relationship: RO:0013007 FBbt:00004924 ! has sensory dendrite in uterus
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2025-08-18T16:24:33Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00053577
name: circular muscle of uterus motor neuron
def: "Adult motor neuron that innervates the circular muscle of the uterus with type I glutamatergic terminals (Cury and Axel, 2023). It has its soma in the abdominal neuromere and fasciculates with the abdominal nerve trunk and abdominal nerve of the uterus (Middleton et al., 2006; Cury and Axel, 2023). Its activity can cause contraction of the uterus and egg expulsion (Cury and Axel, 2023). There is one of these cells on each side (Cury and Axel, 2023)." [FlyBase:FBrf0193596, FlyBase:FBrf0256706]
synonym: "CMU motor neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0256706]
is_a: FBbt:00052021 ! type I motor neuron of oviduct/uterus
relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00111086 ! has soma location cell body rind of adult abdominal neuromere
relationship: RO:0002101 FBbt:00004099 ! fasciculates with adult abdominal nerve trunk
relationship: RO:0002101 FBbt:00007337 ! fasciculates with adult abdominal nerve to the uterus
relationship: RO:0002216 GO:0018991 ! capable of part of egg-laying behavior
relationship: RO:0013009 FBbt:00003554 ! sends synaptic output to cell uterine circular muscle cell
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2025-08-19T09:09:23Z" xsd:dateTime

