def: "Adult doublesex AbN neuron of the adult that also produces GABA. There are approximately 150 of these cells in the male and 210 in the female. Some of these neurons appear to synapse to the glutamatergic AbN neurons (Pavlou et al., 2016)." [FlyBase:FBrf0234085]
