[Term]
id: FBbt:00053637
name: adult labral sensillum
def: "Sensillum that forms part of an adult labral sense organ (LSO) (Nayak and Singh, 1983; Chen and Dahanukar, 2017). There are 9 of these per LSO: six proximal, solely mechanosensory, sensilla, one sensillum innervated by eight chemosensory neurons, and two distal sensilla, each innervated by one chemosensory and one mechanosensory neuron (Nayak and Singh, 1983; Chen and Dahanukar, 2017)." [FlyBase:FBrf0074012, FlyBase:FBrf0237413]
