id: FBbt:00058083
name: mechanosensory neuron of prothoracic coxal hair plate CoHP4
def: "Mechanosensory neuron with a dendrite in the hair plate of prothoracic coxa CoHP4. Its axonal projection enters the VNC through the prothoracic accessory nerve (Kuan et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0247324]
subset: cur
synonym: "CxHP4 MN" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0248109]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
