[Term]
id: FBbt:00058136
name: thoracic long tendon cell
def: "Cell that forms a tendon that originates in the proximal femur and extends to the pretarsus. The pretarsal depressor muscles in the femur and the tibia act on this tendon to retract the claws (Chapman, 1998; Soler et al., 2004)." [FlyBase:FBrf0180184, FlyBase:FBrf0239229]
subset: cur
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2021-05-06T12:18:45Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00058137
name: dorsal peripodial epithelium of eye disc
def: "The peripodial epithelium in the dorsal compartment of the eye disc. It is separated from the ventral peripodial epithelium by the Bolwig nerve (McClure and Schubiger, 2005) and plays a role in the establishment of the dorsoventral boundary of the eye disc (Atkins and Mardon, 2009)." [FlyBase:FBrf0190309, FlyBase:FBrf0208548]
subset: cur
intersection_of: FBbt:00049582 ! peripodial epithelium of eye disc
intersection_of: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00111558 ! part of eye disc dorsal compartment
