[Term]
id: FBbt:00058153
name: dendritic arborizing neuron precursor cell
def: "A multidendritic sensory organ precursor cell that gives rise to sensory neurons with extensive dendritic arborizations late during embryogenesis (Bodmer and Jan, 1987)." [FlyBase:FBrf0047289]
subset: cur
synonym: "da cell" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0047289]
