[Term]
id: FBbt:00058222
name: sugar-sensing neuron of the adult brain
def: "Chemosensory neuron in the posterior superior lateral protocerebrum that expresses the fructose receptor Gr43a and the sugar receptor Gr64a (Miyamoto et al., 2012; Miyamoto and Amrein, 2014; Fujii et al., 2015). It senses sugars in the hemolymph to regulate feeding (Miyamoto et al., 2012; Miyamoto and Amrein, 2014; Fujii et al., 2015). There are 2-4 of these cells per brain hemisphere (Miyamoto et al., 2012; Miyamoto and Amrein, 2014; Fujii et al., 2015). They also secrete corazonin (Miyamoto and Amrein, 2014). Unlike other brain corazonin neurons, they do not project via the nervus corporis cardiaci (McKim et al., 2024)." [doi:10.7554/eLife.102684.1, FlyBase:FBrf0219961, FlyBase:FBrf0224445, FlyBase:FBrf0227698]
subset: cur
intersection_of: FBbt:00005106 ! neuron
intersection_of: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00003624 ! part of adult brain
intersection_of: RO:0002292 http://flybase.org/reports/FBgn0041243 ! expresses Gr43a
relationship: RO:0002100 FBbt:00051022 ! has soma location cell body rind of adult posterior superior lateral protocerebrum
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0008343 ! capable of adult feeding behavior
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0030072 ! capable of peptide hormone secretion
relationship: RO:0002292 http://flybase.org/reports/FBgn0013767 ! expresses Crz
relationship: RO:0002292 http://flybase.org/reports/FBgn0045479 ! expresses Gr64a
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2021-06-17T08:08:38Z" xsd:dateTime

