[Term]
id: FBbt:00058247
name: adult pheromone-sensing neuron
comment: Likely to be the ppk23 cells, as null mutants lose leg and proboscis responses to pheromones, however, function of ppk23 in wing margin was not investigated. (Thistle et al., 2012 - FBrf0218411). ppk23 cells are distinct from sugar and water cells, but a few cells coexpress Gr66a and ppk23 (Thistle et al., 2012). Some ppk23 cells also express ppk29, but not clear from Thistle et al. (2012) whether this is all or a subset.
subset: cur
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2021-09-27T15:58:18Z" xsd:dateTime

