[Term]
id: FBbt:00058283
name: adult ostial cell
def: "Ostial cell of the adult dorsal vessel. There are 20 of these cells per dorsal vessel, forming 5 pairs of ostia along the dorsal vessel. The 4 cells of the posterior-most pair of ostia are embryonic/larval ostial cells that persist in the adult stage; the other 16 cells differentiate during metamorphosis (Lehmacher et al., 2012; Rotstein and Paululat, 2016)." [FlyBase:FBrf0219200, FlyBase:FBrf0238157]
subset: cur
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2021-12-08T10:46:11Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00058284
name: larval ostial cell
def: "Ostial cell of the larval dorsal vessel. There are 12 of these cells per dorsal vessel, forming a total of 3 pairs of ostia, which are located in the posterior dorsal vessel (heart) (Lehmacher et al., 2012). It develops from an embryonic ostial cardioblast (Lehmacher et al., 2012). During metamorphosis, the 8 cells forming the two posterior pairs are hystolized and the 4 cells of the anterior-most pair persist to form the posteriormost adult ostia (Lehmacher et al., 2012)." [FlyBase:FBrf0219200, FlyBase:FBrf0238157]
subset: cur
synonym: "larval functional ostial cell" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0219200]
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00007324 ! develops from embryonic heart ostial cardioblast
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2021-12-08T10:51:33Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00058285
name: intracardial valve cell
def: "A specialized cardiomyocyte that forms a valve inside the dorsal vessel. There are two of these cells per valve. They have large intracellular vesicles that occupy most of their volume, a high number of mitochondria, and a network-like arrangement of myofilaments (Lehmacher et al., 2012; Rotstein and Paululat, 2016)." [FlyBase:FBrf0219200, FlyBase:FBrf0238157]
subset: cur
is_a: FBbt:00007319 ! cardial cell
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00058288 ! part of intracardial valve
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2021-12-08T11:02:46Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: IAO:0000233 "https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/1289" xsd:anyURI

[Term]
id: FBbt:00058286
name: adult intracardial valve cell
def: "Intracardial valve cell of the adult dorsal vessel. There are 6 of these cells per dorsal vessel, forming 3 valves separating the 4 chambers of the adult heart (Lehmacher et al., 2012; Rotstein and Paululat, 2016)." [FlyBase:FBrf0219200, FlyBase:FBrf0238157]
subset: cur
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2021-12-08T11:07:37Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00058287
name: larval intracardial valve cell
def: "Intracardial valve cell of the larval dorsal vessel. There are 2 of these cells per dorsal vessel, forming a single valve that separates the heart from the aorta (Lehmacher et al., 2012; Rotstein and Paululat, 2016). It does not become morphologically distinct from other cardial cells until after larval hatching (Lehmacher et al., 2012)." [FlyBase:FBrf0219200, FlyBase:FBrf0238157]
subset: cur
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2021-12-08T11:09:59Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00058288
name: intracardial valve
def: "A valve inside the dorsal vessel that divides it into distinct chambers and ensures the directionality of the hemolymph flow. It is made of 2 specialized cardiomyocytes that change shape during heartbeat to open and close the heart channel (Lehmacher et al., 2012; Lammers et al., 2017)." [FlyBase:FBrf0219200, FlyBase:FBrf0235576]
subset: cur
is_a: FBbt:00100313 ! multicellular structure
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00058291 ! part of dorsal vessel
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2021-12-08T12:11:55Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: IAO:0000233 "https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/1289" xsd:anyURI

[Term]
id: FBbt:00058289
name: adult intracardial valve
def: "Intracardial valve of the adult dorsal vessel. There are 3 such valves per dorsal vessel, dividing the heart into 4 heart chambers. They are formed by the 22nd, 28th, and 34th pairs of cardiomyocytes, counting from the anterior end (Rotstein and Paululat, 2016; Lammers et al., 2017)." [FlyBase:FBrf0235576, FlyBase:FBrf0238157]
subset: cur
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2021-12-08T12:22:00Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00058290
name: embryonic/larval intracardial valve
def: "Intracardial valve of the embryonic/larval dorsal vessel. It divides the dorsal vessel between the aorta (anterior) and the heart proper (posterior). It is formed by the 34th pair of cardiomyocytes, counting from the anterior end (Rotstein and Paululat, 2016; Lammers et al., 2017)." [FlyBase:FBrf0235576, FlyBase:FBrf0238157]
subset: cur
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2021-12-08T12:26:34Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00058291
name: dorsal vessel
def: "A contractile tube located underneath the dorsal epidermis. It ensures the hemolymph circulates within the hemocoel, by letting the hemolymph enter the tube through lateral slits (ostia) in the posterior end and pumping it back into the hemocoel (Rotstein and Paululat, 2016)." [FlyBase:FBrf0238157]
subset: cur
is_a: FBbt:00100313 ! multicellular structure
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00005057 ! part of circulatory system
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2021-12-08T15:32:57Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: IAO:0000233 "https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/1289" xsd:anyURI

[Term]
id: FBbt:00058292
