def: "Larval acute muscle of the prothoracic segment (Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997). There are two of these on each side, found in a lateral position and they are the only lateral acute muscles of the larval body wall musculature (Campos-Ortega and Hartenstein, 1997)." [FlyBase:FBrf0064793, FlyBase:FBrf0089570]
