[Term]
id: FBbt:00058607
name: abdominal 4 ventral oblique muscle 4
def: "The fourth dorsal-most ventral oblique muscle of larval abdominal segment 4. Its posterior end extends into abdominal segment 5 where it attaches to the posterior intrasegmental apodeme (ina2)." [FlyBase:FBrf0041814, FlyBase:FBrf0089570]
subset: cur
synonym: "A4 VO4" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0064793, FlyBase:FBrf0089570]
