relationship: RO:0002131 FBbt:00001751 ! overlaps larval abdominal segment 4
relationship: RO:0002131 FBbt:00001752 ! overlaps larval abdominal segment 5
relationship: RO:0002371 FBbt:00001032 ! attached to embryonic/larval abdominal 5 intrasegmental apodeme 2
