[Term]
id: FBbt:00058818
name: dorsal cervical muscle 20
def: "Short dorsal cervical muscle that has a dorsomedial attachment to an apodeme and extends in a ventral anterior lateral direction to the vicinity of the anterior end of muscle 23 (Miller, 1950)." [FlyBase:FBrf0186027]
subset: cur
is_a: FBbt:00058817 ! dorsal cervical muscle
