[Term]
id: FBbt:00058845
name: tibial depressor muscle
def: "Muscle that extends along the femur and attaches to the proximal tibia. It is composed of 26 fibers (Kuan et al., 2020). It flexes the femur-tibia joint (Azevedo et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0186027, FlyBase:FBrf0247324, FlyBase:FBrf0259940]
