def: "Muscle consisting of between fifteen and twenty-five bilaterally located longitudinal fibers in abdominal segments 2 to 6 of males, or segments 2 to 8 of females (Miller, 1950). It is involved in moving the abdominal segment tergite. It is attached to the a2 compartment of the tergite anteriorly and the a1 compartment of the next segment posteriorly (Krzemien et al., 2012)." [FlyBase:FBrf0007735, FlyBase:FBrf0064793, FlyBase:FBrf0192609, FlyBase:FBrf0193310, FlyBase:FBrf0216853]
subset: cur
is_a: FBbt:00058966 ! adult somatic muscle of abdomen
relationship: RO:0002177 FBbt:00053557 ! attached to part of adult abdominal tergite integumentary compartment a1
relationship: RO:0002177 FBbt:00053558 ! attached to part of adult abdominal tergite integumentary compartment a2
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2022-07-05T13:30:44Z" xsd:dateTime

