[Term]
id: FBbt:00059069
name: dorsal ventral indirect flight muscle
def: "Indirect flight muscle that extends dorsoventrally, medial to the dorsal longitudinal muscles (Dickinson and Tu, 1997). It connects the dorsal region of the mesothoracic tergum and the ventrolateral margin of the mesothoracic phragma (Williams and Williams, 1943). There are seven of these on each side, each with a single muscle cell (Dickinson and Tu, 1997). These vertical muscles function to elevate the wings by drawing down on the scutum (Miller, 1950)." [FlyBase:FBrf0006004, FlyBase:FBrf0007735, FlyBase:FBrf0064793, FlyBase:FBrf0098527]
subset: cur
synonym: "dorsal ventral muscle" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0064793]
synonym: "DVM" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0064793]
synonym: "wDVM" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0243782]
is_a: FBbt:00052766 ! flight power muscle
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2022-07-05T13:30:44Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00059070
name: wing axillary muscle hg1
def: "Direct flight muscle that inserts into the fourth axillary (posterior notal wing process) and functions in carrying out lateral tip movements (Wisser and Nachtigall, 1984). It shares a tendon with the external muscle of fourth axillary hg4 (Williams and Williams, 1943). In contrast to most other wing muscles, hg1 is larger in males than in females, which is thought to allow for louder sine song (Shirangi et al., 2013). It is one of only two flight muscles that express doublesex (Shirangi et al., 2013)." [FlyBase:FBrf0006004, FlyBase:FBrf0098527, FlyBase:FBrf0223321, FlyBase:FBrf0239095]
subset: cur
synonym: "external muscle of fourth axillary hg1" EXACT []
synonym: "posterior notal wing process muscle hg1" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0098527]
is_a: FBbt:00058908 ! axillary muscle
relationship: RO:0002216 GO:0045433 ! capable of part of male courtship behavior, veined wing generated song production
relationship: RO:0013008 FBbt:00047246 ! receives synaptic input from neuron wing axillary muscle hg1 motor neuron
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2022-07-05T13:30:44Z" xsd:dateTime

