[Term]
id: FBbt:00059241
name: small central-projecting DN3 neuron
def: "DN3 neuron with a small soma (Sun et al., 2022; Reinhard et al., 2024). There are around 70-80 of these cells per hemisphere and they are heterogeneous (Reinhard et al., 2024). They are glutamatergic (Reinhard et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0253946, FlyBase:FBrf0261099]
