[Term]
id: FBbt:00059242
name: anterior-projecting DN3 neuron
def: "DN3 neuron that projects to the anterior brain, remaining ipsilateral (Sun et al., 2022; Reinhard et al., 2024). There are approximately 6 of these neurons per hemisphere, with larger somas than the s-CPDN3 neurons (Reinhard et al., 2024). They express allatostatin C (AstC) (Sun et al., 2022)." [FlyBase:FBrf0253946, FlyBase:FBrf0261099]
subset: cur
is_a: FBbt:00052275 ! large DN3 neuron
relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0000634 ! has characteristic unilateral
