[Term]
id: FBbt:00059251
name: lateral supraesophageal gustatory tract
def: "A thin supraesophageal gustatory tract that passes through the posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum and projects to the superior lateral protocerebrum and the lateral protocerebrum (Talay et al., 2017)." [FlyBase:FBrf0237282]
