[Term]
id: FBbt:00059252
name: posteroventral projection neuron of the medial supraesophageal gustatory tract
def: "A gustatory projection neuron with a cell body located posteroventrally to the supraesophageal zone and that projects through the medial supraesophageal tract to the superior medial protocerebrum. It receives input from the ipsilateral supraesophageal zone (Talay et al., 2017)." [FlyBase:FBrf0237282]
