[Term]
id: FBbt:00059253
name: anterodorsal projection neuron of the medial supraesophageal gustatory tract
def: "A gustatory projection neuron with a cell body located anterodorsally to the supraesophageal zone and that projects through the medial supraesophageal tract. It receives input from both sides of the supraesophageal zone and its axon branches bilaterally in the superior medial protocerebrum (Talay et al., 2017)." [FlyBase:FBrf0237282]
