[Term]
id: FBbt:00059260
name: haltere dorsal ventral muscle motor neuron
def: "Motor neuron that innervates the haltere dorsal ventral muscle (Dickerson et al., 2019). Its soma is found in the lateral metathoracic neuromere and it arborizes bilaterally in the dorsal anterior metathoracic and posterior mesothoracic neuromeres (Ehrhardt et al., 2023)." [doi:10.1101/2023.05.31.542897, FlyBase:FBrf0243782]
