[Term]
id: FBbt:00059263
name: DVM motor neuron
def: "Motor neuron that innervates a dorsal ventral indirect flight muscle (Dickerson et al., 2019). Activation of these neurons decreases wing stroke amplitude and increases wing beat frequency during flight (Ehrhardt et al., 2023)." [doi:10.1101/2023.05.31.542897, FlyBase:FBrf0243782]
