[Term]
id: FBbt:00059325
name: adult proventriculus epithelial zone 2
def: "The section of the adult foregut epithelium inside the proventriculus that extends from the widest point of the cardial valve its neck (King, 1988). This section is characterized by a clear gap between the cuticular surface and the underlying epithelial cell membrane." [FlyBase:FBrf0048518]
synonym: "PV2 region" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0258898]
is_a: FBbt:00047124 ! gut epithelial section
