[Term]
id: FBbt:00059331
name: adult proventriculus zone 1 epithelial cell
def: "Epithelial cell of the first zone of the adult proventriculus epithelium (King, 1988). This a columnar cell with a broad apex in contact with the overlying cuticle. It tapers basally toward a narrow point that curves anteriorly. There are approximately 500 of these cells in the adult proventriculus (Zhu et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0048518, FlyBase:FBrf0258898]
synonym: "PV1 cell" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0258898]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2024-06-21T10:19:50Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00059332
name: adult proventriculus zone 2 epithelial cell
def: "Epithelial cell of the second zone of the adult proventriculus epithelium (King, 1988). This is a columnar cell with irregular cytoplasmic extensions (narrow folds and microvilli) which project into the extracellular material beneath the overlying cuticle. Its basal end is slightly narrower than its apex and inclined posteriorly. There are approximately 600 of these cells in the adult proventriculus (Zhu et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0048518, FlyBase:FBrf0258898]
synonym: "PV2 cell" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0258898]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2024-06-21T10:20:16Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00059333
name: adult proventriculus zone 3 epithelial cell
def: "Epithelial cell of the third zone of the adult proventriculus epithelium (King, 1988). These cells are shorter than the cells from the first and second zones, and are characterized by numerous mitochondria. They secrete the first layer of the peritrophic membrane (Zhu et al., 2024). There are approximately 450 of these cells in the adult proventriculus." [FlyBase:FBrf0048518, FlyBase:FBrf0258898]
synonym: "PV3 cell" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0258898]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2024-06-21T10:20:28Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00059334
name: adult proventriculus zone 4 epithelial cell
def: "Epithelial cell of the fourth zone of the adult proventriculus epithelium (King, 1988). These cells are short to cuboidal columnar cells with long apical microvilli that project loosely into the proventriculus lumen. They secrete the second layer of the peritrophic membrane (Zhu et al., 2024). There are approximately 200 of these cells in the adult proventriculus." [FlyBase:FBrf0048518, FlyBase:FBrf0258898]
synonym: "PV4 cell" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0258898]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2024-06-21T10:20:39Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00059335
name: adult proventriculus zone 5 epithelial cell
def: "Epithelial cell of the fifth zone of the adult proventriculus epithelium (King, 1988). These are very tall columnar cells. Their apical end is drawn out into a cytoplasmic peg which projects into the lumen. They secrete the third layer of the peritrophic membrane (Zhu et al., 2024). There are approximately 1600 of these cells in the adult proventriculus." [FlyBase:FBrf0048518, FlyBase:FBrf0258898]
synonym: "PV5 cell" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0258898]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2024-06-21T10:21:15Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00059336
name: adult proventriculus zone 5.5 epithelial cell
def: "Epithelial cell of the intermediate zone between the fifth and sixth zones of the adult proventriculus epithelium (Zhu et al., 2024). Along with cells from the sixth zone, they secrete the fourth layer of the peritrophic membrane. There are approximately 200 of these cells in the adult proventriculus." [FlyBase:FBrf0258898]
synonym: "PV5.5 cell" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0258898]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2024-06-21T10:22:28Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00059337
name: adult proventriculus zone 6 epithelial cell
def: "Epithelial cell of the sixth zone of the adult proventriculus epithelium (King, 1988). These are cuboidal cells characterized by short, straight, closely packed microvilli and an irregularly infolded basal membrane. They secrete the fourth layer of the peritrophic membrane, as well as digestive enzymes (Zhu et al., 2024). There are approximately 700 of these cells in the adult proventriculus." [FlyBase:FBrf0048518, FlyBase:FBrf0258898]
synonym: "PV6 cell" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0258898]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-6095-8718
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2024-06-21T10:23:00Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
