def: "A cell of the dorsolateral mesoderm of parasegments 10, 11 and 12 that gives rise to the somatic cells of the gonad (Boyle and DiNardo, 1995). There are 9 to 12 such cells in each of the parasegments 10, 11, and 12 (Boyle et al., 1997)." [FlyBase:FBrf0078101, FlyBase:FBrf0092473]
