[Term]
id: FBbt:00067004
name: antennal basiconic sensillum ab4
def: "Antennal basiconic sensillum innervated by the dendrites of two olfactory receptor neurons, expressing Or56a and Or7a (Couto et al., 2005; Gonzales et al., 2021). It is about the same length as the large ab sensilla, but more slender, and has longitudinal rows of pores like those found in the small ab sensilla (Shanbhag et al., 1999)." [FlyBase:FBrf0108493, FlyBase:FBrf0187305, FlyBase:FBrf0233453, FlyBase:FBrf0239032, FlyBase:FBrf0250923, FlyBase:FBrf0262710]
comment: This is the only type of 'thin' basiconic sensillum listed in Benton et al. (2025) comprehensive analysis.
subset: olfactory_system_draft
synonym: "antennal basiconic sensillum TB-2" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0128642]
synonym: "thin basiconic sensillum of antennal segment 3" EXACT []
is_a: FBbt:00004174 ! basiconic sensillum of antennal segment 3
property_value: IAO:0000233 "https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/2107" xsd:anyURI

[Term]
id: FBbt:00067005
name: adult olfactory receptor neuron Or7a
def: "Adult olfactory receptor neuron (ORN) that expresses Or7a (Benton et al., 2025). Its dendrite transduces signals from antennal basiconic sensillum ab4 and it responds to E2-hexenal and E2-hexenol (Benton et al., 2025). It innervates antennal lobe glomerulus DL5, bilaterally (Benton et al., 2025). It develops from an Nba precursor (Benton et al., 2025). There are approximately 20 of these on each side (Grabe et al., 2016; Benton et al., 2025)." [FlyBase:FBrf0179238, FlyBase:FBrf0187305, FlyBase:FBrf0233453, FlyBase:FBrf0262710]
comment: Glomerulus listed as VM5v in Gonzales et al. (2021) - FBrf0250923, but DL5 is specified in Grabe et al. (2016) and Task et al. (2022) - FBrf0253272.
subset: olfactory_system_draft
synonym: "adult ORN Or7a" EXACT []
synonym: "odorant receptor neuron DL5" RELATED []
synonym: "odorant receptor neuron Or7a" EXACT []
synonym: "ORN (Or7a)" EXACT [FlyBrain_NDB:10420]
synonym: "ORN ab4A" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0179238]
relationship: RO:0002101 FBbt:00003979 ! fasciculates with adult antennal lobe commissure

[Term]
id: FBbt:00067006
name: maxillary palp basiconic sensillum pb3
def: "Basiconic olfactory sensillum of maxillary palp that is innervated by the dendrites of two ORNs, 59c and 85d (Couto et al., 2005; Goldman et al., 2005)." [FlyBase:FBrf0108493, FlyBase:FBrf0187305]
subset: olfactory_system_draft
is_a: FBbt:00005185 ! basiconic sensillum
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00004546 ! part of maxillary palp

[Term]
id: FBbt:00067007
name: adult olfactory receptor neuron Or59c
def: "Adult olfactory receptor neuron (ORN) that expresses Or59c (Benton et al., 2025). Its dendrite transduces signals from maxillary palp basiconic sensillum pb3 and it responds to butyl 3-hydroxybutyrate (Benton et al., 2025). Its axon innervates glomerulus VM7v, bilaterally (Benton et al., 2025). It develops from an Nab precursor (Benton et al., 2025). There are approximately 13-20 of these cells on each side in females and around 30 in males (Grabe et al., 2016; Benton et al., 2025)." [FlyBase:FBrf0184216, FlyBase:FBrf0187305, FlyBase:FBrf0233453, FlyBase:FBrf0262710]
