relationship: RO:0002101 FBbt:00003979 ! fasciculates with adult antennal lobe commissure

[Term]
id: FBbt:00067010
name: antennal trichoid sensillum at4
def: "Olfactory trichoid sensillum of antennal segment 3 that houses the dendrites of ORNs Or47b and Or88a, with a subset additionally housing an ORN Or65a dendrite (Grabe et al., 2016; Gonzales et al., 2021). There are more of these sensilla in males than females (Grabe et al, 2016)." [FlyBase:FBrf0187305, FlyBase:FBrf0233453, FlyBase:FBrf0239032, FlyBase:FBrf0250923]
subset: olfactory_system_draft
synonym: "antennal trichoid sensillum at3" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0224383]
is_a: FBbt:00004173 ! trichoid sensillum of antennal segment 3

[Term]
id: FBbt:00067011
name: adult olfactory receptor neuron Or65
def: "Adult olfactory receptor neuron (ORN) that expresses Or65a, Or65b and Or65c (Benton et al., 2025). Its dendrite transduces signals from an antennal trichoid sensillum at4 (Couto et al., 2005; Grabe et al., 2016) that houses three neurons (Gonzales et al., 2021). It responds to the male pheromone cis-vaccenyl acetate (cVA) (van der Goes et al., 2007). Its axon innervates antennal lobe glomerulus DL3, bilaterally (Benton et al., 2025). It expresses sNPF (Carlsson et al., 2010). It develops from an Nba precursor (Benton et al., 2025). There around 20-40 of these cells on each side (Grabe et al., 2016; Benton et al., 2025)." [FlyBase:FBrf0187305, FlyBase:FBrf0192555, FlyBase:FBrf0211156, FlyBase:FBrf0233453, FlyBase:FBrf0250923, FlyBase:FBrf0262710]
subset: olfactory_system_draft
