[Term]
id: FBbt:00067014
name: adult antennal lobe projection neuron DC1 adPN
def: "Adult uniglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron of the ALad1 lineage whose dendrites mainly innervate antennal lobe glomerulus DC1. It is born from the 11th division of neuroblast ALad1 during embryogenesis (Yu et al., 2010). There is one of these per hemisphere, it fasciculates with the medial antennal lobe tract and it is cholinergic (Bates et al., 2020). Its boutons in the mushroom body calyx are widely distributed, mostly within the dorsal half (Li et al., 2020). It is the only uniglomerular projection neuron to receive input in DC1 (Li et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0183938, FlyBase:FBrf0203179, FlyBase:FBrf0211729, FlyBase:FBrf0246460, FlyBase:FBrf0248215]
comment: For image, see FBrf0211729.
subset: olfactory_system_draft
synonym: "DC1 adPN" EXACT []
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00007053 ! sends synaptic output to region adult lateral horn
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00007385 ! sends synaptic output to region calyx of adult mushroom body

[Term]
id: FBbt:00067015
name: obsolete antennal intermediate sensillum ai1
def: "Antennal intermediate sensillum thought to contain olfactory receptor neuron Or13a (Couto et al., 2005)." [FlyBase:FBrf0187305]
comment: Obsoleted as Or13a is expressed in ab6-innervating neurons (see Galizia et al. (2010) - FBrf0211579), and there is no distinct intermediate sensillum housing Or13a neurons as speculated in Couto et al. (2005).
