[Term]
id: FBbt:00067021
name: adult antennal lobe projection neuron DP1m adPN
def: "Adult uniglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron from the ad neuroblast lineage with dendrites that mainly innervate antennal lobe glomerulus DP1m. It is the first neuron born from neuroblast ALad1 during embryogenesis (Yu et al., 2010). The axonal terminals in the lateral horn branch extensively and occupy large regions of this neuropil (Ai et al., 2013). There is one of these per hemisphere, it fasciculates with the medial antennal lobe tract and it is cholinergic (Ai et al., 2013; Bates et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0183938, FlyBase:FBrf0211729, FlyBase:FBrf0222046, FlyBase:FBrf0246460]
