[Term]
id: FBbt:00067064
name: adult olfactory receptor neuron Gr21a/63a
alt_id: FBbt:00100336
def: "Adult unilateral odorant receptor neuron that expresses Gr21a and Gr63a (Couto et al., 2005; Kwon et al., 2007; Kaur et al., 2019; Benton et al., 2025). It responds to CO2 levels (Suh et al., 2004; Kwon et al., 2007). Its dendrite transduces signals from antennal basiconic sensillum ab1 and sends output to antennal glomerulus V (Benton et al., 2025). It develops from an Nbb precursor (Benton et al., 2025). There are around 30-40 of these cells on each side (Grabe et al., 2016; Benton et al., 2025)." [FlyBase:FBrf0051437, FlyBase:FBrf0179739, FlyBase:FBrf0187305, FlyBase:FBrf0192797, FlyBase:FBrf0233453, FlyBase:FBrf0243918]
comment: Gr21a and Gr63a are only found in one ORN type and they are co-expressed (Kwon et al., 2006).
