[Term]
id: FBbt:00067347 ! neuroblast BAlc
alt_id: FBbt:00100561
alt_id: FBbt:00100562
def: "Neuroblast of the deutocerebrum (Kumar et al., 2009) that generates antennal lobe neurons with laterally-located cell bodies in the adult (Jefferis et al., 2001; Yu et al., 2013). It skips the quiescent period beginning in late embryogenesis and produces a large number of neurons (200 or more) (Yu et al., 2013). It produces various multiglomerular and oligoglomerular primary local interneurons, many of which also project to the neighboring subesophageal neuropil (Das et al., 2013)." [FlyBase:FBrf0141667, FlyBase:FBrf0194268, FlyBase:FBrf0205814, FlyBase:FBrf0208824, FlyBase:FBrf0220443, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438]
