[Term]
id: FBbt:00067371
name: adult antennal lobe projection neuron VA1v vPN
def: "Adult uniglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron from the ventral neuroblast lineage with dendrites that mainly innervate antennal lobe glomerulus VA1 ventral compartment. There are around two of these per hemisphere, they fasciculate with the mediolateral antennal lobe tract and they are GABAergic (Bates et al., 2020). It projects directly to the lateral horn, bypassing the mushroom body calyx (Marin et al., 2002). It is a mediolateral antennal lobe tract projection neuron 1 (Bates et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0146916, FlyBase:FBrf0146917, FlyBase:FBrf0203179, FlyBase:FBrf0246460]
