def: "Nerve that travels through the marginal (and L1) vein (Palka et al., 1979). It carries axons of bristle sensilla of the triple row and the double row plus the large twin sensilla of the margin and the giant sensillum of the radius (Palka et al., 1979)." [FlyBase:FBrf0032909, FlyBase:FBrf0073164]
