[Term]
id: FBbt:00100318
name: somatic cell
def: "Any cell that is not a germ cell (Okada, 1998). During development, somatic cells differentiate into various types, but they do not persist beyond the lifespan of a single organism (Okada, 1998)." [FlyBase:FBrf0101973]
