[Term]
id: FBbt:00100379
name: adult antennal lobe projection neuron VM6 adPN
def: "Adult unilateral, uniglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron from the ad neuroblast (ALad1) lineage with dendrites that mainly innervate antennal lobe glomerulus VM6 (Bates et al., 2020). It receives primarily olfactory input (Marin et al., 2020). It is born from the seventh division of neuroblast ALad1 during embryogenesis (Yu et al., 2010). There is one of these cells per hemisphere, it is cholinergic and it fasciculates with the medial antennal lobe tract to project to the mushroom body calyx and lateral horn (Bates et al., 2020; Marin et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211729, FlyBase:FBrf0246460]
comment: For image, see FBrf0211729. VC5 glomerulus in Bates et al. (2020) and Marin et al. (2020) and VM6+VP1 in Yu et al. (2010) correspond to what is now known as VM6 (Schlegel et al., 2021 - FBrf0249560). Yu et al. (2010) classify this neuron as uniglomerular. Also classified as uniglomerular by Bates et al. (2020), who clarify that it mainly innervates VM6 (which they call VC5), with some additional branches in other glomeruli (uni+ class).
subset: olfactory_system_draft
synonym: "adult antennal lobe projection neuron VC5 adPN" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0246460, FlyBase:FBrf0249560]
synonym: "adult antennal lobe projection neuron VM6+VP1 adPN" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211729, FlyBase:FBrf0249560]
synonym: "VC5 adPN" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0246460]
synonym: "VC5+ adPN" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0246456]
synonym: "VM6+VP1 adPN" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211729, FlyBase:FBrf0249560]
relationship: RO:0002216 GO:0007608 ! capable of part of sensory perception of smell
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00007053 ! sends synaptic output to region adult lateral horn
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00007385 ! sends synaptic output to region calyx of adult mushroom body
property_value: IAO:0000233 "https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/916" xsd:anyURI

[Term]
id: FBbt:00100380
name: adult antennal lobe projection neuron VL2a adPN
def: "Adult uniglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron from the ad neuroblast lineage with dendrites that mainly innervate antennal lobe glomerulus VL2a. It is born from the tenth division of neuroblast ALad1 during embryogenesis (Yu et al., 2010). It innervates the antero-ventral lateral horn (Grosjean et al., 2011). Its terminals in this region overlap extensively with the terminals of DA1 and VA1lm projection neurons, which have been implicated in a pheromone-sensing pathway (Jefferis et al., 2007). There is one of these per hemisphere, it fasciculates with the medial antennal lobe tract and it is cholinergic (Bates et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0203179, FlyBase:FBrf0211729, FlyBase:FBrf0216424, FlyBase:FBrf0246460]
comment: For image, see FBrf0211729.
subset: olfactory_system_draft
synonym: "VL2a adPN" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211729]
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00007053 ! sends synaptic output to region adult lateral horn
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00007385 ! sends synaptic output to region calyx of adult mushroom body

