[Term]
id: FBbt:00100481
name: adult antennal lobe projection neuron VM3 adPN
def: "Adult uniglomerular antennal lobe projection neuron from the ad neuroblast lineage (embryonic born) with dendrites that mainly innervate antennal lobe glomerulus VM3. Neurons of this class are born during the 17th and 19th divisions of the neuroblast ALad1 during embryogenesis (Yu et al., 2010). There are two of these per hemisphere, they fasciculate with the medial antennal lobe tract and they are cholinergic (Bates et al., 2020)." [FlyBase:FBrf0183938, FlyBase:FBrf0211729, FlyBase:FBrf0246460]
comment: For image, see FBrf0211729.
