id: FBbt:00100516
name: developing marginal glial cell
def: "Late larval/pupal astrocyte-like glial cell that is associated with the developing lamina (Winberg et al., 1992; Hara et al., 2013; Nakano et al., 2019). During early optic lobe development, these cells are found in a layer proximal to the photoreceptor growth cones (Winberg et al., 1992; Poeck et al., 2001). They develop into adult lamina epithelial glial cells (Nakano et al., 2019)." [FlyBase:FBrf0055906, FlyBase:FBrf0134808, FlyBase:FBrf0220563, FlyBase:FBrf0243081]
synonym: "larval L-ALG" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0243081]
synonym: "larval lamina astrocyte glial cell" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0243081]
