[Term]
id: FBbt:00100518
name: developing distal satellite glial cell
def: "Glial cell that is in a transitional state between a larval eye disc wrapping glial cell and an adult distal satellite glial cell (Edwards et al., 2012)." [FlyBase:FBrf0218414]
is_a: FBbt:00100509 ! developing satellite glial cell
