[Term]
id: FBbt:00100543 ! neuroblast DALv1
def: "DAL neuroblast whose primary and secondary lineages project between the ventrolateral protocerebrum and lateral accessory lobe and follow the anterior component of the lateral equatorial fascicle (Lovick et al., 2013; Wong et al., 2013 Hartenstein et al., 2015)." [FlyBase:FBrf0194268, FlyBase:FBrf0223298, FlyBase:FBrf0223329, FlyBase:FBrf0229672]
