property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2011-07-07T04:38:33Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00100551 ! neuroblast BAmd1
def: "Neuroblast that generates a basoanterior secondary lineage, which has cell bodies found dorsal to the antennal lobe in the adult brain (Pereanu and Hartenstein, 2006; Lovick et al., 2013). Both of its primary and secondary hemilineages produce viable neurons, with one hemilineage entering either side (dorsal and ventral) of the mushroom body medial lobe (Lovick et al., 2013; Hartenstein et al., 2015). It generates a sexually-dimorphic secondary lineage with prominent proximal neurite elaboration in the crepine (Yu et al., 2013)." [FlyBase:FBrf0194268, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0223329, FlyBase:FBrf0229672]
comment: References are about lineages rather than neuroblasts.
subset: TL_lineage_clone
is_a: FBbt:00001334 ! protocerebral neuroblast
is_a: FBbt:00100532 ! type I neuroblast
is_a: FBbt:00100741 ! neuroblast BA
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://www.researchgate.net/scientific-contributions/Simon-Reeve-2162827703
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2011-07-07T04:40:02Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00100553 ! neuroblast BAmv2
def: "Neuroblast of the deutocerebrum (Kumar et al., 2009) with a relatively ventromedial location in the basoanterior larval brain (Pereanu and Hartenstein, 2006). It generates a lineage similar to that of BAmv1 (LALv1), entering the neuropil close to the antennal lobe and contributing to the medial longitudinal ventral fascicle in both adult and larva (Lovick et al., 2013; Hartenstein et al., 2015). Its secondary lineage has a less complex branching pattern that of the BAmv1 lineage (Wong et al., 2013). There are approximately 65 cells of this lineage in the adult, collectively innervating many neuropil regions (Ito et al., 2013; Yu et al., 2013)." [FlyBase:FBrf0194268, FlyBase:FBrf0208824, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438, FlyBase:FBrf0223298, FlyBase:FBrf0223329, FlyBase:FBrf0229672]
comment: BAmv2 previously mapped to VESa2 based on FlyBase:FBrf02341285. This was corrected to PSa1 based on FlyBase:FBrf0260535 and personally checked by Volker Hartenstein.
subset: TL_lineage_clone
is_a: FBbt:00100532 ! type I neuroblast
is_a: FBbt:00100741 ! neuroblast BA
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00003923 ! part of deutocerebrum
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://www.researchgate.net/scientific-contributions/Simon-Reeve-2162827703
