[Term]
id: FBbt:00100590 ! neuroblast DPLam
def: "Neuroblast of the protocerebrum (Kumar et al., 2009) that produces a primary lineage with a short tract that enters the superior lateral protocerebrum (SLP) medial to the transverse superior anterior fascicle and forms terminal arborizations in the SLP and the lateral inferior protocerebrum (Hartenstein et al., 2015). Its secondary lineage arborizes ipsilaterally in the adult superior lateral, inferior, and ventrolateral protocerebrum (Wong et al., 2013)." [FlyBase:FBrf0194268, FlyBase:FBrf0208824, FlyBase:FBrf0223298, FlyBase:FBrf0229672]
comment: The VLPd2 clone from Ito et al. (2013) is a subset of the VLPd1 (DPLam) clone (Schlegel et al., 2024 - FlyBase:FBrf0260535).
subset: TL_lineage_clone
synonym: "neuroblast VLPd2" NARROW [FlyBase:FBrf0221438, FlyBase:FBrf0260535]
