[Term]
id: FBbt:00100605 ! neuroblast DPLm1
def: "Neuroblast that forms a primary lineage paired with that of DPLm2, having somas lateral to the larval mushroom body calyx and a short tract that enters the posterior superior lateral protocerebrum and projects anteriorly (Hartenstein et al., 2015). Its secondary lineage mainly arborizes in the adult superior lateral and intermediate protocerebrum (Wong et al., 2013)." [FlyBase:FBrf0194268, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438, FlyBase:FBrf0229672]
