[Term]
id: FBbt:00100606 ! neuroblast DPLm2
def: "Neuroblast that forms a primary lineage paired with that of DPLm1, having somas lateral to the larval mushroom body calyx and a short tract that enters the posterior superior lateral protocerebrum and projects anteriorly (Hartenstein et al., 2015). Its secondary lineage arborizes in the adult superior lateral protocerebrum and lateral horn, and has a component that exits the brain to project to the ring gland (Wong et al., 2013)." [FlyBase:FBrf0194268, FlyBase:FBrf0223298, FlyBase:FBrf0229672]
comment: Ring gland component previously thought to be a separate lineage (DPMl2) in Pereanu and Hartenstein (2006) (Wong et al., 2013).
