[Term]
id: FBbt:00100626 ! neuroblast BLP2
def: "Neuroblast whose neuronal lineage has relatively dorsal somas in the BLP group during the larval stage (Pereanu and Hartenstein, 2006; Hartenstein et al., 2015). Similar to BLP1, these neurons project anteriorly toward the junction between the optic lobe (or optic neuropil) and the ventrolateral protocerebrum (Hartenstein et al., 2015). During metamorphosis, the BLP3 and BLP4 somas migrate, to move dorsal to BLP1 and BLP2 (Lovick et al., 2013). In the adult its secondary lineage is mainly restricted to the ventrolateral protocerebrum (Wong et al., 2013; Ito et al., 2013; Yu et al., 2013)." [FlyBase:FBrf0194268, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438, FlyBase:FBrf0223298, FlyBase:FBrf0223329, FlyBase:FBrf0229672]
subset: TL_lineage_clone
is_a: FBbt:00001334 ! protocerebral neuroblast
is_a: FBbt:00100532 ! type I neuroblast
is_a: FBbt:00100749 ! neuroblast BLP
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://www.researchgate.net/scientific-contributions/Simon-Reeve-2162827703
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2011-07-11T03:40:05Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00100627 ! neuroblast BLP3
def: "Neuroblast whose neuronal lineage has relatively ventral somas in the BLP group during the larval stage (Pereanu and Hartenstein, 2006; Hartenstein et al., 2015). Similar to BLP4, these neurons project towards the lateral superior lateral protocerebrum (Hartenstein et al., 2015). During metamorphosis, the BLP3 and BLP4 somas migrate, to move dorsal to BLP1 and BLP2 (Lovick et al., 2013). In the adult its secondary lineage innervates the lateral horn and superior lateral protocerebrum (Wong et al., 2013)." [FlyBase:FBrf0194268, FlyBase:FBrf0223298, FlyBase:FBrf0223329, FlyBase:FBrf0229672]
comment: 'BLP3 ventral' mapped to 'unknown6 ventral' in Bates et al. (2020) - FBrf0246460.
is_a: FBbt:00100749 ! neuroblast BLP
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://www.researchgate.net/scientific-contributions/Simon-Reeve-2162827703
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2011-07-11T03:41:45Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00100628 ! neuroblast BLP4
def: "Neuroblast whose neuronal lineage has relatively ventral somas in the BLP group during the larval stage (Pereanu and Hartenstein, 2006; Hartenstein et al., 2015). Similar to BLP3, these neurons project towards the lateral superior lateral protocerebrum (Hartenstein et al., 2015). During metamorphosis, the BLP3 and BLP4 somas migrate, to move dorsal to BLP1 and BLP2 (Lovick et al., 2013). In the adult its secondary lineage innervates the lateral horn and superior lateral protocerebrum (Wong et al., 2013; Ito et al., 2013; Yu et al., 2013)." [FlyBase:FBrf0194268, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438, FlyBase:FBrf0223298, FlyBase:FBrf0223329, FlyBase:FBrf0229672]
