[Term]
id: FBbt:00100629 ! neuroblast BLP5
def: "Most ventral of the BLP neuroblasts during the larval stage (Pereanu and Hartenstein, 2006)." [FlyBase:FBrf0194268]
comment: A 'BLP5' lineage was described in Pereanu and Hartenstein (2006), but tract not visible after P24 and no MARCM clones recovered, so Lovick et al. (2013) - FBrf0223329 speculate that larval 'BLP5' tract formed by lobula neurons.
is_a: FBbt:00100749 ! neuroblast BLP
