[Term]
id: FBbt:00100687
name: obsolete DPMl4 lineage neuron
def: "." [FlyBase:FBrf0194268]
comment: Obsoleted as it was unclear in the original paper (Pereanu and Hartenstein, 2006 - FBrf0194268), whether this was really distinct from DPMl3 (referred to as DPMl3/4) and DPMl4 does not feature in later papers from the same group (or in 'comprehensive' set of NBs in FlyWire), so probably the same as DPMl3 (DPLc5).
