[Term]
id: FBbt:00100735 ! neuroblast BAmd2
def: "Neuroblast that generates a basoanterior secondary lineage, which has cell bodies found dorsal to the antennal lobe in the adult brain (Pereanu and Hartenstein, 2006; Lovick et al., 2013). Its primary lineage has two branches that flank the mushroom body medial lobe, similar to BAmd1 (Hartenstein et al., 2015)." [FlyBase:FBrf0194268, FlyBase:FBrf0223329, FlyBase:FBrf0229672]
comment: References are about lineages rather than neuroblasts. Might be the same as neuroblast WEDd2 (Wong et al., 2013 - FBrf0223298).
subset: TL_lineage_clone
is_a: FBbt:00100532 ! type I neuroblast
is_a: FBbt:00100741 ! neuroblast BA
