[Term]
id: FBbt:00110010
name: adult olfactory receptor neuron Ir31a
def: "Adult olfactory receptor neuron that expresses the Ionotropic receptor (Ir) 31a (FBgn0051718) and the co-receptor Ir8a (Benton et al., 2025). It sends output to the antennal lobe glomerulus VL2 posterior compartment in both hemispheres, fasciculating with the antennal commissure (Silbering et al., 2011; Benton et al., 2025). Its dendrite transduces signals from the antennal coeloconic sensillum ac1 (Benton et al., 2009). There are approximately 10-15 of these per antenna (Benton et al., 2025)." [FlyBase:FBrf0206496, FlyBase:FBrf0215822, FlyBase:FBrf0233453, FlyBase:FBrf0262710]
comment: Nava Gonzales et al. (2021) - FBrf0250923 unsure whether this is ac1C or ac1D.
subset: olfactory_system_draft
synonym: "ionotropic receptor neuron Ir31a" EXACT []
synonym: "Ir31a ac1" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0206496]
synonym: "ORN (VL2p)" EXACT [FlyBrain_NDB:10436]
synonym: "ORN ac1" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0206496]
synonym: "ORN ac1Y" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0226805]
synonym: "ORN Ir31a" EXACT []
relationship: RO:0002101 FBbt:00003979 ! fasciculates with adult antennal lobe commissure
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2011-11-03T01:56:34Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110011
name: adult olfactory receptor neuron Ir75d ac1
def: "Olfactory receptor neuron Ir75d with its sensory dendrite in an antennal coeloconic sensillum ac1 (Silbering et al., 2011). It responds strongly to changes in humidity (Yao et al., 2005). There are around 15 of these cells per hemisphere (Grabe et al., 2016)." [FlyBase:FBrf0187906, FlyBase:FBrf0206496, FlyBase:FBrf0215822, FlyBase:FBrf0233453]
comment: Nava Gonzales et al. (2021) - FBrf0250923 unsure whether this is ac1C or ac1D.
