def: "Larval motor neuron that innervates dorsal acute muscle 3 (muscle 3) via type Ib synapses (Landgraf et al., 1997; Hoang and Chiba, 2001; Meng et al., 2019). It is the fourth-born U neuron, developing from the fifth ganglion mother cell that differentiates from neuroblast NB7-1 (Seroka et al., 2020). It has a monopolar morphology and its dendrites remain ipsilateral (Seroka and Doe, 2019; Meng et al., 2019)." [FlyBase:FBrf0064795, FlyBase:FBrf0099344, FlyBase:FBrf0112030, FlyBase:FBrf0132289, FlyBase:FBrf0190540, FlyBase:FBrf0208790, FlyBase:FBrf0241992, FlyBase:FBrf0243538, FlyBase:FBrf0246311]
