[Term]
id: FBbt:00110415
name: adult fruitless aDT-a neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron that develops from neuroblast ALad1 (Ito et al., 2013; Yu et al., 2013). There are approximately 33 of these cells per hemisphere (Cachero et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0211926, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438]
comment: Lineage is ALad1 (adPN) according to Ito et al. (2013) and includes VA1v PNs in Cachero et al. (2010), so this is a parent to the VA1v adPN (FBbt:00067361).
