is_obsolete: true
consider: FBbt:00110417

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110417
name: adult fruitless aDT-b (female) neuron
def: "Adult female fruitless neuron that develops from neuroblast CREa1 (Ito et al., 2013), has its soma dorsal to the antennal lobe and contralateral dendritic arbors in the subesophageal zone (Yu et al., 2010). It projects dorsally to terminate in the lateral protocerebral complex (Yu et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0205974, FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0211926, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438]
