def: "Adult female fruitless neuron with its soma in the anterior brain between the antennal lobe and ventrolateral protocerebrum (Cachero et al., 2010). It arborizes ipsilaterally in the superior protocerebrum (Cachero et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0205974, FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
