[Term]
id: FBbt:00110426
name: obsolete adult fruitless aDT-g lineage clone
def: "A clone of neurons in the adult brain that expresses fruitless, all of which develop from neuroblast PSa1 (BAmv2). Its cell bodies are located ventral to antennal lobe. Neurites bend medially and branches. The dorsal branch projects bilaterally and forms axonal arbors predominantly in the ventral ring. The ventral branch terminates in ipsilateral dendritic arborizations in the lateral subesophageal zone, in close proximity to the ventral lateral region of the antennal mechanosensory and motor center." [FlyBase:FBrf0128543, FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0211926, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438]
comment: Obsoleted as we do not maintain terms for groups of cells. Consider using the appropriate neuron term instead.
synonym: "aDT-g clone" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
synonym: "aDT5 clone" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
synonym: "fru-mcAL clone" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2013-05-23T03:45:07Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: IAO:0000233 "https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/1712" xsd:anyURI
is_obsolete: true
consider: FBbt:00110427

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110427
name: adult fruitless aDT-g neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron with its soma ventral to the antennal lobe (Yu et al., 2010). It innervates the ipsilateral antennal mechanosensory and motor center (AMMC) zone A and projects to the posterior lateral protocerebrum (Yu et al., 2010; Vaughan et al., 2014). It develops from the BAmv2 (PSa1) neuroblast (Ito et al., 2013). There are approximately 22 of these cells per hemisphere (Cachero et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0211926, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438, FlyBase:FBrf0225096]
synonym: "adult fruitless aDT5 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
synonym: "AMMC projection neuron 5" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0225096]
synonym: "aPN5 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0225096]
is_a: FBbt:00007392 ! projection neuron
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00100015 ! receives synaptic input in region antennal mechanosensory and motor center zone A
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00040044 ! sends synaptic output to region posterior lateral protocerebrum
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2013-05-23T03:45:07Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110428
name: obsolete adult fruitless aDT-h lineage clone
def: "A clone of neurons in the adult brain that expresses fruitless, all of which develop from neuroblast BAmas2 (FLAa3). Its cell bodies are located medially, between the antennal lobe and the subesophageal zone. Neurites form local arborizations close to the cell bodies but also project dorsally along the midline forming the median bundle, and terminating bilaterally in the superior neuropils." [FlyBase:FBrf0128543, FlyBase:FBrf0205974, FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0211926, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438]
