[Term]
id: FBbt:00110429
name: adult fruitless aDT-h neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron that develops from neuroblast BAmas2 (FLAa3) (Yu et al., 2013). It has its soma in the anterior dorsal part of the subesophageal zone (Sterne et al., 2021). It is a projection neuron that has dendritic arborizations in the prow and flange and axonal terminals in the superior medial protocerebrum, extending laterally in both hemispheres (Yu et al., 2010; Sterne et al., 2021). There are approximately 50 of these cells per hemisphere (Cachero et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0205974, FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0211926, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438, FlyBase:FBrf0251280]
synonym: "adult fruitless aDT6 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
synonym: "fru-mcAL neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543, FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
synonym: "mcALa neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0205974, FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
synonym: "median bundle neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0178934, FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
is_a: FBbt:00007392 ! projection neuron
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00003624 ! part of adult brain
relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0000618 ! has characteristic bilateral
relationship: RO:0002101 FBbt:00003683 ! fasciculates with adult median bundle
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00040051 ! receives synaptic input in region prow
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00045050 ! receives synaptic input in region flange
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00007055 ! sends synaptic output to region superior medial protocerebrum
