def: "Adult female fruitless neuron that develops from neuroblast BLAv1 (VLPl&d1) (Ito et al., 2013; Yu et al., 2013). There are approximately 20 of these cells per hemisphere, with somas forming two clusters close to the ventrolateral protocerebrum (Kimura et al., 2008; Cachero et al., 2010; Yu et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0205974, FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0211926, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438]
comment: Yu et al. (2010) - FBrf0211884 map aIP1 to Cachero et al. (2010) aIP-d and to AL6b from Kimura et al. (2008) - FBrf0205974, but Cachero et al. (2010) map aIP1 (and AL6b and AL5b) to aIP-c. Ito et al. (2013) - FBrf0221438 also give lineage as VLPl&d1 for aIP-c and AL5b/6b.
synonym: "female aIP-c neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
synonym: "female aIP1 neuron" NARROW [FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
synonym: "female AL5b neuron" NARROW [FlyBase:FBrf0205974, FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
synonym: "female AL6b neuron" NARROW [FlyBase:FBrf0205974, FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
synonym: "female aSP10 neuron" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
synonym: "female fru-AL neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543, FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2013-05-23T03:45:07Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110436
name: obsolete adult fruitless aIP-d (female) lineage clone
def: "A clone of neurons in the adult female brain that expresses fruitless, whose cell bodies are located in the anterior inferior protocerebrum. Neurites project medially." [FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
comment: These clones were obtained by MARCM using a fru-GAL4 driver (FBal0276838), with clones induced at the first instar larval stage (Cachero et al., 2010). Obsoleted as this clone only contains one neuron, so is redundant with the respective neuron term.
synonym: "female aIP-d clone" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
synonym: "female aIP1 clone" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
