[Term]
id: FBbt:00110437
name: adult fruitless aIP-d (female) neuron
def: "Adult female fruitless neuron with its soma in the lateral part of the central brain and ipsilateral arborization (Cachero et al., 2010). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Cachero et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
comment: Yu et al. (2010) - FBrf0211884 map aIP1 to Cachero et al. (2010) aIP-d and to AL6b from Kimura et al. (2008) - FBrf0205974, but Cachero et al. (2010) map aIP1 (and AL6b and AL5b) to aIP-c. Ito et al. (2013) - FBrf0221438 also give lineage as VLPl&d1 for aIP-c and AL5b/6b.
synonym: "female aIP-d neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
synonym: "female aIP1 neuron" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
synonym: "female AL6b neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
synonym: "female fru-AL neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
