name: adult fruitless aSP-j neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron that develops from neuroblast DALcl2 (AOTUv4) (Ito et al., 2013; Yu et al., 2013). There are approximately 26 of these cells per hemisphere (Cachero et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211926, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438]
