id: FBbt:00110481
name: adult fruitless pIP-b neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron with its cell body located between the lateral superior protocerebrum and the optic lobe (Yu et al., 2010). It projects ventrally, arborizing in the dorsal anterior lobula then follows the great commissure to the contralateral lobula (Yu et al., 2010). It develops from neuroblast VPNp1 (Ito et al., 2013; Yu et al., 2013). There are approximately 24 of these cells per hemisphere (Cachero et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0128543, FlyBase:FBrf0205974, FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0211926, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438]
synonym: "adult fru-Lv neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0128543]
synonym: "adult fruitless Lv2 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0205974]
synonym: "adult fruitless pIP8 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
synonym: "DC neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0190369]
relationship: RO:0002101 FBbt:00047941 ! fasciculates with great commissure
relationship: RO:0013001 FBbt:00003852 ! has synaptic IO in region lobula
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2013-05-23T03:45:07Z" xsd:dateTime

