id: FBbt:00110501
name: adult fruitless pMP-b (female) neuron
def: "Adult female fruitless neuron that develops from neuroblast DM2 (Ren et al., 2016) and has its cell body in the posterior medial protocerebrum (Cachero et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0211926, FlyBase:FBrf0221412, FlyBase:FBrf0221438, FlyBase:FBrf0233706]
comment: Ren et al. (2016) find only 9 pMP-b cells per hemisphere in the DM2 lineage, whereas Cachero et al. (2010) report 22 female pMP-b cells. Cachero et al. (2010) unclear whether this or pMP-a maps to Yu et al. (2010) pMP5 - images look like pMP5 is pMP-b.
