is_obsolete: true
consider: FBbt:00110537

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110537
name: adult fruitless aDT1 neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron with its cell body located dorsomedial to the antennal lobe (Yu et al., 2010). It has ipsilateral arbors in the dorsal medial protocerebrum and bilateral axonal arborization in the subesophageal zone (Yu et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
synonym: "adult fru-mAL neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543, FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0000618 ! has characteristic bilateral
relationship: RO:0013001 FBbt:00007055 ! has synaptic IO in region superior medial protocerebrum
relationship: RO:0013001 FBbt:00110639 ! has synaptic IO in region adult subesophageal zone
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2013-05-23T03:45:07Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110538
name: obsolete adult fruitless aDT4 lineage clone
def: "A clone of neurons in the adult brain that expresses fruitless, whose cell bodies are located ventrolateral to the antennal lobe, usually away from the neuropil. Neurites project dorsally, fasciculating with the mediolateral antennal lobe tract until the fan-shaped body. It then makes a lateral dorsal turn. Neurites form web-like arborizations, likely to be axonal in the ipsi- and contralateral in the posterior region of the superior lateral and intermediate protocerebrum." [FlyBase:FBrf0128543, FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
comment: Obsoleted as we do not maintain terms for groups of cells. Consider using the appropriate neuron term instead.
synonym: "aDT4 clone" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
synonym: "fru-AL clone" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2013-05-23T03:45:07Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: IAO:0000233 "https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/1712" xsd:anyURI
is_obsolete: true
consider: FBbt:00110539

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110539
name: adult fruitless aDT4 neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron with its cell body located ventral lateral to the antennal lobe (Yu et al., 2010). It projects dorsally, via the mediolateral antennal lobe tract until reaching the fan-shaped body, before making a lateral dorsal turn (Yu et al., 2010). Neurites form web-like arborizations, likely to be axonal in the ipsi- and contralateral posterior superior medial protocerebrum (Yu et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
comment: Yu et al. (2010) note that this is similar to TRPA1-expressing neurons in Hamada et al. (2008) - FBrf0205189.
synonym: "aDT4 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
synonym: "fru-AL neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543, FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0000618 ! has characteristic bilateral
relationship: RO:0002101 FBbt:00003984 ! fasciculates with adult mediolateral antennal lobe tract
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00040063 ! sends synaptic output to region posterior superior medial protocerebrum
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2013-05-23T03:45:07Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: IAO:0006011 FBbt:00007333 {xref="FlyBase:FBrf0211884"}

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110540
name: obsolete adult fruitless aDT7 lineage clone
def: "A clone of neurons in the adult brain that expresses fruitless, whose cell bodies are located medioventral to the antennal lobe. A neurite projects through the esophageal foramen posteriorly then ipsilaterally to form axonal arbors in the anterior dorsal region of the lobula. There is also arborization in the posterior brain." [FlyBase:FBrf0128543, FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
comment: Obsoleted as we do not maintain terms for groups of cells. Consider using the appropriate neuron term instead.
synonym: "aDT7 clone" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
synonym: "fru-mcAL BROAD" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0128543]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2013-05-23T03:45:07Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: IAO:0000233 "https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/1712" xsd:anyURI
is_obsolete: true
consider: FBbt:00110541

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110541
name: adult fruitless aDT7 neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron with its cell body located medial ventral to the antennal lobe (Yu et al., 2010). It projects through the esophageal foramen posteriorly then forms axonal arbors in the anterior dorsal region of the ipsilateral lobula (Yu et al., 2010). There is also arborization in the posterior brain (Yu et al., 2010). It develops from the BAmv2 (PSa1) neuroblast (Ito et al., 2013)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0221438]
comment: Yu et al. (2010) note that this type is similar to OA-AL2i2 from Busch et al. (2009) - FBrf0207458.
synonym: "aDT7 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
synonym: "fru-mcAL neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543, FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00003852 ! sends synaptic output to region lobula
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2013-05-23T03:45:07Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: IAO:0006011 FBbt:00110142 {xref="FlyBase:FBrf0211884"}

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110542
name: obsolete adult fruitless aDT8 lineage clone
def: "A clone of neurons in the adult brain that expresses fruitless, whose cell bodies are located medially, between the antennal lobe and the subesophageal zone. A neurite forms dense bilateral arbors in the antennal lobe and the subesophageal zone. A major neurite exits the brain via the posterior subesophageal zone to terminate in the pro-, meso, and metathoracic neuromeres." [FlyBase:FBrf0128543, FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
comment: Obsoleted as we do not maintain terms for groups of cells. Consider using the appropriate neuron term instead.
synonym: "aDT8 clone" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
synonym: "fru-mcAL clone" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2013-05-23T03:45:07Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: IAO:0000233 "https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/1712" xsd:anyURI
is_obsolete: true
consider: FBbt:00047626

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110543
name: obsolete adult fruitless aDT8 neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron with its cell body located medially in the anterior brain, between the antennal lobe (AL) and the subesophageal zone (SEZ) (Yu et al., 2010). It forms dense bilateral arbors in the AL and SEZ (Yu et al., 2010). A major neurite exits the brain via the posterior SEZ to terminate in all three thoracic neuromeres (Yu et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
comment: Obsoleted due to equivalence with DNg34 (Sturner et al., 2025 - FlyBase:FBrf0262850). Yu et al. (2010) note that this type is similar to OA-VPM1 from Busch et al. (2009) - FBrf0207458.
synonym: "fru-mcAL neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543, FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2013-05-23T03:45:07Z" xsd:dateTime
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: FBbt:00047626

