[Term]
id: FBbt:00110552
name: obsolete adult fruitless aSP3 lineage clone
def: "A clone of neurons in the adult brain that expresses fruitless, whose cell bodies are located in a cleft between the anterior optic tubercle and the mushroom body lobe junction. A neurite projects medioventrally in the neuropil forming arborizations in the ventral body and then descends out of the brain. The neurites in the ventral nerve cord terminate in the pro-, meso- and metathoracic neuromere. These are likely to be axonal based on morphology." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
comment: Obsoleted as we do not maintain terms for groups of cells. Consider using the appropriate neuron term instead.
synonym: "aSP3 clone" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
synonym: "fru-aSP3 clone" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0128543]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2013-05-28T04:10:30Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: IAO:0000233 "https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/1712" xsd:anyURI
is_obsolete: true
consider: FBbt:00110553

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110553
name: adult fruitless aSP3 neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron with its soma in the anterior superior protocerebrum, in a cleft between the anterior optic tubercle and the mushroom body lobe junction, and a descending projection that innervates all three thoracic neuromeres (Yu et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
comment: Probably a subtype of aSP3 in Lee et al. (2000) - FBrf0128543, since Yu et al. (2010) map this and other clusters to aSP3. Yu et al. (2010) map this to Kimura et al. (2008) AL4, but Cachero et al. (2010) map AL4 to aSP-d.
synonym: "adult fruitless AL4 neuron" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0205974, FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
relationship: RO:0013001 FBbt:00110174 ! has synaptic IO in region adult prothoracic neuromere
relationship: RO:0013001 FBbt:00110175 ! has synaptic IO in region adult mesothoracic neuromere
relationship: RO:0013001 FBbt:00110176 ! has synaptic IO in region adult metathoracic neuromere
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2013-05-28T04:10:30Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110554
name: obsolete adult fruitless aSP4 (male) lineage clone
def: "A clone of neurons in the adult male brain that expresses fruitless, whose cell bodies are located between the anterior optic tubercle and the ventrolateral protocerebrum, immediately medial to aSP5 lineage clone. A neurite projects ventrally before turning dorsally and extends superficially along the arch to the contralateral hemisphere. Arbors span the lateral junction, lateral and medial ring. Females do not have extensive arbors in the ring structure." [FlyBase:FBrf0128543, FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
comment: These clones were obtained by FLP recombinase, combining a fru[FLP] allele (FBal0248671) and several GAL4 drivers whose expression includes subsets of fruitless neurons (Yu et al., 2010). Obsoleted as this clone only contains one neuron, so is redundant with the respective neuron term.
synonym: "male aSP4 clone" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
synonym: "male fru-aSP3 clone" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0128543]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2013-05-28T04:10:30Z" xsd:dateTime
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: FBbt:00110555

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110555
name: adult fruitless aSP4 (male) neuron
def: "Adult male fruitless-expressing neuron with its cell body in the anterior superior protocerebrum (Yu et al., 2010). It is intrinsic to the lateral protocerebral complex (Yu et al., 2010). The female equivalent of this cell does not have extensive arbors in the ring structure (Yu et al., 2010). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Yu et al., 2010). It is also a dopaminergic cell of the PAL cluster (Xie et al., 2018)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0238545]
synonym: "adult male fruitless aSP3 neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543, FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
synonym: "male aSP4 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
synonym: "male aSP4 neuron of the dopaminergic PAL cluster" NARROW [FlyBase:FBrf0238545]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2013-05-28T04:10:30Z" xsd:dateTime

