[Term]
id: FBbt:00110581
name: adult fruitless aDT-d (male) neuron
def: "Adult male fruitless neuron with its soma in the anterior brain between the antennal lobe and ventrolateral protocerebrum (Cachero et al., 2010). It arborizes ipsilaterally in the superior protocerebrum (Cachero et al., 2010). It has an additional, more ventromedial arbor compared to the female equivalent (Cachero et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0205974, FlyBase:FBrf0211926]
comment: Cachero et al. (2010) map Yu et al. (2010) - FBrf0211884 aSP12 to aSP-j, but Yu et al. (2010) map aSP12 to aDT-d.
