[Term]
id: FBbt:00110849
name: obsolete adult fruitless vAB3 (female) lineage clone
def: "A clone of neurons in the adult female that express fruitless, whose cell bodies are located in the ventral abdominal ganglion. It is composed of ascending neurons that innervate the three leg pairs and the subesophageal zone, terminating in the superior lateral protocerebrum. It is a sexually dimorphic clone: neuron arborization in the subesophageal zone is ventral to male vAB3 clones." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0224028]
comment: Obsoleted as we do not maintain terms for groups of cells. Consider using the appropriate neuron term instead.
synonym: "female Ab clone" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543]
synonym: "female vAB3 clone" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2014-04-22T16:51:35Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: IAO:0000233 "https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/1712" xsd:anyURI
is_obsolete: true
consider: FBbt:00110850

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110850
name: adult fruitless vAB3 (female) neuron
def: "Adult female fruitless neuron with its cell body in the ventral abdominal neuromere and arbors in the vicinity of the fore-, mid- and hindleg afferents (Yu et al., 2010). It has an ascending axonal projection that innervates the subesophageal zone (SEZ) and lateral protocerebrum (Yu et al., 2010). Its SEZ arbors are located more dorsally than those of the male equivalent (Yu et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0224028]
synonym: "female Ab neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543]
synonym: "female vAB3 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2014-04-22T16:51:35Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110851
name: obsolete adult fruitless vAB3 (male) lineage clone
def: "A clone of neurons in the adult male that express fruitless, whose cell bodies are located in the ventral abdominal ganglion. It is composed of ascending neurons that innervate the three leg pairs and the subesophageal zone, terminating in the superior lateral protocerebrum. It is a sexually dimorphic clone: neuron arborization in the subesophageal zone is dorsal to female vAB3 clones." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0224028]
comment: Obsoleted as we do not maintain terms for groups of cells. Consider using the appropriate neuron term instead.
synonym: "male Ab clone" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543]
synonym: "male vAB3 clone" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2014-04-22T16:51:35Z" xsd:dateTime
property_value: IAO:0000233 "https://github.com/FlyBase/drosophila-anatomy-developmental-ontology/issues/1712" xsd:anyURI
is_obsolete: true
consider: FBbt:00110852

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110852
name: adult fruitless vAB3 (male) neuron
def: "Adult male fruitless neuron with its cell body in the ventral abdominal neuromere and arbors in the vicinity of the fore-, mid- and hindleg afferents (Yu et al., 2010). It has an ascending axonal projection that innervates the subesophageal zone (SEZ) and lateral protocerebrum (Yu et al., 2010). Its SEZ arbors are located more ventrally than those of the female equivalent (Yu et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0224028]
synonym: "male Ab neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543]
synonym: "male vAB3 neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2014-04-22T16:51:35Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00110853
name: obsolete adult fruitless pIP10 (male) lineage clone
def: "A clone of neurons in the adult male that express fruitless, whose cell bodies are located in the medial posterior brain. Its neurons extend neurites bilaterally, branching ventrally to innervate the periesophageal region and dorsally to the superior protocerebrum. One process descends to the ventral nerve cord innervating the wing neuropil of the mesothoracic ganglion. This clone is not found in females." [FlyBase:FBrf0212984]
comment: These clones were obtained by FLP recombinase, combining a fru[FLP] allele (FBal0248671) and several GAL4 drivers whose expression includes subsets of fruitless neurons (von Philipsborn et al., 2011). Obsoleted as this clone only contains one neuron, so is redundant with the respective neuron term.
synonym: "adult fruitless pIP10 lineage clone" EXACT []
