relationship: RO:0013008 FBbt:00067369 ! receives synaptic input from neuron adult antennal lobe projection neuron DM1 lPN
relationship: RO:0013008 FBbt:00100381 ! receives synaptic input from neuron adult antennal lobe projection neuron DM4 adPN
