comment: Cited references do not describe adult abdominal neurons. The pattern of cell body pairs seems to belong to the larva, making this synonymous with FBbt:00001584 (which has associated records, this does not as at 26-Jun-18). Adult pattern is somewhat irregular, making this classification irrelevant (Sykes et al., 2004 - FBrf0180031) - https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705.
