relationship: RO:0002216 GO:0007613 ! capable of part of memory
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00100285 ! receives synaptic input in region mushroom body alpha lobe slice 1
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00007054 ! sends synaptic output to region superior lateral protocerebrum
