name: adult fruitless dAB2 neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron with its cell body located laterally on the dorsal abdominal neuromere (Yu et al., 2010). It projects along the ventral midline forming arbors in the pro- and mesothoracic segments close to the terminals of the leg sensory afferents (Yu et al., 2010). It has an ascending projection (Yu et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
comment: No female examples shown by Yu et al. (2010).
