id: FBbt:00111141
name: adult fruitless vPR7 neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron with its cell body in the ventroposterior prothoracic neuromere, close to the midline (Yu et al, 2010). It projects dorsomedially towards the midline and forms arborizations in the medial prothoracic neuromere (Yu et al., 2010). There are approximately 10 of these cells per hemisphere (Lillvis et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0258823]
synonym: "fru-PrMs neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543]
relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0000618 ! has characteristic bilateral
relationship: RO:0013001 FBbt:00110174 ! has synaptic IO in region adult prothoracic neuromere
