[Term]
id: FBbt:00111143
name: adult fruitless vPR8 neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron with its cell body located in the ventromedial region of the prothoracic neuromere, close to the midline (Yu et al., 2010). It projects dorsally and branches, with the lateral branch projecting to the anterior prothoracic neuromere and the medial branch projecting dorsally to the midline (Yu et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
synonym: "fru-PrMs neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543]
