[Term]
id: FBbt:00111145
name: adult fruitless vPR9 neuron
def: "Fruitless neuron with its cell body located on the midline, immediately posterior to the prothoracic neuromere (Yu et al., 2010). It projects dorsally and arborizes in the wing neuropil (Yu et al., 2010; Lillvis et al., 2024). There are approximately 7 of these cells per organism and they are GABAergic (Lillvis et al., 2024). In males, they play a role in courtship song, with different subtypes being involved in pulse and sine song generation (Lillvis et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0258823]
synonym: "fru-Pr neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543]
is_a: FBbt:00052749 ! unpaired neuron
relationship: RO:0002215 GO:0061534 ! capable of gamma-aminobutyric acid secretion, neurotransmission
relationship: RO:0013001 FBbt:00047137 ! has synaptic IO in region wing neuropil
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2015-08-05T17:26:22Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: FBbt:00111146
name: adult fruitless aSG7 neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron with its cell body in the anterior gnathal ganglion (von Phillipsborn et al., 2011). It is a projection neuron that has mainly ipsilateral dendritic arborization in the prow and flange (Sterne et al., 2021). It extends dorsally close to the midline on the ipsilateral side, then has axonal terminals in the superior medial protocerebrum, extending into both hemispheres (Sterne et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0212984, FlyBase:FBrf0251280]
is_a: FBbt:00007392 ! projection neuron
relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0000618 ! has characteristic bilateral
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00040051 ! receives synaptic input in region prow
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00045050 ! receives synaptic input in region flange
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00007055 ! sends synaptic output to region superior medial protocerebrum
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-5948-3092
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2015-08-05T17:26:22Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
