[Term]
id: FBbt:00111160
name: adult fruitless pSG1 neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron with its soma in the ventral subesophageal zone (Yu et al., 2010). It extends along the midline, then makes small arborizations close to the esophageal foramen in both hemispheres, before extending further dorsally, close to the midline (Yu et al., 2010; Sterne et al., 2021). It has both axonal and dendritic processes in the prow and flange, and axonal processes in the superior medial protocerebrum (Sterne et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884, FlyBase:FBrf0251280]
synonym: "fru-SG neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543]
is_a: FBbt:00007392 ! projection neuron
relationship: RO:0000053 PATO:0000618 ! has characteristic bilateral
