[Term]
id: FBbt:00111168
name: adult fruitless aSG3 neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron with its cell body located medially in the ventral gnathal ganglion (Yu et al., 2010). It projects dorsally towards the esophageal foramen (Yu et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
