[Term]
id: FBbt:00111174
name: adult fruitless pMP7 neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron with its cell body located posterior to the protocerebral bridge (Yu et al., 2010). It projects ventrally then laterally along the posterior optic tract to arborize sparsely in the lobula (Yu et al., 2010). Two arborization regions are seen in the brain, one in the posterior subesophageal zone, the other smaller region is located in the lateral subesophageal zone (Yu et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
comment: Yu et al. (2010) map this to Cachero et al. (2010) pMP-a, which does not seem to have optic lobe arbors. Cachero et al. (2010) map to aIP-f, which does not seem to have central brain arbors.
synonym: "fru-P neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543]
relationship: RO:0002101 FBbt:00007427 ! fasciculates with posterior optic commissure
relationship: RO:0013001 FBbt:00003852 ! has synaptic IO in region lobula
