[Term]
id: FBbt:00111196
name: adult fruitless pSP3 neuron
def: "Adult fruitless neuron with its cell body located lateral to the posterior lateral horn (Yu et al., 2010). It projects medially, then bends lateral dorsally (Yu et al., 2010)." [FlyBase:FBrf0211884]
synonym: "fru-P neuron" BROAD [FlyBase:FBrf0128543]
