[Term]
id: FBbt:00111231
name: larval A14g neuron
def: "Larval interneuron of the A14g group that is late-born in the NB4-1 Notch OFF hemilineage (Mark et al., 2021). Its dendrites are located ipsilaterally, and extend anteriorly close to the midline. Its axon also extends anteriorly, on or crossing the midline. It synapses onto the Goro neurons (Ohyama et al., 2015)." [FlyBase:FBrf0228257, FlyBase:FBrf0249021]
