[Term]
id: FBbt:00111330
name: larval metathoracic CCAP neuron
def: "Larval neuron that expresses CCAP (Crustacean cardioactive peptide) (FBgn0039007) and Bursicon (FBgn0038901), and whose soma is located in the ventral metathoracic neuromere, approximately at the height of the VL fascicle (Santos et al., 2007). There are two of these cells per hemineuromere (Santos et al., 2007), one interneuron and one efferent neuron." [FlyBase:FBrf0179185, FlyBase:FBrf0194317, FlyBase:FBrf0201188, FlyBase:FBrf0222256]
