[Term]
id: FBbt:00111334
name: pupal A8-A9 late CCAP neuron
def: "Pupal late CCAP neuron whose soma is located in abdominal neuromeres A8 to A9 (Veverytsa and Allan, 2012). It does not express Bursicon (Zhao et al., 2008; Veverytsa and Allan, 2012). There are three of these cells on each side (Veverytsa and Allan, 2012). It is involved in head eversion during pupal ecdysis (Veverytsa and Allan, 2012)." [FlyBase:FBrf0204350, FlyBase:FBrf0217858]
