[Term]
id: FBbt:00111383
name: adult inferior bridge-superior posterior slope-protocerebral bridge neuron
def: "Interneuron that has dendritic arborizations in the inferior bridge and the superior posterior slope, and axon terminals in the protocerebral bridge (Wolff et al., 2015). Its terminals in the protocerebral bridge do not appear to follow a fixed pattern and it may arborize in one or multiple glomeruli (but not glomerulus 1), which may or may not be adjacent (Wolff et al., 2015). There are 8-12 of these cells per hemisphere (Wolff and Rubin, 2018). It develops from the DM6 neuroblast (Kandimalla et al., 2023)." [FlyBase:FBrf0221742, FlyBase:FBrf0227801, FlyBase:FBrf0240744, FlyBase:FBrf0257023]
synonym: "CCP-VMP-PB neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0221742, FlyBase:FBrf0227801]
synonym: "CLVLP" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0221742]
synonym: "CRVRP" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0221742]
synonym: "CVP neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0221742]
synonym: "IbSps-P neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0240744]
synonym: "IbSpsP neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0240744]
synonym: "inferior bridge-superior posterior slope-protocerebral bridge neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0246888]
synonym: "IS-P" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0240166]
synonym: "PBG2-9.b-IB.s-SPS.s neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0227801, FlyBase:FBrf0240744]
is_a: FBbt:00053396 ! input/output neuron
relationship: BFO:0000050 FBbt:00003624 ! part of adult brain
relationship: RO:0002202 FBbt:00050142 ! develops from neuroblast CM3
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00040050 ! receives synaptic input in region inferior bridge
relationship: RO:0013002 FBbt:00045040 ! receives synaptic input in region superior posterior slope
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00003668 ! sends synaptic output to region protocerebral bridge
