[Term]
id: FBbt:00111390
name: protocerebral bridge 1 glomerulus-fan-shaped body-nodulus 2 dorsal domain neuron
def: "Small field neuron of the central complex with dendritic arbors in a single glomerulus of the protocerebral bridge, presynaptic terminals in fan-shaped body (FB) layers 3 and 4 and mixed terminals in the dorsal domain of contralateral nodulus 2 (Wolff et al., 2015; Hulse et al., 2021). These cells collectively target protocerebral bridge glomeruli 2-9 (Wolff et al., 2015; Hulse et al., 2021). This cell type is unusual among protocerebral bridge-fan-shaped body-nodulus neurons in that FB arbors of this group of neurons form an 8-column, rather than 9-column, pattern (Hulse et al., 2021). There are approximately 40 cells of this type per organism (Hulse et al., 2021). They encode ipsilateral forwards translational motion (Lu et al., 2022)." [FlyBase:FBrf0221742, FlyBase:FBrf0227801, FlyBase:FBrf0252322, FlyBase:FBrf0254510]
comment: Hulse et al. (2021) do not divide PFNd into subtypes.
subset: cur
synonym: "P-F3N2d" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0240166]
synonym: "P-FNd neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0240744]
synonym: "PB-FB-NO subunit 2 dorsal domain neuron" EXACT []
synonym: "PB-FB-NO2 dorsal domain neuron" EXACT []
synonym: "PB1-glomerulus>FBd-NoL2" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0221742]
synonym: "PB1-glomerulus>FBd-NoR2" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0221742]
synonym: "PBG2-9.s-FBl3.b-NO2D.b neuron" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0227801]
is_a: FBbt:00003634 ! adult protocerebral bridge 1 glomerulus-fan-shaped body-nodulus neuron
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00007490 ! sends synaptic output to region fan-shaped body layer 3
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00007491 ! sends synaptic output to region fan-shaped body layer 4
relationship: RO:0013003 FBbt:00111507 ! sends synaptic output to region nodulus 2 dorsal domain
