[Term]
id: FBbt:00111405
name: protocerebral bridge glomerulus 2-fan-shaped body-nodulus 3 posterior domain neuron
def: "Protocerebral bridge 1 glomerulus-fan-shaped body-nodulus 3 posterior domain neuron that targets protocerebral bridge glomerulus 2 (Wolff et al., 2015; Hulse et al., 2021). It arborizes in the lateralmost contralateral column of the fan-shaped body (FB) (Hulse et al., 2021). These cells tend to form more lateral FB arbors than the cells of glomerulus 9, and they contribute to the cryptic teeth of FB layer 1 (Wolff et al., 2015; Hulse et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0221742, FlyBase:FBrf0254510]
comment: Due to identification of an additional protocerebral bridge glomerulus by Wolff et al. (2015), the glomerulus 1 cell of Lin et al. (2013) actually targets glomerulus 2 (no PFN cells target G1).
