[Term]
id: FBbt:00111431
name: protocerebral bridge glomerulus 8-fan-shaped body-round body type a neuron
def: "Adult protocerebral bridge 1 glomerulus-fan-shaped body-round body type a neuron (PFR_a) that targets protocerebral bridge glomerulus 8. It targets the same (ipsilateral) column of the fan-shaped body as PFR_a neurons of the contralateral glomerulus 2, medial to the projection of the glomerulus 1 cell (Lin et al., 2013; Wolff et al., 2015; Hulse et al., 2021). It projects laterally from the fan-shaped body to the contralateral round body (Wolff et al., 2015; Hulse et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0221742, FlyBase:FBrf0227801, FlyBase:FBrf0254510]
comment: PB glomerulus 7 neuron described by Lin et al. (2013) is the glomerulus 8 neuron in Wolff et al. (2015) and later, due to identification of an additional medial PB glomerulus (checked by comparing wiring diagrams). This corresponds to the Hanesch et al. (1989) 'horizontal fiber system' neuron of glomerulus 7 (Wolff et al., 2015).
subset: cur
synonym: "horizontal fiber system neuron pb7" RELATED []
synonym: "PB slice 7-FB layers 3-5-IDFP RB neuron" RELATED []
synonym: "PBR7-FBR4c,d>IDFPL-RB" NARROW [FlyBase:FBrf0221742]
intersection_of: FBbt:00111424 ! adult protocerebral bridge 1 glomerulus-fan-shaped body-round body type a neuron
intersection_of: RO:0013005 FBbt:00003676 ! receives synaptic input throughout protocerebral bridge glomerulus 8
