[Term]
id: FBbt:00111442
name: adult protocerebral bridge glomerulus 1-fan-shaped body layers 4 and 5-unilateral lateral accessory lobe neuron
def: "Adult protocerebral bridge 1 glomerulus-fan-shaped body layers 4 and 5-unilateral lateral accessory lobe (PFL3) neuron with dendritic arbors in protocerebral bridge (PB) glomerulus 1 (Hulse et al., 2021). There are two subtypes, one that targets the ipsilateral fan-shaped body (FB) and PB, and one that targets the contralateral FB and PB (Hulse et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0221742, FlyBase:FBrf0254510]
comment: Originally thought to target both medial PB glomeruli by Lin et al. (2013), Hulse et al. (2021) do not describe a separate 2 glomeruli type. Since glomerulus 1 was not recognized as a distinct glomerulus until Wolff et al. (2015) there may have been confusion over glomerular boundaries in Lin et al. (2013) and this may be a cell type that extends branches into neighboring glomeruli. This type is most likely a mixture of the glomerulus 1 types identified in Hulse et al. (2021).
subset: cur
synonym: "PB 2 glomeruli-FB layers 1 to 4-IDFP HB-medial neuron" EXACT []
synonym: "PB2-glomeruli-FBc,d,e,f>IDFPL-HB-medial" NARROW [FlyBase:FBrf0221742]
