[Term]
id: FBbt:00111451
name: adult protocerebral bridge 1 glomerulus-fan-shaped body layers 4 and 5-bilateral lateral accessory lobe neuron
def: "Small field neuron of the central complex with dendritic arbors in one protocerebral bridge (PB) glomerulus and a column of the fan-shaped body (FB), and axon terminals in the lateral accessory lobes of both hemispheres (Lin et al., 2013; Hulse et al., 2021). Most of its fan-shaped body synapses are found in layers 4 and 5 (Hulse et al., 2021). There is a four-column phase shift between the PB and FB, such that the medial (glomerulus 5) cell in each hemisphere of the PB targets the lateralmost column of the FB (Hulse et al., 2021). These cells collectively target PB glomeruli 1-5 with 1 or 2 cells per glomerulus (Hulse et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0221742, FlyBase:FBrf0254510]
subset: cur
synonym: "PB 1 glomerulus-FB layers 1 to 4-bilateral IDFP HB-medial neuron" EXACT []
