[Term]
id: FBbt:00111458
name: protocerebral bridge glomerulus 1-fan-shaped body-ventral gall surround neuron
def: "Adult protocerebral bridge 1 glomerulus-fan-shaped body-ventral gall surround (PFGs) neuron that targets protocerebral bridge (PB) glomerulus 1. It targets the lateralmost fan-shaped body (FB) column, but this projection is ipsilateral relative to the PB arbor, breaking the pattern formed by the other PFGs neurons (Hulse et al., 2021). It projects to the ventral gall surround in the same hemisphere as its PB and FB arbors, unlike other PFGs cells (Hulse et al., 2021)." [FlyBase:FBrf0221742, FlyBase:FBrf0227801, FlyBase:FBrf0254510]
comment: The 'glomerulus 1' (biglomerular) cell of Lin et al. (2013) probably corresponds to the G1 cell of Wolff et al. (2015) due to its identification as a biglomerular type.
subset: cur
synonym: "PB slice 1-FB layers 3 and 6-ventral gall neuron" EXACT []
synonym: "PBR1,L1-FBL4b,d>IDFPL-DSB" NARROW [FlyBase:FBrf0221742]
intersection_of: FBbt:00111457 ! protocerebral bridge 1 glomerulus-fan-shaped body-ventral gall surround neuron
intersection_of: RO:0013005 FBbt:00111511 ! receives synaptic input throughout protocerebral bridge glomerulus 1
