[Term]
id: FBbt:00111512
name: protocerebral bridge 1 glomerulus-fan-shaped body-nodulus 2 ventral domain neuron
def: "Small field neuron of the central complex with dendritic arbors in a single glomerulus of the protocerebral bridge, presynaptic terminals in fan-shaped body layer 3 and mixed terminals in the ventral domain of contralateral nodulus 2 (Wolff et al., 2015; Hulse et al., 2021). These cells collectively target protocerebral bridge glomeruli 2-9 (Wolff et al., 2015; Hulse et al., 2021). There are approximately 20 cells of this type per organism (Hulse et al., 2021). They encode contralateral backwards translational motion (Lu et al., 2022)." [FlyBase:FBrf0227801, FlyBase:FBrf0252322, FlyBase:FBrf0254510]
comment: Hulse et al. (2021) do not divide PFNv into subtypes.
subset: cur
