[Term]
id: FBbt:00111517
name: adult pheromone projection neuron 1
def: "Adult ascending neuron that is activated downstream of female pheromone-sensing neurons (Kallman et al., 2015). Its soma is located in the dorsal part of the cell body rind of the metathoracic neuromere (Kallman et al., 2015). It arborizes in all leg and wing neuropils and projects to the ventrolateral protocerebrum (Kallman et al., 2015). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Kallman et al., 2015)." [FlyBase:FBrf0230436]
comment: Not fru+ or sexually dimorphic despite involvement in courtship behavior in the male (not tested in female) (Kallman et al., 2015).
