name: adult clamp neuron 062
def: "Adult neuron with its soma in the anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum (Duistermars et al., 2018; Tao et al., 2024). It crosses the midline along an anterior–posterior curve and forms characteristic dorsal–ventral branches (Tao et al., 2024). It has substantial synapsing in the clamp (Scheffer et al., 2020). Its activity induces wing threat behavior in males and females (Duistermars et al., 2018; Tao et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0241077, FlyBase:FBrf0246888, FlyBase:FBrf0260844]
