[Term]
id: FBbt:20001434
name: adult wedge-bilateral lateral accessory lobe neuron
def: "Adult neuron that has postsynaptic sites in the ipsilateral wedge and lateral accessory lobe and presynaptic sites in the contralateral lateral accessory lobe (Franconville et al., 2018). There is one of these cells per hemisphere and it is GABAergic (Okubo et al., 2020). It responds to wind in a direction-sensitive manner (Okubo et al., 2020). It develops from neuroblast CP2 (Kandimalla et al., 2023)." [FlyBase:FBrf0240166, FlyBase:FBrf0246694, FlyBase:FBrf0254510, FlyBase:FBrf0257023]
