name: adult posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum neuron 046
def: "Adult interneuron with its soma near to the gall (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It belongs to the VLPa2 hemilineage (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024). It receives input in the gnathal ganglion and sends output to the anterior ventrolateral protocerebrum in both hemispheres (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is GABA (Eckstein et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). There are approximately 5-7 of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025)." [FlyBase:FBrf0246888, FlyBase:FBrf0259490, FlyBase:FBrf0260535, FlyBase:FBrf0260546, FlyBase:FBrf0262545]
