[Term]
id: FBbt:20004126
name: obsolete adult medulla-contralateral medulla neuron MeVPMe10
def: "Adult medulla-contralateral medulla neuron of the MeVPMe10 group (Nern et al., 2025). It belongs to the VPNl&d1 lateral hemilineage (Nern et al., 2025). It receives input in the ipsilateral medulla layer M6 and medulla serpentine layer, and the contralateral medulla layer M6 and medulla serpentine layer (Nern et al., 2025). It sends output to the contralateral medulla layer M6 and medulla serpentine layer (Nern et al., 2025). There are approximately 2 of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025)." [FlyBase:FBrf0260535, FlyBase:FBrf0260546, FlyBase:FBrf0262545]
comment: Cell type identified in multiple EM datasets (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). Obsoleted as mapped to MeMe-DRA in Bates et al. (2025) - doi:10.1101/2025.07.31.667571.
synonym: "MeMe_e10" RELATED [FlyBase:FBrf0260535, FlyBase:FBrf0262545]
