def: "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron of the CB0579 group, with its soma in the brain, ventral to the antennal mechanosensory and motor center (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It is a putative embryonic-born neuron (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has postsynapses in the prow, the contralateral flange and the ipsilateral flange (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has presynapses in the prow and the ipsilateral flange (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024). There are approximately 2 of these cells per organism (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024)." [FlyBase:FBrf0259490, FlyBase:FBrf0260535, FlyBase:FBrf0260546]
comment: FlyWire CB0579 mapped to tulip in Shiu et al. (2024) - FBrf0260565 supplement. CB0579 was an uncharacterized putative cell type from Schlegel et al. (2024), based on FlyWire v783 (FAFB) data (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024).
synonym: "CB0579" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0260535]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5633-1314
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2024-02-05T12:00:00Z" xsd:dateTime
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: FBbt:00051952

[Term]
id: FBbt:20004334
name: adult medulla visual projection neuron MeVPOL1
def: "Adult interneuron with its soma ventral to the lateral horn (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). In the ipsilateral optic lobe, it receives input mainly in layers M4 and M8, from around 300 columns each (Nern et al., 2025). In the contralateral optic lobe, it projects to the vicinity of the inner optic chiasm, then innervates medulla layers M8 and M10, lobula layers 2-3 and lobula plate layer 1, where it is mainly presynaptic in around 50 columns of each (Nern et al., 2025). It does not have substantial synapsing outside of the optic lobes (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine (Eckstein et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). There is one of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025)." [FlyBase:FBrf0259490, FlyBase:FBrf0260535, FlyBase:FBrf0260546, FlyBase:FBrf0262545]
comment: Cell type from Schlegel et al. (2024), based on FlyWire v783 (FAFB) data (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024), identified at light level by Nern et al. (2025). Soma location is based on the closest annotated neuropil region in FlyWire.
synonym: "adult MeMe_e13 neuron" EXACT []
synonym: "CB0592" EXACT []
synonym: "MeMe_e13" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0260535, FlyBase:FBrf0262545]
