name: obsolete adult CB3785 neuron
def: "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron with its soma in the central brain, lateral to the lateral horn. It belongs to the SLPa&l1_lateral hemilineage. It has presynapses in the ipsilateral posterior lateral protocerebrum, the ipsilateral inferior posterior slope, the ipsilateral posterior ventrolateral protocerebrum and the ipsilateral lateral accessory lobe. It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral inferior posterior slope and the ipsilateral posterior lateral protocerebrum. Its predicted neurotransmitter is glutamate." [FlyBase:FBrf0259490, FlyBase:FBrf0260535, FlyBase:FBrf0260546]
comment: Uncharacterized putative cell type from Schlegel et al. (2024), based on FlyWire v783 (FAFB) data (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024). Soma locations are based on the closest annotated neuropil region. Pre- or post-synapse locations are the fewest regions that collectively contain at least 80 percent of all pre- or post-synapses of these neurons in FlyWire. Neurotransmitter predictions are from Eckstein et al. (2024). Other annotations are based on annotations in FlyWire and are available in the supplemental material of Schlegel et al. (2024). Obsoleted as all FlyWire individuals of this type have been retyped as WED037.
synonym: "CB3785" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0260535]
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-1373-1705
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5633-1314
property_value: http://purl.org/dc/terms/date "2024-02-05T12:00:00Z" xsd:dateTime
is_obsolete: true
replaced_by: FBbt:20003587

[Term]
id: FBbt:20007212
name: obsolete adult CB3795 neuron
def: "Adult brain-intrinsic neuron with its soma in the central brain, lateral to the mushroom body vertical lobe. It belongs to the LHd1 hemilineage. It has presynapses in the ipsilateral superior lateral protocerebrum and the ipsilateral lateral horn. It has postsynapses in the ipsilateral lateral horn. Its predicted neurotransmitter is acetylcholine." [FlyBase:FBrf0259490, FlyBase:FBrf0260535, FlyBase:FBrf0260546]
comment: Uncharacterized putative cell type from Schlegel et al. (2024), based on FlyWire v783 (FAFB) data (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024). Soma locations are based on the closest annotated neuropil region. Pre- or post-synapse locations are the fewest regions that collectively contain at least 80 percent of all pre- or post-synapses of these neurons in FlyWire. Neurotransmitter predictions are from Eckstein et al. (2024). Other annotations are based on annotations in FlyWire and are available in the supplemental material of Schlegel et al. (2024). Obsoleted as all FlyWire individuals of this type have been retyped as LHAD3a10.
synonym: "CB3795" EXACT [FlyBase:FBrf0260535]
