[Term]
id: FBbt:20007240
name: adult central medulla neuron Cm12
def: "Adult optic-lobe-intrinsic neuron with its soma ventral-lateral to the lateral horn (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). It has its pre- and post-synapses restricted to the ipsilateral medulla (Schlegel et al., 2024; Dorkenwald et al., 2024). Its predicted neurotransmitter is GABA (Eckstein et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). It has a tangential arborization pattern in the central layers of the medulla (Nern et al., 2025). There are approximately 35 of these cells per hemisphere (Dorkenwald et al., 2024; Schlegel et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025)." [FlyBase:FBrf0259490, FlyBase:FBrf0260535, FlyBase:FBrf0260545, FlyBase:FBrf0260546, FlyBase:FBrf0262545]
