def: "Adult proximal medullary amacrine neuron with its soma in the optic lobe (Nern et al., 2025). It has its pre- and post-synapses in medulla layers M9-M10, spanning around 100 columns (Nern et al., 2025). Its predicted neurotransmitter is GABA (Eckstein et al., 2024; Nern et al., 2025). There are approximately 15 of these cells per hemisphere (Nern et al., 2025)." [FlyBase:FBrf0259490, FlyBase:FBrf0260535, FlyBase:FBrf0260545, FlyBase:FBrf0260546, FlyBase:FBrf0262545]
