[Typedef]
id: has_function_in
name: obsolete has_function_in
def: "X has function Y if and only if X is the bearer of some function that is realized by only Y" [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7073-9172]
comment: This relation has been replaced by capable_of (RO:0002215).
is_obsolete: true

[Typedef]
id: has_function_in_part_of
name: obsolete has_function_in_part_of
def: "X has function in part of Y if and only if x is the bearer of some function that is realized by only part of some Y" [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7073-9172]
comment: This relation has been replaced by capable_of_part_of (RO:0002215).
is_obsolete: true

[Typedef]
id: releases_neurotransmitter
name: obsolete releases_neurotransmitter
def: "Instance level: x releases_neurotransmitter y iff:: for some 'neurotransmitter secretion ; GO:0007269' (ns), x has_function_in ns AND ns has_participant y." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7073-9172]
comment: Relation between a neuron and the neurotransmitter it releases. Made obsolete as no longer in use and not used outside fbbt. Please use a capable_of relationship to some subclass of GO:0007269
is_obsolete: true

[Typedef]
id: secretes_hormone
name: obsolete secretes_hormone
def: "Instance level: x secretes_hormone y iff:: for some 'hormone secretion ; GO:0046879' (hs), x has_function_in hs AND hs has_participant y." [https://orcid.org/0000-0002-7073-9172]
comment: Relation between a secretory cell or gland and the hormone it secretes. Made obsolete as no longer in use and not used outside fbbt. Please use a capable_of relationships to some relevant GO term for hormone secretion. If GO doesn't have a term for secretion of the hormone in querstion, please request one.
is_obsolete: true

